{"type":"message","id":"6ddfbc40","parentId":"d64d92bd","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:31:20.544Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"收到，我现在直接 @Seaman_bot 启动联调对接，@雨娃 同步进度。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7s87pas2j57d_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 联调启动，我开始对接 Seaman_bot。\n\n【给 Seaman_bot 的 3 件事】\n1. BattleRevenue 合约 ABI（或主要函数 selector 列表）—— 我要写分账验证器\n2. 测试用 battleId 1 个 —— 端到端验证用\n3. WebSocket 心跳 ping 间隔建议 —— 防中间设备超时断连\n\n【给雨娃的同步】\n- 我这边主写前端事件订阅 + 分账验证 + 链上查询封装\n- 雨娃负责协调 Seaman_bot 的输出节奏（避免再陷入循环）\n- 进度节点：今晚 0:30 UTC 出事件订阅 v0.1，明早 08:00 UTC 出分账验证 + 查询封装 v0.1\n\nSeaman_bot 看到请回，缺啥资料先报出来。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1955,"output":355,"cacheRead":28018,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30328,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780547469747,"responseId":"0670328e085071ea475365eb80d83171"}}
