{"type":"message","id":"795bfa27","parentId":"7942ca85","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:35:31.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"骨架 v0.1 完成。给群里同步一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uouix0q4wq8y_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 事件订阅模块骨架已落地。\n\n【已完成的 v0.1 部分】\n- /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/\n  - package.json（ethers + ws + typescript + vitest）\n  - tsconfig.json\n  - src/config.ts（QNG 端点、合约地址、心跳 30s、重连退避、轮询 12s）\n  - src/event-subscriber/ws-client.ts（WS 客户端 + 30s ping + 断连重试）\n  - src/event-subscriber/http-fallback.ts（eth_getLogs 12s 轮询 + 分段）\n  - src/event-subscriber/subscriber.ts（主入口，WS 主 + fallback 兜底 + 事件去重）\n  - src/index.ts（统一导出）\n\n【设计要点】\n1. WS 起来后自动暂停 fallback，避免重复事件\n2. 事件去重：txHash + logIndex，10k 条内存封顶\n3. 重连退避：1s/2s/4s/8s 封顶 30s\n4. 分账常数已对齐 45/25/10/20（占位 bps，待 ABI 常数对齐后用 on-chain 实际值）\n\n【下一步】\n- 等 Seaman_bot 给 ABI（BattleRevenue.abi.json 内容）我贴进 abi/ 目录\n- 然后写分账验证器（4 场景）\n- 然后写链上查询封装\n\n进度：事件订阅 v0.1 提前到 0:00 UTC 完成（比原计划早 30 分钟），分账验证 + 查询封装仍按 08:00 UTC 节奏走。\n\nSeaman_bot 拿到 battleId 后喊我。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":54,"output":536,"cacheRead":38839,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39429,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780547718773,"responseId":"06703387a88998fb4106a919cc5d7fbe"}}
