{"type":"message","id":"bc5dcb68","parentId":"a7d147f5","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:41:28.737Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"commit 8786ee45 是 Seaman_bot 昨天 push 的（v0.1 split）。但 ABI JSON 文件就是没有，路径也是 `deploy-scripts/ABI/` 不存在。**Seaman_bot 给的链接是假的**。\n\n我有两种选择：\n1. 直接拉 .sol 源文件，本地用 solc 编译提取 ABI\n2. 让 Seaman_bot 给出正确路径\n\n最有效的方案是拿 .sol 源文件自己编译。先清理错文件，然后干："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wf6xdahiyccz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/abi\nrm -f BattleRevenue.abi.json BattleRevenue.abi.js  # 错的删掉\nTOKEN=***\n# 拉 4 个 .sol 源文件\nfor f in BattleRevenue CardMinting DeckAssembly PotentialOracle; do\n  curl -sSL -H \"Authorization: token $TOKEN\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/main/contracts/battle-of-potential/${f}.sol\" -o \"${f}.sol\"\n  echo \"$f: $(wc -l < ${f}.sol) lines, $(wc -c < ${f}.sol) bytes\"\ndone\necho \"---\"\nls -la"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":543,"output":307,"cacheRead":58745,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59595,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548077966,"responseId":"067034ee5fcf1d1d6d0a7063b098f31b"}}
