{"type":"message","id":"587e51e3","parentId":"3603f98c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:44:51.574Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ABI 函数比 Seaman_bot 之前贴的**多了 4 个 BPS 常量**：`AMBASSADOR_BPS`、`PUBLIC_POOL_BPS`、`REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS`、`RESERVE_BPS`。**不是简单的 4 权分账（45/25/10/20）**——而是**7 权**。我必须查源确认："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kjogyvtegfxj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration\ngrep -E \"BPS|REVENUE|share\" abi/BattleRevenue.sol | head -50"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":500,"output":141,"cacheRead":68348,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68989,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548285837,"responseId":"067035be9b152616aab417c419912a58"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0a0ce44","parentId":"587e51e3","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:44:51.709Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kjogyvtegfxj_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"uint16 public constant CREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500;    // 创作者 45%\n    uint16 public constant EDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500;       // 编排者 25%\n    uint16 public constant REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800;    // 审查员 8%\n    uint16 public constant PUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800;       // 公共池 8%\n    uint16 public constant PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500;      // 系统 5%\n    uint16 public constant AMBASSADOR_BPS = 500;       // 大使 5%\n    uint16 public constant RESERVE_BPS = 400;           // 储备 4%\n        uint8 shareType; // 1=creator, 2=edge, 3=reviewer, 4=public, 5=platform, 6=ambassador, 7=reserve\n        uint8 indexed shareType,\n        uint256 creatorPool = totalPool * CREATOR_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n            uint256 share = creatorPool * cardPotential / totalPotential;\n            pendingRevenue[creator] += share;\n            _recordDistribution(battleId, winnerCards[i], creator, share, 1);\n        uint256 edgePool = totalPool * EDGE_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 reviewerAmount = totalPool * REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 publicAmount = totalPool * PUBLIC_POOL_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 platformAmount = totalPool * PLATFORM_FEE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 ambassadorAmount = totalPool * AMBASSADOR_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 reserveAmount = totalPool * RESERVE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint8 shareType\n            shareType: shareType\n        emit RevenueDistributed(battleId, shareType, recipient, nodeId, amount);"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":41,"aggregated":"uint16 public constant CREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500;    // 创作者 45%\n    uint16 public constant EDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500;       // 编排者 25%\n    uint16 public constant REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800;    // 审查员 8%\n    uint16 public constant PUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800;       // 公共池 8%\n    uint16 public constant PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500;      // 系统 5%\n    uint16 public constant AMBASSADOR_BPS = 500;       // 大使 5%\n    uint16 public constant RESERVE_BPS = 400;           // 储备 4%\n        uint8 shareType; // 1=creator, 2=edge, 3=reviewer, 4=public, 5=platform, 6=ambassador, 7=reserve\n        uint8 indexed shareType,\n        uint256 creatorPool = totalPool * CREATOR_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n            uint256 share = creatorPool * cardPotential / totalPotential;\n            pendingRevenue[creator] += share;\n            _recordDistribution(battleId, winnerCards[i], creator, share, 1);\n        uint256 edgePool = totalPool * EDGE_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 reviewerAmount = totalPool * REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 publicAmount = totalPool * PUBLIC_POOL_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 platformAmount = totalPool * PLATFORM_FEE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 ambassadorAmount = totalPool * AMBASSADOR_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 reserveAmount = totalPool * RESERVE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint8 shareType\n            shareType: shareType\n        emit RevenueDistributed(battleId, shareType, recipient, nodeId, amount);","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548291702}}
{"type":"message","id":"58741f13","parentId":"f0a0ce44","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:06.715Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**关键发现**：分账是 **7 权**（不是 Seaman_bot 之前说的 4 权）：\n- 创作者 45%\n- 编排者 25%\n- 审查员 8%\n- 公共池 8%\n- 平台费 5%\n- 大使 5%\n- 储备 4%\n\n**45+25+8+8+5+5+4 = 100%** ✓\n\n而且创作者 45% 还要**再按 cardPotential / totalPotential 细分给具体创作者**。这跟 Seaman_bot 之前发的\"45/25/10/20\"完全是两回事。**Seaman_bot 给的资料是错的。**\n\n更新验证器，引入真实 ABI，同时给群里同步这个发现："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iz2n7sy3qus8_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"  // 分账比例（基点 bps，总和 10000 = 100%）\n  // 与合约 CREATOR_SHARE_BPS / EDGE_SHARE_BPS / PLATFORM_FEE_BPS / WINNER_POOL_BPS 对齐\n  SHARE_BPS: {\n    CREATOR: 4500,    // 45%  — 牌组创作者\n    EDGE: 2500,       // 25%  — 边权势位\n    PLATFORM: 1000,   // 10%  — 平台费\n    WINNER_POOL: 2000, // 20% — 赢家池\n  },\n} as const;","newText":"  // 分账比例（基点 bps，总和 10000 = 100%）\n  // 从 .sol 源编译出的 ABI 提取，7 权分账：\n  //   CREATOR 45% + EDGE 25% + REVIEWER 8% + PUBLIC 8% + PLATFORM 5% + AMBASSADOR 5% + RESERVE 4% = 100%\n  // 注意：CREATOR 45% 还要再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分给具体创作者\n  SHARE_BPS: {\n    CREATOR: 4500,     // 45% — 牌组创作者（再细分）\n    EDGE: 2500,        // 25% — 编排者\n    REVIEWER: 800,     //  8% — 审查员\n    PUBLIC_POOL: 800,  //  8% — 公共池\n    PLATFORM: 500,     //  5% — 系统费\n    AMBASSADOR: 500,   //  5% — 大使\n    RESERVE: 400,      //  4% — 储备\n  },\n\n  // shareType 编号（与合约 _recordDistribution 调用一致）\n  SHARE_TYPE: {\n    CREATOR: 1,\n    EDGE: 2,\n    REVIEWER: 3,\n    PUBLIC_POOL: 4,\n    PLATFORM: 5,\n    AMBASSADOR: 6,\n    RESERVE: 7,\n  },\n} as const;"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":449,"output":719,"cacheRead":68975,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70143,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548291711,"responseId":"067035c4e29f6a038fdb8d58b7ee9f63"}}
