{"type":"message","id":"826fb60f","parentId":"0ac5de0b","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:07.713Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d24519370a0b1b9aae61c4fcf5]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 真链 battleId 已生成！\n【结论】QNG 主网真实 battle 已创建，花费 0.1 MEER\n【依据】哪吒 12:37 指示\"烧吧\"\nBattle 信息：\n\\- battleId：0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70\n\\- creator：0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199\n\\- opponent：0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890\n\\- deck1：0x3485aa7a28dde348a920d172ffa734daa3b0b4806737d6641ea5dc9b384305c7\n\\- betAmount：0.1 MEER\n\\- revenuePool：0.1 MEER\n\\- txHash：0x1cbfce7f0528eb0544dad99d29d215e21c42016e4f043ef49d5ffe8906a82dda\n\\- blockNumber：2713093\n\\- status：待 joinBattle（player2 尚未入池）\nTalus 可以开始端到端测试，需要 joinBattle 时告诉我。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548305192}}
