{"type":"message","id":"ee6ecccb","parentId":"540afdb2","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:29.021Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃和我直接对接了，且 Seaman_bot 真链 battleId 已生成。**关键点**：我在 ABI 编译里发现了**重大分账架构问题**——Seaman_bot 之前给的\"45/25/10/20\"是错的，实际是**7 权分账（45/25/8/8/5/5/4）**。这是必须立刻同步的关键事实。\n\n整理状态后给雨娃一次性同步："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uv0d9z1ceu9k_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 收到真链 battleId，0x67c1...1b70。但先暂停 joinBattle，有重大发现：\n\n【🚨 分账架构修正 — 7 权不是 4 权】\n我编译 .sol 源（github zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 main 分支 contracts/battle-of-potential/）后发现的真实分账：\n- CREATOR 45%（还要再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分给具体创作者）\n- EDGE 25%\n- REVIEWER 8%\n- PUBLIC_POOL 8%\n- PLATFORM 5%\n- AMBASSADOR 5%\n- RESERVE 4%\n- 合计 100% ✓\n\n**Seaman_bot 之前给的\"45/25/10/20\"是错的**（少 3 项，且比例不准）\n\n【合约地址对应】\nBattleRevenue 合约确实在 QNG 主网 0xd578...e4f6\n- battleId 0x67c1...1b70 已上链 (block 2713093, tx 0x1cbf...2dda)\n- revenuePool 0.1 MEER\n\n【ABI 现状】\n- Seaman_bot 报的路径 `deploy-scripts/ABI/` 不存在（404）\n- 真路径是 `contracts/battle-of-potential/*.sol`\n- 4 个 ABI 我已经本地 solc 0.8.20 + OZ 5.0.2 编译完成\n- 文件位置: /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/abi/\n  - BattleRevenue.abi.json (34 items, 含 27 函数 + 5 事件)\n  - CardMinting.abi.json (22)\n  - DeckAssembly.abi.json (12)\n  - PotentialOracle.abi.json (21)\n\n【ABI 函数差异 — 4 个新发现的常量】\n- AMBASSADOR_BPS\n- PUBLIC_POOL_BPS\n- REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS\n- RESERVE_BPS\nSeaman_bot 之前漏报这 4 个\n\n【我接下来的事】\n1. 重写分账验证器 — 7 个 shareType 都要覆盖\n2. 重写 mock 测试 — 用真实 7 权比例\n3. 接 React 前端 — 暖白底 #faf9f7\n4. 等雨娃/Seaman_bot 决定 joinBattle 时机\n\n【joinBattle 时机】\n建议等 v0.2 验证器更新完再 join，免得端到端测试时验证器对不上链上分账事件。\n\n雨娃决定。Seaman_bot 真实 battleId 收到，谢谢哪吒的 0.1 MEER。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":18195,"output":790,"cacheRead":53234,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72219,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548307719,"responseId":"067035d4fc764e7418d0abee882d2287"}}
