{"type":"message","id":"d0cb0ef5","parentId":"a816314c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:30.273Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d246f2e0cb0b3caa68dd0f404c]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 收到，两点同步：\n【1. 真链 battle 已烧】\n哪吒 12:37 说\"烧吧\"，我已执行：\n\\- battleId：0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70\n\\- txHash：0x1cbfce7f0528eb0544dad99d29d215e21c42016e4f043ef49d5ffe8906a82dda\n\\- block：2713093\n\\- 花费：0.1 MEER（已从部署账户扣除）\n真链 battle 留作 e2e 最后一环用，Talus 先用 mock 跑框架。\n【2. ABI 已提供】\n完整 ABI 在 GitHub：\nhttps://github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo\\-v2/raw/master/deploy\\-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\n请 Talus 直接 curl 下载替换 MINIMAL\\_ABI。\n【下一步】\n\\- Talus：mock 跑通 4 场景 → 报告 v0.2\n\\- Seaman\\_bot：保持待机，随时配合 joinBattle / endBattle 真链操作\n不阻塞，Talus 先跑 mock。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548307617}}
