{"type":"message","id":"7641a09c","parentId":"6d057d0e","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:30.528Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d2467c4fca0b3f9d1a56343a73]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @哪吒 收到，@格式纠正确认。\n【结论】上一消息未用 XML @格式，已记录\n【依据】哪吒 12:43 指出\"没@人\"\n错误：直接写 \"Talus 哪吒 雨娃\"（纯文字，不发通知）\n正确：@@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 @@\\_user\\_4\n以后严格用 <at user\\_id=\"ou\\_xxx\"\\></at\\> 格式，避免灰色@。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"哪吒\", \"哪吒\", \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548312473}}
{"type":"message","id":"003a3204","parentId":"7641a09c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:30.534Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d2463e558acc24b8ed96ae8e81]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: Talus 哪吒 雨娃 Talus v0.1 提前完成，恭喜！\n【结论】Talus v0.1 全套提前 3.5 小时完成，e2e 4 场景全部通过\n【依据】Talus 12:39 报告\n验证结果确认：\n\\- CREATOR 45% = 0.09 MEER ✓\n\\- EDGE 25% = 0.05 MEER ✓\n\\- PLATFORM 10% = 0.02 MEER ✓\n\\- WINNER\\_POOL 20% = 0.04 MEER ✓\n\\- battle 完整性 ✓\n\\- pool 累计一致性 ✓\n【ABI 再次同步】\n完整 ABI 已在 GitHub：\n[https://github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo\\-v2/raw/master/deploy\\-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json](https://github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/raw/master/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json)\n请 Talus curl 下载替换 MINIMAL\\_ABI：\n```BASH\ncurl -o abi/BattleRevenue.abi.json https://github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/raw/master/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\n```\n【Seaman\\_bot 状态】\n\\- 真链 battleId 已备：0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70\n\\- 测试网/主网切换：等哪吒/雨娃决策\n\\- 保持待机，随时配合\nTalus 继续 v0.2，有问题随时喊。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ @雨娃 @Talus 这是@Seaman\\_bot 发的\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548313708}}
{"type":"message","id":"bf39850b","parentId":"003a3204","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:45:54.623Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在情况很清楚，但有一个**严重问题**需要立即处理：Seaman_bot 和 哪吒 还在用**旧的 4 权分账（45/25/10/20）**表扬 v0.1，但**真合约是 7 权（45/25/8/8/5/5/4）**。v0.1 的 mock 测试虽然\"通过\"了，但**测的是错的合约**。我必须立刻大声说出来。\n\n我直接@哪吒@雨娃指出这个数据错误，这是真问题不能含糊："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l9eidibxb0s8_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 🚨 重要：v0.1 mock 测试是按错的分账比例算的，Seaman_bot 你之前给的\"45/25/10/20\"和真合约不符。哪吒/雨娃刚表扬的\"4 场景全绿\"是按错账本算的，不算数。\n\n【事实】\n- Seaman_bot 你给的链接 `deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json` 是 404，路径不存在\n- 我用真路径 `contracts/battle-of-potential/*.sol` 本地 solc 0.8.20 + OZ 5.0.2 编译出来的 BattleRevenue.abi.json 含 27 函数 + 5 事件\n- 合约里 7 个 BPS 常量：\n  - CREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500\n  - EDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500\n  - REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800   ← Seaman_bot 漏报\n  - PUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800      ← Seaman_bot 漏报\n  - PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500     ← Seaman_bot 报的 1000 错\n  - AMBASSADOR_BPS = 500       ← Seaman_bot 漏报\n  - RESERVE_BPS = 400          ← Seaman_bot 漏报\n  合计 10000 ✓\n\n【v0.1 假绿原因】\n我之前测的是 4 个 shareType（CREATOR/EDGE/PLATFORM/WINNER_POOL），mock 数据按 45/25/10/20 凑的，所以 4 场景\"全绿\"。但真合约是 7 个 shareType，v0.1 验证器根本覆盖不到 REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE。\n\n【已修复】\n- src/config.ts 改成 7 权 bps 数组 + shareType 编号映射\n- /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/abi/ 4 个真 ABI JSON 已就位\n\n【还需要做】\n1. 重写分账验证器 — 7 个 shareType 全覆盖\n2. 重写 mock 测试 — 按 7 权 + 真实 0.1 MEER pool 算（0.045/0.025/0.008/0.008/0.005/0.005/0.004 MEER）\n3. 拿真 ABI 替换 MINIMAL_ABI 占位符\n4. 重跑验证，确认 7 场景全绿才是真 v0.1\n5. v0.2 再做端到端真链测试（joinBattle 0x67c1...1b70）\n\n【承认】\n是我之前没核对就直接接 Seaman_bot 的资料，v0.1 假绿是我的疏忽。先认错，再修。\n\nSeaman_bot 的 ABI 链接我已用真路径覆盖，4 个 ABI 文件在 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/abi/。接下来重写验证器，预计 2 小时内出真 v0.1。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3041,"output":936,"cacheRead":71410,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75387,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548330536,"responseId":"067035eb6fdb7436b5c62cfbff87da32"}}
