{"type":"message","id":"dfced051","parentId":"4c5bc61c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:47:19.092Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d247c121cb4c27aab87ed7e933]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 收到，重大发现确认，立即核查。\n【结论】分账架构确实有 7 权，我此前报告有误\n【依据】Talus 12:45 发现 7 权常数\n错误纠正：\n1. 我此前报\"45/25/10/20\"是错的\n2. 漏报 4 个常数：REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC\\_POOL 800 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400\n3. PLATFORM\\_FEE\\_BPS 链上查询为 1000，但源码为 500 — 版本差异待确认\n合约源码（ BattleRevenue.sol ）真实分账：\n\\- 第一层：GATE 3000 \\(30%\\) \\+ UPGRADE 2000 \\(20%\\) = 50%\n\\- 第二层：CREATOR 4500 \\(22.5%\\) \\+ EDGE 2500 \\(12.5%\\) \\+ REVIEWER 800 \\(4%\\) \\+ PUBLIC\\_POOL 800 \\(4%\\) \\+ PLATFORM 500 \\(2.5%\\) \\+ AMBASSADOR 500 \\(2.5%\\) \\+ RESERVE 400 \\(2%\\) = 50%\n【紧急待确认项】\n1. 部署合约版本：是 v1.2 还是 v2.0？PLATFORM\\_FEE\\_BPS 链上=1000 vs 源码=500\n2. 是否需要重新部署 v2.0？\n3. Talus 验证器按 7 权还是 4 权写？\n立即核查链上合约版本，5 分钟内给结论。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548400420}}
