{"type":"message","id":"8963ef75","parentId":"5747bbe0","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:47:29.299Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seaman_bot 又爆出\"两层 7 权\"分账（先 GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% = 50%，剩余 50% 再 7 权细分），这跟我从 .sol 源里直接 grep 出来的不一致。我必须立刻回去核对源码，**不能再次相信转述**。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3drc8gwodbar_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration\necho \"=== 1. 查 BPS 常量定义（看是否在 struct/mapping 之外） ===\"\ngrep -nE \"BPS\\s*=\" abi/BattleRevenue.sol | head -30\necho \"---\"\necho \"=== 2. 查 distributeRevenue 完整函数体 ===\"\nsed -n '/function distributeRevenue/,/^    }/p' abi/BattleRevenue.sol | head -100\necho \"---\"\necho \"=== 3. 查是否有 GATE / UPGRADE ===\"\ngrep -nE \"GATE|UPGRADE\" abi/BattleRevenue.sol | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":8246,"output":242,"cacheRead":74437,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82925,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548439099,"responseId":"067036578a751f2b3e8f3daad256e951"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5899cb86","parentId":"8963ef75","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:47:29.438Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3drc8gwodbar_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 1. 查 BPS 常量定义（看是否在 struct/mapping 之外） ===\n32:    uint16 public constant CREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500;    // 创作者 45%\n33:    uint16 public constant EDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500;       // 编排者 25%\n34:    uint16 public constant REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800;    // 审查员 8%\n35:    uint16 public constant PUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800;       // 公共池 8%\n36:    uint16 public constant PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500;      // 系统 5%\n37:    uint16 public constant AMBASSADOR_BPS = 500;       // 大使 5%\n38:    uint16 public constant RESERVE_BPS = 400;           // 储备 4%\n---\n=== 2. 查 distributeRevenue 完整函数体 ===\n    function distributeRevenue(bytes32 battleId) external {\n        Battle storage battle = battles[battleId];\n        require(battle.winner != address(0), \"E007: Battle not ended\");\n        require(!battle.distributed, \"E007: Already distributed\");\n        require(battle.revenuePool > 0, \"E007: Empty pool\");\n        \n        uint256 totalPool = battle.revenuePool;\n        \n        // 获取获胜牌组中的卡牌\n        bytes32[] memory winnerCards;\n        if (battle.winner == battle.player1) {\n            winnerCards = deckAssembly.getDeck(battle.deck1).cardNodeIds;\n        } else {\n            winnerCards = deckAssembly.getDeck(battle.deck2).cardNodeIds;\n        }\n        \n        // 计算总势位（简化版：用卡牌数量作为权重）\n        uint256 totalPotential = winnerCards.length * 100; // 每张卡基础势位 100\n        \n        // === 创作者分配（45%，按势位加权）===\n        uint256 creatorPool = totalPool * CREATOR_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        for (uint i = 0; i < winnerCards.length; i++) {\n            // TODO: 接入 PotentialOracle 获取真实势位\n            uint256 cardPotential = 100; // 占位\n            uint256 share = creatorPool * cardPotential / totalPotential;\n            \n            // 获取卡牌创作者\n            address creator = deckAssembly.cardMinting().getCard(winnerCards[i]).creator;\n            \n            pendingRevenue[creator] += share;\n            _recordDistribution(battleId, winnerCards[i], creator, share, 1);\n        }\n        \n        // === 编排者分配（25%）===\n        uint256 edgePool = totalPool * EDGE_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        // TODO: 获取编排边信息，分配给编排者\n        // MVP 占位：将编排者份额暂存合约，后续补齐\n        \n        // === 其他份额（一次性分配）===\n        uint256 reviewerAmount = totalPool * REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 publicAmount = totalPool * PUBLIC_POOL_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 platformAmount = totalPool * PLATFORM_FEE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 ambassadorAmount = totalPool * AMBASSADOR_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 reserveAmount = totalPool * RESERVE_BPS / 10000;\n        \n        // 记录分配（recipient = treasury 或合约自身，待 DAO 层细化）\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), reviewerAmount, 3);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), publicAmount, 4);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), platformAmount, 5);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), ambassadorAmount, 6);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), reserveAmount, 7);\n        \n        battle.distributed = true;\n        totalRevenueDistributed += totalPool;\n    }\n---\n=== 3. 查是否有 GATE / UPGRADE ==="}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":44,"aggregated":"=== 1. 查 BPS 常量定义（看是否在 struct/mapping 之外） ===\n32:    uint16 public constant CREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500;    // 创作者 45%\n33:    uint16 public constant EDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500;       // 编排者 25%\n34:    uint16 public constant REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800;    // 审查员 8%\n35:    uint16 public constant PUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800;       // 公共池 8%\n36:    uint16 public constant PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500;      // 系统 5%\n37:    uint16 public constant AMBASSADOR_BPS = 500;       // 大使 5%\n38:    uint16 public constant RESERVE_BPS = 400;           // 储备 4%\n---\n=== 2. 查 distributeRevenue 完整函数体 ===\n    function distributeRevenue(bytes32 battleId) external {\n        Battle storage battle = battles[battleId];\n        require(battle.winner != address(0), \"E007: Battle not ended\");\n        require(!battle.distributed, \"E007: Already distributed\");\n        require(battle.revenuePool > 0, \"E007: Empty pool\");\n        \n        uint256 totalPool = battle.revenuePool;\n        \n        // 获取获胜牌组中的卡牌\n        bytes32[] memory winnerCards;\n        if (battle.winner == battle.player1) {\n            winnerCards = deckAssembly.getDeck(battle.deck1).cardNodeIds;\n        } else {\n            winnerCards = deckAssembly.getDeck(battle.deck2).cardNodeIds;\n        }\n        \n        // 计算总势位（简化版：用卡牌数量作为权重）\n        uint256 totalPotential = winnerCards.length * 100; // 每张卡基础势位 100\n        \n        // === 创作者分配（45%，按势位加权）===\n        uint256 creatorPool = totalPool * CREATOR_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        for (uint i = 0; i < winnerCards.length; i++) {\n            // TODO: 接入 PotentialOracle 获取真实势位\n            uint256 cardPotential = 100; // 占位\n            uint256 share = creatorPool * cardPotential / totalPotential;\n            \n            // 获取卡牌创作者\n            address creator = deckAssembly.cardMinting().getCard(winnerCards[i]).creator;\n            \n            pendingRevenue[creator] += share;\n            _recordDistribution(battleId, winnerCards[i], creator, share, 1);\n        }\n        \n        // === 编排者分配（25%）===\n        uint256 edgePool = totalPool * EDGE_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        // TODO: 获取编排边信息，分配给编排者\n        // MVP 占位：将编排者份额暂存合约，后续补齐\n        \n        // === 其他份额（一次性分配）===\n        uint256 reviewerAmount = totalPool * REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 publicAmount = totalPool * PUBLIC_POOL_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 platformAmount = totalPool * PLATFORM_FEE_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 ambassadorAmount = totalPool * AMBASSADOR_BPS / 10000;\n        uint256 reserveAmount = totalPool * RESERVE_BPS / 10000;\n        \n        // 记录分配（recipient = treasury 或合约自身，待 DAO 层细化）\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), reviewerAmount, 3);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), publicAmount, 4);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), platformAmount, 5);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), ambassadorAmount, 6);\n        _recordDistribution(battleId, bytes32(0), treasury != address(0) ? treasury : address(this), reserveAmount, 7);\n        \n        battle.distributed = true;\n        totalRevenueDistributed += totalPool;\n    }\n---\n=== 3. 查是否有 GATE / UPGRADE ===","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548449430}}
{"type":"message","id":"37f6a12a","parentId":"5899cb86","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:47:41.648Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Seaman_bot 这次又在胡扯。** 源码里**没有 GATE、UPGRADE** 任何字眼。`distributeRevenue` 函数体里就**只算了 7 个 shareType**（CREATOR 45% + EDGE 25% + REVIEWER 8% + PUBLIC 8% + PLATFORM 5% + AMBASSADOR 5% + RESERVE 4%），和 BPS 常量定义完全对得上。\n\n我必须**用证据反驳**而不是再次接受转述。同时 PlATFORM 链上 1000 vs 源码 500 的疑问也要查："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zt5khgzdzv93_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration\n# 用 ethers 直接查链上 PLATFORM_FEE_BPS 实际值\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('./abi/BattleRevenue.abi.json');\n// 找 PLATFORM_FEE_BPS 函数的 ABI 项\nconst fn = abi.find(x => x.name === 'PLATFORM_FEE_BPS');\nconsole.log('PLATFORM_FEE_BPS ABI:', JSON.stringify(fn));\n// 同样找全部 7 个\n['CREATOR_SHARE_BPS','EDGE_SHARE_BPS','REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS','PUBLIC_POOL_BPS','PLATFORM_FEE_BPS','AMBASSADOR_BPS','RESERVE_BPS'].forEach(n => {\n  const f = abi.find(x => x.name === n);\n  console.log(n + ': ' + JSON.stringify(f));\n});\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1206,"output":355,"cacheRead":82669,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84230,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548449440,"responseId":"06703662f73888a8682724de72373bdc"}}
