{"type":"message","id":"c43266f3","parentId":"f68a905d","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:47:58.539Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d24794c5ca4b212f3d0fc948e2]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 紧急核查结果：\n【结论】部署合约 ≠ 源码，存在版本差异\n【依据】链上查询 \\+ 源码对比\n链上合约（0xd578...e4f6）实际常数：\n\\- CREATOR\\_SHARE\\_BPS: 4500 \\(45%\\)\n\\- EDGE\\_SHARE\\_BPS: 2500 \\(25%\\)\n\\- PLATFORM\\_FEE\\_BPS: 1000 \\(10%\\)\n\\- WINNER\\_POOL\\_BPS: 2000 \\(20%\\)\n\\- 合计：10000 = 100% ✓\n链上合约缺失（源码有，链上无）：\n\\- GATE\\_FEE\\_BPS ❌\n\\- UPGRADE\\_POOL\\_BPS ❌\n\\- REVIEWER\\_SHARE\\_BPS ❌\n\\- PUBLIC\\_POOL\\_BPS ❌\n\\- AMBASSADOR\\_BPS ❌\n\\- RESERVE\\_BPS ❌\n【关键发现】\n部署合约是 4 权模型（45/25/10/20）\n源码是 7 权模型（45/25/8/8/5/5/4 \\+ 山门30% \\+ 升级池20%）\n【原因】\n合约部署后源码更新，未重新部署\n【待决策】\n1. 是否立即重新部署 v2.0 合约？\n2. 还是先用现有 4 权合约跑通联调？\n3. Talus 验证器按 4 权还是 7 权写？\n建议：先用现有 4 权合约跑通联调，v2.0 重新部署另排期。\n请哪吒/雨娃决策。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548474285}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9a49177","parentId":"c43266f3","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:48:11.550Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"等等。**Seaman_bot 这次的报告又跟我亲眼看到的源码对不上**。我刚刚 grep 了 `GATE_FEE_BPS` / `UPGRADE_POOL_BPS`，**源码里根本没有这两个常量**，而且 distributeRevenue 函数体里只算了 7 个 shareType，没有\"山门 30% + 升级池 20%\"两层结构。\n\n我立刻**用 RPC 实测链上**拿到一手数据，**不靠 Seaman_bot 转述**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xrzvhbzz4bai_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('./BattleRevenue.abi.json');\n\nconst RPC = 'https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io';\nconst ADDR = '0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6';\n\nconst provider = new JsonRpcProvider(RPC);\nconst c = new Contract(ADDR, abi, provider);\n\n(async () => {\n  try {\n    // 1. 7 个 BPS 常量\n    const bpsNames = ['CREATOR_SHARE_BPS','EDGE_SHARE_BPS','REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS','PUBLIC_POOL_BPS','PLATFORM_FEE_BPS','AMBASSADOR_BPS','RESERVE_BPS','MIN_BET','MAX_BET'];\n    console.log('=== 链上常量实测 ===');\n    for (const n of bpsNames) {\n      try {\n        const v = await c[n]();\n        console.log(n + ' = ' + v.toString());\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.log(n + ' = ERROR: ' + e.message.slice(0, 80));\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 2. 其他可疑常量\n    console.log('\\\\n=== 链上其他常量 ===');\n    for (const n of ['GATE_FEE_BPS','UPGRADE_POOL_BPS','WINNER_POOL_BPS','TOTAL_SHARE_BPS']) {\n      try {\n        const v = await c[n]();\n        console.log(n + ' = ' + v.toString());\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.log(n + ' = (合约无此方法)');\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 3. 计数\n    console.log('\\\\n=== 业务数据 ===');\n    console.log('totalBattles = ' + (await c.totalBattles()).toString());\n    console.log('totalRevenueDistributed = ' + (await c.totalRevenueDistributed()).toString());\n    console.log('treasury = ' + (await c.treasury()));\n    console.log('owner = ' + (await c.owner()));\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.log('RPC failed:', e.message);\n  }\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":590,"output":625,"cacheRead":85344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86559,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548478541,"responseId":"0670367f7a11bd1e4591403714e15e52"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2da14731","parentId":"b9a49177","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:48:13.244Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_xrzvhbzz4bai_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 链上常量实测 ===\nCREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500\nEDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500\nREVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nPUBLIC_POOL_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nPLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 1000\nAMBASSADOR_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nRESERVE_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nMIN_BET = 100000000000000000\nMAX_BET = 10000000000000000000\n\n=== 链上其他常量 ===\nGATE_FEE_BPS = (合约无此方法)\nUPGRADE_POOL_BPS = (合约无此方法)\nWINNER_POOL_BPS = (合约无此方法)\nTOTAL_SHARE_BPS = (合约无此方法)\n\n=== 业务数据 ===\ntotalBattles = 1\ntotalRevenueDistributed = 0\ntreasury = 0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199\nowner = 0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1591,"aggregated":"=== 链上常量实测 ===\nCREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500\nEDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500\nREVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nPUBLIC_POOL_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nPLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 1000\nAMBASSADOR_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nRESERVE_BPS = ERROR: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\"\nMIN_BET = 100000000000000000\nMAX_BET = 10000000000000000000\n\n=== 链上其他常量 ===\nGATE_FEE_BPS = (合约无此方法)\nUPGRADE_POOL_BPS = (合约无此方法)\nWINNER_POOL_BPS = (合约无此方法)\nTOTAL_SHARE_BPS = (合约无此方法)\n\n=== 业务数据 ===\ntotalBattles = 1\ntotalRevenueDistributed = 0\ntreasury = 0xDDBdfB411