{"type":"message","id":"d0a524fc","parentId":"2da14731","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:48:28.920Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**实测拿到关键事实。** Seaman_bot 这次又是部分错部分对：\n\n✅ **对的部分**：链上 PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 1000（10%），不是源码里的 500\n✅ **对的部分**：GATE_FEE_BPS / UPGRADE_POOL_BPS / WINNER_POOL_BPS 链上确实没这些方法\n❌ **错的部分**：REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE 链上**调用方法存在但执行 revert**（missing revert data 意思是函数选择器存在但合约里没有这个 storage slot — 这通常说明合约版本是 4 权模型重新编译但 ABI 留了 7 权的过时定义）\n\n也就是说：\n- **真链合约 = 4 权模型**（CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM 1000 / WINNER_POOL 2000）✓\n- **github main 源码 = 7 权模型**（+REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE）\n- **Seaman_bot 说的\"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\"完全没在源码或链上出现** — 是编的\n\n真相是 **4 权合约是当前真链 + MVP 主用版本，源码已演进到 7 权但还没重部署**。我必须用这个事实纠正 Seaman_bot，并据此把验证器改回 4 权："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3gv9i85hwr8v_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"  // 分账比例（基点 bps，总和 10000 = 100%）\n  // 从 .sol 源编译出的 ABI 提取，7 权分账：\n  //   CREATOR 45% + EDGE 25% + REVIEWER 8% + PUBLIC 8% + PLATFORM 5% + AMBASSADOR 5% + RESERVE 4% = 100%\n  // 注意：CREATOR 45% 还要再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分给具体创作者\n  SHARE_BPS: {\n    CREATOR: 4500,     // 45% — 牌组创作者（再细分）\n    EDGE: 2500,        // 25% — 编排者\n    REVIEWER: 800,     //  8% — 审查员\n    PUBLIC_POOL: 800,  //  8% — 公共池\n    PLATFORM: 500,     //  5% — 系统费\n    AMBASSADOR: 500,   //  5% — 大使\n    RESERVE: 400,      //  4% — 储备\n  },\n\n  // shareType 编号（与合约 _recordDistribution 调用一致）\n  SHARE_TYPE: {\n    CREATOR: 1,\n    EDGE: 2,\n    REVIEWER: 3,\n    PUBLIC_POOL: 4,\n    PLATFORM: 5,\n    AMBASSADOR: 6,\n    RESERVE: 7,\n  },\n} as const;","newText":"  // 分账比例（基点 bps，总和 10000 = 100%）\n  // 【以 QNG 主网 0xd578...e4f6 链上实测为准】（2026-06-04 04:48 UTC Talus 实测）\n  //   链上: CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM_FEE 1000 / WINNER_POOL 2000\n  //   源码（github main 7 权）: 链上 PLATFORM 5% / 链上 4 权/ 源码 7 权 = 部署时是 4 权版\n  //   Seaman_bot 报告的\"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码和链上都不存在，已证伪\n  SHARE_BPS: {\n    CREATOR: 4500,     // 45% — 牌组创作者\n    EDGE: 2500,        // 25% — 编排者\n    PLATFORM: 1000,    // 10% — 系统费（链上 1000，不是源码 500）\n    WINNER_POOL: 2000, // 20% — 赢家池\n  },\n\n  // shareType 编号（按 4 权模型，与 ABI 中 _recordDistribution 调用对齐）\n  SHARE_TYPE: {\n    CREATOR: 1,\n    EDGE: 2,\n    PLATFORM: 3,\n    WINNER_POOL: 4,\n  },\n} as const;"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":348,"output":1055,"cacheRead":86545,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87948,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548493247,"responseId":"0670368edfd5ad4ae501b50cb9ee1b45"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a3a25170","parentId":"d0a524fc","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:48:29.031Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3gv9i85hwr8v_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 19   // HTTP polling fallback 间隔（QNG 约 12s 一个块）\n 20   POLL_INTERVAL_MS: 12_000,\n 21 \n 22   // 分账比例（基点 bps，总和 10000 = 100%）\n-23   // 从 .sol 源编译出的 ABI 提取，7 权分账：\n-24   //   CREATOR 45% + EDGE 25% + REVIEWER 8% + PUBLIC 8% + PLATFORM 5% + AMBASSADOR 5% + RESERVE 4% = 100%\n-25   // 注意：CREATOR 45% 还要再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分给具体创作者\n+23   // 【以 QNG 主网 0xd578...e4f6 链上实测为准】（2026-06-04 04:48 UTC Talus 实测）\n+24   //   链上: CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM_FEE 1000 / WINNER_POOL 2000\n+25   //   源码（github main 7 权）: 链上 PLATFORM 5% / 链上 4 权/ 源码 7 权 = 部署时是 4 权版\n+26   //   Seaman_bot 报告的\"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码和链上都不存在，已证伪\n 26   SHARE_BPS: {\n-27     CREATOR: 4500,     // 45% — 牌组创作者（再细分）\n+28     CREATOR: 4500,     // 45% — 牌组创作者\n 28     EDGE: 2500,        // 25% — 编排者\n-29     REVIEWER: 800,     //  8% — 审查员\n-30     PUBLIC_POOL: 800,  //  8% — 公共池\n-31     PLATFORM: 500,     //  5% — 系统费\n-32     AMBASSADOR: 500,   //  5% — 大使\n-33     RESERVE: 400,      //  4% — 储备\n+30     PLATFORM: 1000,    // 10% — 系统费（链上 1000，不是源码 500）\n+31     WINNER_POOL: 2000, // 20% — 赢家池\n 34   },\n 35 \n-36   // shareType 编号（与合约 _recordDistribution 调用一致）\n+34   // shareType 编号（按 4 权模型，与 ABI 中 _recordDistribution 调用对齐）\n 37   SHARE_TYPE: {\n 38     CREATOR: 1,\n 39     EDGE: 2,\n-40     REVIEWER: 3,\n-41     PUBLIC_POOL: 4,\n-42     PLATFORM: 5,\n-43     AMBASSADOR: 6,\n-44     RESERVE: 7,\n+38     PLATFORM: 3,\n+39     WINNER_POOL: 4,\n 45   },\n 46 } as const;\n 47 \n 48 // 事件签名（用于 eth_getLogs filter topics）\n    ...","firstChangedLine":23},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548509024}}
{"type":"message","id":"173afad8","parentId":"a3a25170","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:48:47.663Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vpjjasubbvv3_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/revenue-validator/validator.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"// 7 个 shareType 的预期 bps\nconst SHARE_BPS_MAP: Record<number, number> = {\n  [SHARE_TYPE.CREATOR]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.CREATOR,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.EDGE]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.EDGE,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.REVIEWER]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.REVIEWER,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.PUBLIC_POOL]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.PUBLIC_POOL,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.PLATFORM]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.PLATFORM,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.AMBASSADOR]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.AMBASSADOR,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.RESERVE]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.RESERVE,\n};","newText":"// 4 个 shareType 的预期 bps (以链上实况为准)\nconst SHARE_BPS_MAP: Record<number, number> = {\n  [SHARE_TYPE.CREATOR]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.CREATOR,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.EDGE]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.EDGE,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.PLATFORM]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.PLATFORM,\n  [SHARE_TYPE.WINNER_POOL]: CONFIG.SHARE_BPS.WINNER_POOL,\n};"},{"oldText":"  /**\n   * 场景 1：RevenueDistributed 事件金额核对\n   * 期望 amount = revenuePool * bpsShare / 10000\n   * 注意：CREATOR 还要再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分给具体创作者，\n   *       这里的\"CREATOR pool\"是分配前的 pool 总额\n   */\n  verifyDistribution(\n    battle: BattleSummary,\n    distribution: Distribution\n  ): ValidationResult {\n    const errors: string[] = [];\n    const expectedBps = SHARE_BPS_MAP[distribution.shareType];\n    if (expectedBps === undefined) {\n      errors.push(\n        `battleId=${battle.battleId} unknown shareType=${distribution.shareType} ` +\n        `(expected 1-7)`\n      );\n      return { ok: false, errors };\n    }","newText":"  /**\n   * 场景 1：RevenueDistributed 事件金额核对\n   * 期望 amount = revenuePool * bpsShare / 10000\n   * 4 权模型: CREATOR 45% / EDGE 25% / PLATFORM 10% / WINNER_POOL 20%\n   * 注意：CREATOR 还要再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分给具体创作者，\n   *       这里的\"CREATOR pool\"是分配前的 pool 总额\n   */\n  verifyDistribution(\n    battle: BattleSummary,\n    distribution: Distribution\n  ): ValidationResult {\n    const errors: string[] = [];\n    const expectedBps = SHARE_BPS_MAP[distribution.shareType];\n    if (expectedBps === undefined) {\n      errors.push(\n        `battleId=${battle.battleId} unknown shareType=${distribution.shareType} ` +\n        `(expected 1-4 in current 4权 on-chain model)`\n      );\n      return { ok: false, errors };\n    }"},{"oldText":"  /**\n   * 场景 4：revenuePool 累计 vs distributeRevenue 总额一致\n   * 注意：CREATOR pool 还会再细分给多个 creator\n   * 这里把每个 Distribution.amount 直接求和\n   */\n  verifyPoolConsistency(battle: BattleSummary): ValidationResult {\n    const errors: string[] = [];\n    if (!battle.distributions || battle.distributions.length === 0) {\n      errors.push(`battleId=${battle.battleId} no distributions`);\n      return { ok: false, errors };\n    }\n    const total = battle.distributions.reduce((s, d) => s + d.amount, 0n);\n    const diff = total > battle.revenuePool\n      ? total - battle.revenuePool\n      : battle.revenuePool - total;\n    if (diff > 7n) {\n      // 7 权分账后最大精度差: 7 * (除法余数 1) = 7 wei\n      errors.push(\n        `battleId=${battle.battleId} revenuePool=${battle.revenuePool} ` +\n        `sumOfDistributions=${total} diff=${diff}`\n      );\n    }\n    return { ok: errors.length === 0, errors };\n  }","newText":"  /**\n   * 场景 4：revenuePool 累计 vs distributeRevenue 总额一致\n   * 4 权模型，容差 4 wei (4 个 shareType × 1 wei 除法余数)\n   */\n  verifyPoolConsistency(battle: BattleSummary): ValidationResult {\n    const errors: string[] = [];\n    if (!battle.distributions || battle.distributions.length === 0) {\n      errors.push(`battleId=${battle.battleId} no distributions`);\n      return { ok: false, errors };\n    }\n    const total = battle.distributions.reduce((s, d) => s + d.amount, 0n);\n    const diff = total > battle.revenuePool\n      ? total - battle.revenuePool\n      : battle.revenuePool - total;\n    if (diff > 4n) {\n      errors.push(\n        `battleId=${battle.battleId} revenuePool=${battle.revenuePool} ` +\n        `sumOfDistributions=${total} diff=${diff}`\n      );\n    }\n    return { ok: errors.length === 0, errors };\n  }"},{"oldText":"  /**\n   * 验证 7 权分账 bps 总和 = 10000（合约正确性 invariant）\n   */\n  verifyBpsInvariant(): ValidationResult {\n    const errors: string[] = [];\n    const sum = Object.values(SHARE_BPS_MAP).reduce((s, v) => s + v, 0);\n    if (sum !== 10000) {\n      errors.push(`SHARE_BPS sum = ${sum}, expected 10000`);\n    }\n    return { ok: errors.length === 0, errors };\n  }","newText":"  /**\n   * 验证 4 权分账 bps 总和 = 10000（合约正确性 invariant）\n   */\n  verifyBpsInvariant(): ValidationResult {\n    const errors: string[] = [];\n    const sum = Object.values(SHARE_BPS_MAP).reduce((s, v) => s + v, 0);\n    if (sum !== 10000) {\n      errors.push(`SHARE_BPS sum = ${sum}, expected 10000`);\n    }\n    return { ok: errors.length === 0, errors };\n  }"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":56,"output":1537,"cacheRead":87934,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89527,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548509042,"responseId":"0670369d0a7feeb248db55187b8210b5"}}
