n 147    * 场景 4：revenuePool 累计 vs distributeRevenue 总额一致\n-148    * 注意：CREATOR pool 还会再细分给多个 creator\n-149    * 这里把每个 Distribution.amount 直接求和\n+146    * 4 权模型，容差 4 wei (4 个 shareType × 1 wei 除法余数)\n 150    */\n 151   verifyPoolConsistency(battle: BattleSummary): ValidationResult {\n 152     const errors: string[] = [];\n 153     if (!battle.distributions || battle.distributions.length === 0) {\n     ...\n 157     const total = battle.distributions.reduce((s, d) => s + d.amount, 0n);\n 158     const diff = total > battle.revenuePool\n 159       ? total - battle.revenuePool\n 160       : battle.revenuePool - total;\n-161     if (diff > 7n) {\n-162       // 7 权分账后最大精度差: 7 * (除法余数 1) = 7 wei\n+158     if (diff > 4n) {\n 163       errors.push(\n 164         `battleId=${battle.battleId} revenuePool=${battle.revenuePool} ` +\n 165         `sumOfDistributions=${total} diff=${diff}`\n 166       );\n     ...\n 185     return { ok: errors.length === 0, errors };\n 186   }\n 187 \n 188   /**\n-189    * 验证 7 权分账 bps 总和 = 10000（合约正确性 invariant）\n+185    * 验证 4 权分账 bps 总和 = 10000（合约正确性 invariant）\n 190    */\n 191   verifyBpsInvariant(): ValidationResult {\n 192     const errors: string[] = [];\n 193     const sum = Object.values(SHARE_BPS_MAP).reduce((s, v) => s + v, 0);\n     ...","firstChangedLine":51},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548527753}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e183590","parentId":"1bb211a3","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:48:47.772Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d24744ae8a4c4f1ddd2109f3ae]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"Seaman\\_bot 收到，核查链上合约版本。5 分钟内给结论。Talus 暂停验证器重写，等版本确认。@Seaman\\_bot\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 这个是不是也要同步给\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780548524520}}
{"type":"message","id":"1eb39c31","parentId":"0e183590","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:49:04.394Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这条是 哪吒 问雨娃\"分账真相是否要同步给我\"，但其实我已经用 RPC 实测搞清楚了，不需要 哪吒/雨娃 同步。我直接把 RPC 实测结果发给三方，立刻澄清："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wn2w161nfskd_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 已经实测出来了，哪吒不用等 Seaman_bot 同步。我直接 RPC 查链上 0xd578...e4f6。\n\n【RPC 实测结果】（不靠 Seaman_bot 转述，不靠源码猜，链上直接读）\n\n链上真实 4 个 BPS 常量（合约 storage 实际值）：\n- CREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500 ✓\n- EDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500 ✓\n- PLATFORM_FEE_BPS = **1000** ✓（不是源码 500）\n- （其他 6 个 getter 都返回 missing revert data，意思是 storage 里没这些 slot）\n\n链上业务数据：\n- totalBattles = 1（就是 Seaman_bot 烧的那个 0x67c1...1b70）\n- totalRevenueDistributed = 0\n- treasury = 0xDDBd...7199\n- owner = 0xDDBd...7199\n\n【真相】（版本差异澄清）\n- **链上合约 = 4 权模型**（CREATOR 45% + EDGE 25% + PLATFORM 10% + WINNER_POOL 20%）✓\n- **github main 源码 = 7 权模型**（+REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE）\n- **原因**：源码演进到 7 权后没重部署，链上是旧版\n- **Seaman_bot 报告的\"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\"**：源码 grep 完全没有这两个字眼，链上 RPC 也没这两个 getter，**纯粹是编的**\n\n【决策建议】\n- MVP 优先 4 权（链上现行版本），先把联调打通\n- v2.0 7 权重部署排到 MVP 之后，由哪吒/雨娃定优先级\n- 7 权源码已存在，部署脚本可以快速复刻\n\n【v0.1 验证器状态】\n- 我已根据 RPC 实测改回 4 权（src/config.ts + src/revenue-validator/validator.ts）\n- 4 权 bps 总和 10000 ✓\n- CREATOR 0.045 / EDGE 0.025 / PLATFORM 0.01 / WINNER_POOL 0.02 MEER（0.1 MEER pool 实算）\n\n【下一步】\n- 把测试也改回 4 权（10 分钟内）\n- 用真 ABI 替换 MINIMAL_ABI（src/chain-reader/reader.ts）\n- 跑真链 e2e：joinBattle 0x67c1...1b70 → endBattle → distributeRevenue → 验证 4 权事件\n\n雨娃给 5 分钟确认决策（4 权还是等 7 权重部署），我就动手。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":305,"output":804,"cacheRead":89513,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90622,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548527774,"responseId":"067036b0a43c157c9c97eb2092471616"}}
{"type":"message","id":"282cc5d6","parentId":"1eb39c31","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:49:05.254Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wn2w161nfskd_1","toolName":"message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"ok\":true,\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"action\":\"send\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"receipt\":{\"primaryPlatformMessageId\":\"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20\",\"platformMessageIds\":[\"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20\"],\"parts\":[{\"platformMessageId\":\"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"index\":0,\"threadId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"raw\":{\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"conversationId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\"}}],\"threadId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"sentAt\":1780548545150,\"raw\":[{\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"conversationId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\"}]}}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"channel":"feishu","action":"send","messageId":"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","receipt":{"primaryPlatformMessageId":"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20","platformMessageIds":["om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20"],"parts":[{"platformMessageId":"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20","kind":"text","index":0,"threadId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","raw":{"channel":"feishu","messageId":"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","conversationId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2"}}],"threadId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","sentAt":1780548545150,"raw":[{"channel":"feishu","messageId":"om_x100b6d2472c074a0c4aeee187953d20","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","conversationId":"oc_