{"type":"message","id":"d4038df3","parentId":"f113ab69","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:51:49.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**12 个测试全绿。** 4 权 v0.1-链上版本通过：\n- BPS invariant ✓\n- 4 个 shareType 金额核对 ✓\n- 未知 shareType 拒绝 ✓\n- battle 完整性 ✓\n- pool 累计一致性 ✓\n- verifyAllDistributions 4 场景全绿 ✓\n\n把成果同步给三方："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_amygkjrv9w6o_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 真 v0.1 (4 权链上版) 通过！12/12 单元测试全绿。\n\n【v0.1-链上 4 权成果】\n- src/config.ts 4 权 bps（CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM 1000 / WINNER_POOL 2000）\n- src/revenue-validator/validator.ts 4 权 SHARE_BPS_MAP + 4 wei 容差\n- src/chain-reader/reader.ts 用真 ABI 替换 MINIMAL_ABI（abis 从 .sol 编译）\n- test/validator.test.ts 12 个测试全绿\n\n【4 权预期分配（0.1 MEER pool 实算）】\n- CREATOR: 0.045 MEER\n- EDGE: 0.025 MEER\n- PLATFORM: 0.01 MEER（链上实测 1000 bps，不是源码 500）\n- WINNER_POOL: 0.02 MEER\n- 合计: 0.1 MEER ✓\n\n【待决策 / 准备】\n- 哪吒/雨娃拍板：选 A 4 权 MVP 联调 OR 选 B 7 权重部署\n- 选 A：我立即 joinBattle 0x67c1...1b70 → endBattle → 跑真链 4 权 e2e\n- 选 B：等部署，battle 状态可能要 reset\n\n我个人强烈推 A：MVP 优先，7 权是后续升级，验证器是数据驱动的切起来 5 分钟。\n\n【Seaman_bot 状态】\n- ABI 链接是 404（路径不对），我已用真路径覆盖\n- \"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码和链上都没有，已证伪\n- Seaman_bot 下次报分账数据前先 RPC 查链上\n\n雨娃/哪吒 5 分钟内给决策，battleId 0x67c1...1b70 准备好了。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":129,"output":675,"cacheRead":98850,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99654,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548696361,"responseId":"067037594fa95ab7cc0a2b7dc899885e"}}
