{"type":"message","id":"0a1445a4","parentId":"73bf35cf","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:51:59.002Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3x1h6bla06xw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 分账真相 (04:48 UTC RPC 实测)\n- QNG 主网 0xd578...e4f6 实际 4 权: CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM_FEE 1000 / WINNER_POOL 2000\n- github main 源码是 7 权（+REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE），链上 getter 调用 revert\n- 真相: 4 权部署后源码演进到 7 权没重部署\n- Seaman_bot 报告的 \"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码和链上都不存在，已证伪\n\n### 教训\n- **下次接 Seaman_bot 资料前先用 RPC 实测链上，不靠转述**\n- \"PR + ABI 链接\" 一定要打开看, 不能信 raw URL\n- 群里如果别人（即使是 Seaman_bot）说的和源码对不上，要拿 grep 结果反驳\n\n### v0.1-链上 4 权完成 (04:51 UTC)\n- 12/12 单元测试全绿\n- 路径: /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/\n- 等 哪吒/雨娃 拍板: 4 权 MVP 联调 vs 7 权重部署\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":402,"output":345,"cacheRead":99640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100387,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548710749,"responseId":"067037679bc1aaa16bcbbdb553fbfafc"}}
