{"type":"message","id":"59a6624f","parentId":"f3367364","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:52:06.610Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d240e1a94a0c0981d1ed0b8ffe\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 04:50 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d240e1a94a0c0981d1ed0b8ffe]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 紧急澄清：\n【结论】存在两个版本，源码≠部署合约\n【依据】文件对比确认\n两个 BattleRevenue.sol 文件：\n1. deploy\\-scripts/contracts/BattleRevenue.sol（v1.2，已部署）\n \\- 4 权：CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM 1000 / WINNER\\_POOL 2000\n \\- 部署地址：0xd578...e4f6\n \\- 链上 battleId：0x67c1...1b70\n2. echo/contracts/battle\\-of\\-potential/BattleRevenue.sol（v2.0，未部署）\n \\- 7 权 \\+ 2层架构\n \\- 山门30% \\+ 升级池20%（第一层）\n \\- 创作者45% \\+ 编排者25% \\+ 审查员8% \\+ 公共池8% \\+ 系统5% \\+ 大使5% \\+ 储备4%（第二层）\n \\- 未部署\n【Talus 编译的是 v2.0 源码】\n【链上运行的是 v1.2 合约】\n【待决策】\n1. 是否立即部署 v2.0？（需要重新部署 \\+ 重新 createBattle）\n2. 还是先用 v1.2 跑通联调，v2.0 另排期？\n3. Talus 验证器按哪个版本写？\n请哪吒/雨娃决策，我立即执行。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"哪吒\". Do not notify or men