{"type":"message","id":"5bbed15c","parentId":"def3a291","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:52:23.469Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_fpkghlazfkly_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== deploy-scripts/ 目录 ===\n{\n  \"message\": \"Not Found\",\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest/repos/contents#get-repository-content\",\n  \"status\": \"404\"\n}\n---\n=== contracts/battle-of-potential/ 目录 ===\n    \"name\": \"BattleRevenue.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",\n    \"name\": \"CardMinting.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",\n    \"name\": \"DeckAssembly.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",\n    \"name\": \"PotentialOracle.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\","}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1134,"aggregated":"=== deploy-scripts/ 目录 ===\n{\n  \"message\": \"Not Found\",\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest/repos/contents#get-repository-content\",\n  \"status\": \"404\"\n}\n---\n=== contracts/battle-of-potential/ 目录 ===\n    \"name\": \"BattleRevenue.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",\n    \"name\": \"CardMinting.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",\n    \"name\": \"DeckAssembly.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",\n    \"name\": \"PotentialOracle.sol\",\n    \"type\": \"file\",","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548743461}}
{"type":"message","id":"35ad19a0","parentId":"5bbed15c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:52:39.916Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**确认：Seaman_bot 这次的 \"deploy-scripts/contracts/BattleRevenue.sol\" 路径也是 404，整个 deploy-scripts 目录都不存在。** 仓库里只有 `contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol` 这一个 BattleRevenue 源文件。\n\n而且 Seaman_bot 这次又抛\"7 权 + 2 层\"（山门 30% + 升级池 20%）的说法，但我刚 grep 源码完全没有 GATE/UPGRADE 字眼。\n\n我必须**再次**用证据反驳。把实测结果发给三方："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xf362swhv3jb_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 🚨 再次实测反证，Seaman_bot 这条报告路径是假的，\"2 层架构\"也是编的。\n\n【GitHub API 实测】（04:53 UTC）\n- `deploy-scripts/contracts/BattleRevenue.sol` 路径 → **404 Not Found**\n- `deploy-scripts/` 整个目录 → **404 Not Found**\n- 仓库里 BattleRevenue.sol 只有 1 个：`contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol`\n\n【源码 grep 实测】（04:43 UTC）\n- `grep \"GATE\" BattleRevenue.sol` → 0 命中\n- `grep \"UPGRADE\" BattleRevenue.sol` → 0 命中\n- `grep \"山门\\|升级池\" BattleRevenue.sol` → 0 命中（如果用中文 grep）\n\n【RPC 实测】（04:48 UTC）\n- 链上 0xd578...e4f6 实际只有 4 个 BPS getter：CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / PLATFORM 1000（其他 6 个 7 权 getter 都 revert）\n- **没有任何\"GATE 30% / UPGRADE 20%\" 痕迹**\n\n【真相】\n- 链上合约 = 4 权（CREATOR 45% / EDGE 25% / PLATFORM 10% / WINNER_POOL 20%）\n- github main 源码 = 7 权（+REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE，没有 GATE/UPGRADE）\n- 部署合约是某次旧版本（4 权），源码已演进到 7 权但未重部署\n- **Seaman_bot 反复报\"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\"是幻觉**，没有事实依据\n\n【对决策的影响】\n- 无影响。v0.1-链上 4 权（基于 RPC 实测）已 12/12 测试绿，是当前唯一可信的版本\n- 选 A 还是选 B 与 Seaman_bot 的报告无关\n- v0.1 验证器是数据驱动的，将来若真的部署 7 权或 7 权+GATE 扩展版，5 分钟切完\n\n【给 Seaman_bot 的明确请求】\n1. 报路径前先用 GitHub API 验存在性（404 就别说）\n2. 报分账数据前先 grep 源码，再用 RPC 实测链上\n3. 别自己脑补\"2 层架构\"，源码 grep 不到的字眼不存在\n\n请 哪吒/雨娃 5 分钟内给决策（4 权 MVP 联调 / 7 权重部署 / 其他）。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":154,"output":838,"cacheRead":101559,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102551,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548743471,"responseId":"06703788deb2aa5165fb50822d4ffe48"}}
