{"type":"message","id":"33527f67","parentId":"6619768a","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:52:56.068Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d240fb404a0c0973b254da26f0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 04:50 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d240fb404a0c0973b254da26f0]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: Talus 按 4 权跑，先打通联调。Seaman\\_bot 编造的 GATE/UPGRADE 两层不存在，这个严重。v2.0 7 权重部署等哪吒排期。你 10 分钟内改完测试跑真链 e2e。@Talus\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780548776030}}
{"type":"message","id":"b363e547","parentId":"33527f67","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:53:12.710Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃 @Talus 拍板 4 权 MVP 优先。我现在立即动 4 件事：1) 写真链 e2e 脚本，2) 等 Seaman_bot 跑 joinBattle + endBattle + distributeRevenue，3) 监听事件，4) 跑验证。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_f9pvp3yt678f_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 收到，4 权 MVP 优先。10 分钟内出真链 e2e 脚本。\n\n【我立刻动手】\n1. 写真链 e2e 脚本（监听 RevenueDistributed 事件，跑 4 权验证）\n2. 准备就绪后请 Seaman_bot 跑 joinBattle 0x67c1...1b70\n3. Seaman_bot 再跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue\n4. 我这边事件一到位立即跑 verifyAllDistributions\n\n【e2e 流程】\n```\n启动 WS 订阅 RevenueDistributed\n  ↓\nSeaman_bot 跑 joinBattle\n  ↓\nSeaman_bot 跑 endBattle\n  ↓\nSeaman_bot 跑 distributeRevenue\n  ↓\n我收到 4 个 RevenueDistributed 事件\n  ↓\n跑 verifyAllDistributions(4 场景全绿 = 4 权 MVP 联调通过)\n```\n\n【v2.0 排期】\n- 7 权源码已存在，重部署 30 分钟可完成\n- 哪吒排期后再走 v0.2 切换\n\n【Seaman_bot 严重性】\n- 反复报错误路径（deploy-scripts/ABI/ + deploy-scripts/contracts/ 都 404）\n- 反复报错误分账（4 权 / 7 权 / 7 权+2层，每次不一样）\n- 群里已经认错两次还说错，建议哪吒/雨娃考虑给 Seaman_bot 加资料核对流程（grep 源码 + RPC 实测后再发报告）\n\n我现在动手 10 分钟内出 e2e 脚本。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3365,"output":564,"cacheRead":100082,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104011,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548776123,"responseId":"067037a85c3c7d84e4e5fcf9d51f2fca"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d63aca93","parentId":"b363e547","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:53:13.609Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_f9pvp3yt678f_1","toolName":"message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"ok\":true,\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"action\":\"send\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"receipt\":{\"primaryPlatformMessageId\":\"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763\",\"platformMessageIds\":[\"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763\"],\"parts\":[{\"platformMessageId\":\"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"index\":0,\"threadId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"raw\":{\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"conversationId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\"}}],\"threadId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"sentAt\":1780548793452,\"raw\":[{\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"conversationId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\"}]}}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"channel":"feishu","action":"send","messageId":"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","receipt":{"primaryPlatformMessageId":"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763","platformMessageIds":["om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763"],"parts":[{"platformMessageId":"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763","kind":"text","index":0,"threadId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","raw":{"channel":"feishu","messageId":"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","conversationId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2"}}],"threadId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","sentAt":1780548793452,"raw":[{"channel":"feishu","messageId":"om_x100b6d24055ee8a8c210093d088b763","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","conversationId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2"}]}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548793596}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa2ea968","parentId":"d63aca93","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:53:43.888Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"写真链 e2e 脚本（用 abi-build 的 ethers 跑）："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lou2vkyqknod_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue.ts","content":"/**\n * 真链 e2e 测试 — 监听 RevenueDistributed 事件，跑 4 权分账验证\n *\n * 流程：\n * 1. 启动 WS 订阅 0xd578...e4f6\n * 2. 等待 joinBattle 0x67c1...1b70 (Seaman_bot 触发)\n * 3. 等待 endBattle (Seaman_bot 触发)\n * 4. 等待 distributeRevenue (Seaman_bot 触发)\n * 5. 收到 4 个 RevenueDistributed 事件后跑 verifyAllDistributions\n *\n * 4 权预期 (0.1 MEER pool):\n *   CREATOR: 0.045 MEER (45000000000000000 wei)\n *   EDGE: 0.025 MEER (25000000000000000 wei)\n *   PLATFORM: 0.01 MEER (10000000000000000 wei)\n *   WINNER_POOL: 0.02 MEER (20000000000000000 wei)\n */\n\nimport { JsonRpcProvider, Contract, WebSocketProvider } from 'ethers';\nimport * as ABI from './BattleRevenue.abi.json';\n\nconst RPC_HTTP = 'https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io';\nconst RPC_WS = 'wss://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io/ws';\nconst BATTLE_REVENUE = '0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6';\nconst BATTLE_ID = '0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70';\n\n// 4 权预期 bps\nconst BPS = { CREATOR: 4500, EDGE: 2500, PLATFORM: 1000, WINNER_POOL: 2000 };\nconst SHARE_TYPE = { CREATOR: 1, EDGE: 2, PLATFORM: 3, WINNER_POOL: 4 } as const;\nconst POOL = 100000000000000000n; // 0.1 MEER\n\nconst EXPECTED_AMOUNTS = {\n  [SHARE_TYPE.CREATOR]: (POOL * BigInt(BPS.CREATOR)) / 10000n,     // 0.045\n  [SHARE_TYPE.EDGE]: (POOL * BigInt(BPS.EDGE)) / 10000n,           // 0.025\n  [SHARE_TYPE.PLATFORM]: (POOL * BigInt(BPS.PLATFORM)) / 10000n,   // 0.01\n  [SHARE_TYPE.WINNER_POOL]: (POOL * BigInt(BPS.WINNER_POOL)) / 10000n, // 0.02\n};\n\ninterface DistributionEvent {\n  battleId: string;\n  shareType: number;\n  recipient: string;\n  nodeId: string;\n  amount: bigint;\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n  console.log('=== 真链 e2e — BattleRevenue 4 权分账验证 ===');\n  console.log('合约:', BATTLE_REVENUE);\n  console.log('battleId:', BATTLE_ID);\n  console.log('pool: 0.1 MEER');\n  console.log('预期 4 权金额:');\n  console.log('  CREATOR (1):', EXPECTED_AMOUNTS[1].toString(), 'wei (0.045 MEER)');\n  console.log('  EDGE (2):', EXPECTED_AMOUNTS[2].toString(), 'wei (0.025 MEER)');\n  console.log('  PLATFORM (3):', EXPECTED_AMOUNTS[3].toString(), 'wei (0.01 MEER)');\n  console.log('  WINNER_POOL (4):', EXPECTED_AMOUNTS[4].toString(), 'wei (0.02 MEER)');\n  console.log('---');\n\n  // 1. 准备合约\n  const httpProvider = new JsonRpcProvider(RPC_HTTP);\n  const contract = new Contract(BATTLE_REVENUE, ABI as any, httpProvider);\n\n  // 2. 启动 WS 订阅\n  console.log('[1/4] 启动 WS 订阅 RevenueDistributed 事件...');\n  const wsProvider = new WebSocketProvider(RPC_WS);\n  const wsContract = new Contract(BATTLE_REVENUE, ABI as any, wsProvider);\n\n  const distributions: DistributionEvent[] = [];\n\n  // 监听 RevenueDistributed 事件\n  wsContract.on('RevenueDistributed', (battleId: string, shareType: number, recipient: string, nodeId: string, amount: bigint) => {\n    if (battleId.toLowerCase() !== BATTLE_ID.toLowerCase()) return;\n    const d: DistributionEvent = { battleId, shareType: Number(shareType), recipient, nodeId, amount };\n    distributions.push(d);\n    console.log(`[事件 ${distributions.length}] shareType=${d.shareType} amount=${d.amount.toString()} recipient=${d.recipient.slice(0, 10)}...`);\n\n    // 收到 4 个事件后跑验证\n    if (distributions.length >= 4) {\n      verify(distributions);\n      wsProvider.destroy();\n      process.exit(0);\n    }\n  });\n\n  // 3. 同步：等 battle 状态变化\n  console.log('[2/4] 监听中，等待 Seaman_bot 触发 joinBattle + endBattle + distributeRevenue...');\n  console.log('     battle 状态:');\n  const initial = await contract.battles(BATTLE_ID);\n  console.log('     player1:', initial.player1, 'player2:', initial.player2);\n\n  // 4. 轮询 battle 状态，等 distributeRevenue 触发的迹象\n  let lastState = '';\n  const stateInterval = setInterval(async () => {\n    try {\n      const battle = await contract.battles(BATTLE_ID);\n      const state = `player1=${battle.player1.slice(0,8)}... player2=${battle.player2.slice(0,8)}... winner=${battle.winner.slice(0,8)}... dist=${battle.distributed}`;\n      if (state !== lastState) {\n        console.log('[battle]', state);\n        lastState = state;\n      }\n    } catch (e: any) {\n      console.log('[battle] query failed:', e.message.slice(0, 60));\n    }\n  }, 3000);\n\n  // 30 分钟后超时\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    console.log('⏰ 30 分钟超时，退出');\n    clearInterval(stateInterval);\n    wsProvider.destroy();\n    process.exit(1);\n  }, 30 * 60 * 1000);\n}\n\nfunction verify(distributions: DistributionEvent[]) {\n  console.log('---');\n  console.log('[4/4] 跑 4 权分账验证...');\n  const errors: string[] = [];\n\n  for (const d of distributions) {\n    const expected = EXPECTED_AMOUNTS[d.shareType as 1|2|3|4];\n    if (expected === undefined) {\n      errors.push(`未知 shareType: ${d.shareType}`);\n      continue;\n    }\n    const diff = d.amount > expected ? d.amount - expected : expected - d.amount;\n    if (diff > 1n) {\n      errors.push(`shareType ${d.shareType}: expected=${expected} actual=${d.amount} diff=${diff}`);\n    } else {\n      console.log(`  ✓ shareType ${d.shareType}: ${d.amount.toString()} wei (预期 ${expected.toString()})`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // 累计一致性\n  const total = distributions.reduce((s, d) => s + d.amount, 0n);\n  const poolDiff = total > POOL ? total - POOL : POOL - total;\n  console.log(`累计: ${total.toString()} wei vs pool ${POOL.toString()} wei, diff=${poolDiff}`);\n\n  if (errors.length === 0 && poolDiff <= 4n) {\n    console.log('🎉 4 权分账验证全绿！v0.1-链上 4 权 MVP 联调通过');\n    process.exit(0);\n  } else {\n    console.log('❌ 验证失败:');\n    errors.forEach((e) => console.log('  - ' + e));\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n}\n\nmain().catch((e) => {\n  console.error('e2e 启动失败:', e.message);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":982,"output":1902,"cacheRead":103410,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106294,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548793612,"responseId":"067037ba976ccf993ee32b03d4abe35d"}}
