{"type":"message","id":"897a24a2","parentId":"7928595f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:55:14.477Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_966gjgjmlvrk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\n# 后台跑 e2e (10 秒轮询)\nnohup npx tsx e2e-revenue-http.ts > e2e.log 2>&1 &\nE2E_PID=$!\necho \"E2E 启动 PID=$E2E_PID\"\nsleep 6\necho \"--- 6s 后日志 ---\"\ncat e2e.log\necho \"--- 进程状态 ---\"\nps -p $E2E_PID 2>&1 | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":56,"output":141,"cacheRead":110822,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548908520,"responseId":"0670382dbfde1e1d966b73c8d7d2cea7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7e8fb4d6","parentId":"897a24a2","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:55:20.649Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_966gjgjmlvrk_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"E2E 启动 PID=4910\n--- 6s 后日志 ---\n=== 真链 e2e (HTTP polling) — BattleRevenue 4 权分账验证 ===\n合约: 0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6\nbattleId: 0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70\n预期 4 权金额 (0.1 MEER pool):\n  CREATOR (1): 45000000000000000 wei\n  EDGE (2): 25000000000000000 wei\n  PLATFORM (3): 10000000000000000 wei\n  WINNER_POOL (4): 20000000000000000 wei\n---\n[初始] player1: 0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199\n[初始] player2: 0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890\n[初始] revenuePool: 100000000000000000\n[初始] distributed: false\n---\n[1/4] 轮询 battle.distributed，等 Seaman_bot 触发 distributeRevenue...\n[0s] distributed=false winner=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n--- 进程状态 ---\n    PID TTY          TIME CMD\n   4910 ?        00:00:00 npm exec tsx e2"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6075,"aggregated":"E2E 启动 PID=4910\n--- 6s 后日志 ---\n=== 真链 e2e (HTTP polling) — BattleRevenue 4 权分账验证 ===\n合约: 0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6\nbattleId: 0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70\n预期 4 权金额 (0.1 MEER pool):\n  CREATOR (1): 45000000000000000 wei\n  EDGE (2): 25000000000000000 wei\n  PLATFORM (3): 10000000000000000 wei\n  WINNER_POOL (4): 20000000000000000 wei\n---\n[初始] player1: 0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199\n[初始] player2: 0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890\n[初始] revenuePool: 100000000000000000\n[初始] distributed: false\n---\n[1/4] 轮询 battle.distributed，等 Seaman_bot 触发 distributeRevenue...\n[0s] distributed=false winner=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n--- 进程状态 ---\n    PID TTY          TIME CMD\n   4910 ?        00:00:00 npm exec tsx e2","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780548