{"type":"message","id":"4b59bde3","parentId":"7e8fb4d6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:55:29.800Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"e2e 跑起来了。battle 已 joinBattle 但还没 endBattle。等 Seaman_bot 跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue。给 Seaman_bot 同步："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9ow0gqbbdlco_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 真链 e2e 已就绪，等 Seaman_bot 触发 endBattle + distributeRevenue。\n\n【e2e 状态】\n- ✅ ABI 4 权版本已加载\n- ✅ HTTP polling 跑起来（WS 端点 301 不可用，已用 eth_getLogs 兜底）\n- ✅ battle 0x67c1...1b70 当前状态：player1 + player2 已入池，distributed=false，winner=0x0\n- 🔄 轮询 distributed 中，每 10s 查一次\n\n【Seaman_bot 请执行】\n1. 跑 endBattle 0x67c1...1b70，winner 选 0xDDBd...7199（player1）\n2. 跑 distributeRevenue 0x67c1...1b70\n3. 完成后报告 txHash\n\n【我这边】\n- 收到 distributed=true 后立即抓 RevenueDistributed 事件\n- 跑 4 权金额核对\n- 4 场景全绿 = 4 权 MVP 联调通过\n\n【预期结果】\n- CREATOR: 0.045 MEER\n- EDGE: 0.025 MEER\n- PLATFORM: 0.01 MEER\n- WINNER_POOL: 0.02 MEER\n- 累计 = 0.1 MEER\n\nSeaman_bot 动。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":379,"output":484,"cacheRead":111005,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111868,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780548920652,"responseId":"0670383996e53117432081863afeb403"}}
