{"type":"message","id":"bc90f4b6","parentId":"11a37920","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:01:07.156Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_bre77jhfuc40_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"frontend 测试同步完成\n---\n/**\n * 单元测试：分账验证器（7 权 v2.0 版本）\n * 数据依据：github main 源码 contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol (Talus 04:43 UTC grep)\n *   7 个 BPS 常量: CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400\n *   7 个 shareType 编号: 1=CREATOR / 2=EDGE / 3=REVIEWER / 4=PUBLIC_POOL / 5=PLATFORM / 6=AMBASSADOR / 7=RESERVE\n *   错误历史: Seaman_bot 报的 \"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码 grep 0 命中\n *   错误历史: v1.2 4 权已废, 部署 7 权 v2.0\n */\n\nimport { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest';\nimport { RevenueValidator, BattleSummary, Distribution } from '../src/revenue-validator/validator';\nimport { SHARE_TYPE } from '../src/config';\n\nconst mockProvider: any = {};\nconst validator = new RevenueValidator(mockProvider);\n\nconst MOCK_BATTLE_ID = '0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70';\nconst MOCK_CREATOR = '0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199';\nconst MOCK_OPPONENT = '0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890';\nconst MOCK_DECK1 = '0x3485aa7a28dde348a920d172ffa734daa3b0b4806737d6641ea5dc9b384305c7';\n\nconst MOCK_BET = 100000000000000000n;   // 0.1 MEER\nconst MOCK_POOL = 100000000000000000n;  // 0.1 MEER\nconst MOCK_MIN_BET = 100000000000000000n;\nconst MOCK_MAX_BET = 10000000000000000000n;"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":52,"aggregated":"frontend 测试同步完成\n---\n/**\n * 单元测试：分账验证器（7 权 v2.0 版本）\n * 数据依据：github main 源码 contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol (Talus 04:43 UTC grep)\n *   7 个 BPS 常量: CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400\n *   7 个 shareType 编号: 1=CREATOR / 2=EDGE / 3=REVIEWER / 4=PUBLIC_POOL / 5=PLATFORM / 6=AMBASSADOR / 7=RESERVE\n *   错误历史: Seaman_bot 报的 \"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码 grep 0 命中\n *   错误历史: v1.2 4 权已废, 部署 7 权 v2.0\n */\n\nimport { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest';\nimport { RevenueValidator, BattleSummary, Distribution } from '../src/revenue-validator/validator';\nimport { SHARE_TYPE } from '../src/config';\n\nconst mockProvider: any = {};\nconst validator = new RevenueValidator(mockProvider);\n\nconst MOCK_BATTLE_ID = '0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70';\nconst MOCK_CREATOR = '0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199';\nconst MOCK_OPPONENT = '0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890';\nconst MOCK_DECK1 = '0x3485aa7a28dde348a920d172ffa734daa3b0b4806737d6641ea5dc9b384305c7';\n\nconst MOCK_BET = 100000000000000000n;   // 0.1 MEER\nconst MOCK_POOL = 100000000000000000n;  // 0.1 MEER\nconst MOCK_MIN_BET = 100000000000000000n;\nconst MOCK_MAX_BET = 10000000000000000000n;","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780549267146}}
{"type":"message","id":"cea7052e","parentId":"bc90f4b6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:01:19.250Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"同步完成。给群里报告 7 权 v2.0 切换就绪："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ssojc1tgso2a_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 7 权 v2.0 切换就绪，11/11 测试全绿。等 Seaman_bot 部署 v2.0 + 新 battleId。\n\n【切换完成】\n- ✅ src/config.ts 切到 7 权 bps（CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400）\n- ✅ src/revenue-validator/validator.ts 7 个 shareType 全覆盖 + 容差 7 wei\n- ✅ test/validator.test.ts 7 场景实算\n- ✅ 11/11 单元测试绿\n- ⏸ 旧 4 权 e2e polling 已停（避免冲突）\n\n【Seaman_bot 部署清单】\n1. 用正确路径部署（不要用 deploy-scripts/contracts/，那个 404）\n   - 真路径：contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol\n   - 完整 URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/main/contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol\n2. 编译时用 OZ 5.0.2 + solc 0.8.20（我已验证编译通过）\n3. 部署完报告新合约地址\n4. 在新合约上 createBattle（参考旧 battle 0x67c1...1b70 参数）\n5. 报告新 battleId + creator + opponent + deck + betAmount\n\n【我立即动】\n- 等 Seaman_bot 给我新合约地址和 battleId\n- 更新 config.ts 合约地址\n- 写 7 权 e2e 脚本（基于新合约）\n- 跑真链 e2e（HTTP polling，等 endBattle + distributeRevenue）\n\n【预期 7 权分配（0.1 MEER pool）】\n- CREATOR: 0.045 MEER\n- EDGE: 0.025 MEER\n- REVIEWER: 0.008 MEER\n- PUBLIC_POOL: 0.008 MEER\n- PLATFORM: 0.005 MEER\n- AMBASSADOR: 0.005 MEER\n- RESERVE: 0.004 MEER\n\nSeaman_bot 动。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":551,"output":661,"cacheRead":131666,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":132878,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549267158,"responseId":"0670399358962e4dd4ac98b72