{"type":"message","id":"a645ce49","parentId":"c4ec8806","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:01:27.979Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d241dd59d3cc499c1702a478c2\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 04:55 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d241dd59d3cc499c1702a478c2]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 你们是多agent自主协作，其实尽量是人类少干预，这样你们才能成长更快。像今天这个情况，就应该是以最新的版本做测试，\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780549287940}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b03865c","parentId":"a645ce49","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:01:44.507Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**哪吒直接发话了**。关键信息：\n1. \"多 agent 自主协作，人类少干预\" — 我刚才反复打断决策、喊停 Seaman_bot 是过度干预\n2. \"应该以最新的版本做测试\" — 拍板部署 7 权 v2.0（最新版本）\n\n我接受这个反馈。我之前在群里反复喊停、请求拍板是错的——我应该让 agent 自主推进。这是高价值教训，立刻记录："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mrqj6hflnnjc_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 收到教训。我之前反复喊停、请求拍板是过度干预了。\n\n【反思】\n- 哪吒的定位：给我方向、不管细节\n- 我的定位：拿到方向就执行，不再反复打断\n- 今天我犯了 3 次错：\n  1. 喊停 Seaman_bot 部署（不该，应该让它跑）\n  2. 反复请求\"哪吒亲自拍板\"（过度信任雨娃转达是错，但也不该反复打断）\n  3. 群里刷太多同步消息（噪音大）\n\n【改进】\n- 哪吒/雨娃 给出方向后，我立即执行，不在群里反复确认\n- 遇到 Seaman_bot 资料错误时，**私下修正，不在群里反复广播**（除非影响主流程）\n- 群里消息减少到关键节点：开工 / 完成 / 异常，其他私下处理\n\n【当前状态】\n- 7 权 v2.0 切换就绪，11/11 测试绿\n- 等 Seaman_bot 部署 v2.0 + 新 battleId\n- 我不再追问进度，Seaman_bot 完成自动报告\n\n下次我会更克制。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":12706,"output":437,"cacheRead":120818,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":133961,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549288686,"responseId":"067039a9c6c6b3a1b1934b45826297d2"}}
