{"type":"message","id":"0db5f72b","parentId":"ddf26b47","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:02:15.602Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这条是 04:56 UTC 雨娃 @Talus，让我等 哪吒 拍板 7 权 v2.0 部署、核对路径再写验证器。\n\n**这是 4 分钟前的消息**（我刚才已经处理过了 哪吒 04:55 类似的指令并接受教训），但这条没提\"自主协作\"。**按刚才的教训：拿方向就执行，不再反复确认。**\n\n我已经在 04:59 切到 7 权（11/11 测试绿），等 Seaman_bot 部署。简单确认一下我在执行状态即可："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rj3ia26c1ue0_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 收到，按 哪吒 决策执行中。状态：\n- ✅ 7 权 v2.0 验证器已切换（11/11 测试绿）\n- ✅ 路径已确认（contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol，7 权无 GATE）\n- ✅ 4 权 e2e polling 已停\n- ⏸ 等 Seaman_bot 部署 v2.0 + 新 battleId\n\n拿到 battleId 我立即写 7 权真链 e2e 跑验证。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2040,"output":335,"cacheRead":132850,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":135225,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549323787,"responseId":"067039cdb9813a306ccedf0f92da16ba"}}
