：2713114\nABI 已更新：\n\\- GitHub：https://github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo\\-v2/raw/master/deploy\\-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\n\\- 9 个 BPS 常量全部包含\nTalus 可以开始 7 权联调，joinBattle 时喊我。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"哪吒\", \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780549392263}}
{"type":"message","id":"51c3659a","parentId":"8e8bc6e0","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:03:26.542Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Seaman_bot 又来了**——这次报\"7 权 + 2 层架构\"（GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20%），还有\"9 个 BPS 常量\"。\n\n但我之前已经**多重证据**证伪过：\n- github main 源码 grep \"GATE\" \"UPGRADE\" \"山门\" \"升级池\" → **0 命中**\n- 真路径是 `contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol`，**不是 `deploy-scripts/ABI/`**（404）\n- 7 权源码是 **7 个** BPS 常量（不是 9 个），没有 GATE/UPGRADE\n\n**Seaman_bot 反复幻觉的根因是它的循环模式**——我之前也记录过这点。这次部署的合约到底是真按源码 7 权还是按 Seaman_bot 幻觉的 \"9 权\"部署？**必须用 RPC 实测链上**才能确认。\n\n按 哪吒\"自主协作\"教训，**不在群里反复反驳**，但**必须立刻 RPC 实测**新合约 0x1D7a...C954："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_j4z2wnaruzdt_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('./BattleRevenue.abi.json');\n\nconst RPC = 'https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io';\nconst NEW_ADDR = '0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954';\n\nconst provider = new JsonRpcProvider(RPC);\nconst c = new Contract(NEW_ADDR, abi, provider);\n\n(async () => {\n  try {\n    // 1. 9 个 BPS 常量\n    console.log('=== 链上 9 个 BPS 常量实测 ===');\n    const bpsList = ['CREATOR_SHARE_BPS','EDGE_SHARE_BPS','REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS','PUBLIC_POOL_BPS','PLATFORM_FEE_BPS','AMBASSADOR_BPS','RESERVE_BPS','GATE_FEE_BPS','UPGRADE_POOL_BPS'];\n    for (const n of bpsList) {\n      try {\n        const v = await c[n]();\n        console.log(n + ' = ' + v.toString());\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.log(n + ' = ERROR (no method or revert)');\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 2. 业务数据\n    console.log('\\\\n=== 业务数据 ===');\n    console.log('totalBattles = ' + (await c.totalBattles()).toString());\n    console.log('treasury = ' + (await c.treasury()));\n    console.log('owner = ' + (await c.owner()));\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.log('RPC failed:', e.message);\n  }\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -25"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2194,"output":647,"cacheRead":136050,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":138891,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549392371,"responseId":"06703a1146651208399a94d57446bc49"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3a95564f","parentId":"51c3659a","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:03:27.950Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_j4z2wnaruzdt_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 链上 9 个 BPS 常量实测 ===\nCREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500\nEDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500\nREVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800\nPUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800\nPLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500\nAMBASSADOR_BPS = 500\nRESERVE_BPS = 400\nGATE_FEE_BPS = ERROR (no method or revert)\nUPGRADE_POOL_BPS = ERROR (no method or revert)\n\n=== 业务数据 ===\ntotalBattles = 1\nRPC failed: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\": \"0x61d027b3\", \"to\": \"0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954\" }, invocation=null, revert=null, code=CALL_EXCEPTION, version=6.16.0)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1244,"aggregated":"=== 链上 9 个 BPS 常量实测 ===\nCREATOR_SHARE_BPS = 4500\nEDGE_SHARE_BPS = 2500\nREVIEWER_SHARE_BPS = 800\nPUBLIC_POOL_BPS = 800\nPLATFORM_FEE_BPS = 500\nAMBASSADOR_BPS = 500\nRESERVE_BPS = 400\nGATE_FEE_BPS = ERROR (no method or revert)\nUPGRADE_POOL_BPS = ERROR (no method or revert)\n\n=== 业务数据 ===\ntotalBattles = 1\nRPC failed: missing revert data (action=\"call\", data=null, reason=null, transaction={ \"data\": \"0x61d027b3\", \"to\": \"0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954\" }, invocation=null, revert=null, code=CALL_EXCEPTION, version=6.16.0)","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780549407934}}
{"type":"message","id":"ba75bba3","parentId":"3a95564f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:03:54.504Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**实测确认**：新合约 0x1D7a...C954 上**只有 7 个 BPS 常量**（CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400 = 10000），**GATE_FEE_BPS 和 UPGRADE_POOL_BPS 都 ERROR（合约里没这方法）**。\n\n也就是说：**Seaman_bot 部署的实际是 7 权单层合约（跟源码一致），但他**报告的\"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 9 权\"是幻觉**。\n\n合约本身**没问题**，但**报告数据有误**。这跟我之前准备好的 7 权验证器（11/11 测试绿）**完全匹配**！立即写新合约的 e2e 脚本："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rn0rji37obw0_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts","content":"/**\n * 真链 e2e — v2.0 7 权合约 BattleRevenue\n * 合约: 0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954\n * battleId: 0x19b37c805742b940eafe980c7236dfb95d0a452590924f1d4f15234db3bb7035\n *\n * 7 权预期 (0.1 MEER pool):\n *   CREATOR: 0.045 MEER (45000000000000000 wei)\n *   EDGE: 0.025 MEER (25000000000000000 wei)\n *   REVIEWER: 0.008 MEER (8000000000000000 wei)\n *   PUBLIC_POOL: 0.008 MEER (8000000000000000 wei)\n *   PLATFORM: 0.005 MEER (5000000000000000 wei)\n *   AMBASSADOR: 0.005 MEER (5000000000000000 wei)\n *   RESERVE: 0.004 MEER (4000000000000000 wei)\n */\n\nimport { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } from 'ethers';\nimport * as ABI from './BattleRevenue.abi.json';\n\nconst RPC_HTTP = 'https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io';\nconst BATTLE_REVENUE = '0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954';\nconst BATTLE_ID = '0x19b37c805742b940eafe980c7236dfb95d0a452590924f1d4f15234db3bb7035';\n\nconst POOL = 100000000000000000n; // 0.1 MEER\n\nconst EXPECTED: Record<number, bigint> = {\n  1: (POOL * 4500n) / 10000n,  // CREATOR 0.045\n  2: (POOL * 2500n) / 10000n,  // EDGE 0.025\n  3: (POOL * 800n) / 10000n,   // REVIEWER 0.008\n  4: (POOL * 800n) / 10000n,   // PUBLIC_POOL 0.008\n  5: (POOL * 500n) / 10000n,   // PLATFORM 0.005\n  6: (POOL * 500n) / 10000n,   // AMBASSADOR 0.005\n  7: (POOL * 400n) / 10000n,   // RESERVE 0.004\n};\n\nasync function main() {\n  console.log('=== 真链 e2e v2.0 — BattleRevenue 7 权分账验证 ===');\n  console.log('合约:', BATTLE_REVENUE);\n  console.log('battleId:', BATTLE_ID);\n  console.log('预期 7 权金额 (0.1 MEER pool):');\n  for (let i = 1; i <= 7; i++) {\n    const name = ['', 'CREATOR', 'EDGE', 'REVIEWER', 'PUBLIC_POOL', 'PLATFORM', 'AMBASSADOR', 'RESERVE'][i];\n    console.log(`  ${name} (${i}):`, EXPECTED[i].toString(), 'wei');\n  }\n  console.log('---');\n\n  const provider = new JsonRpcProvider(RPC_HTTP);\n  const contract = new Contract(BATTLE_REVENUE, ABI as any, provider);\n\n  // 初始状态\n  console.log('[1/5] 查 battle 初始状态...');\n  const b0 = await contract.battles(BATTLE_ID);\n  console.log('  player1:', b0.player1);\n  console.log('  player2:', b0.player2);\n  console.log('  revenuePool:', b0.revenuePool.toString());\n  console.log('  distributed:', b0.distributed);\n  console.log('  winner:', b0.winner);\n  console.log('---');\n\n  // 轮询 distributed\n  console.log('[2/5] 轮询 distributed，等 Seaman_bot 跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue...');\n  let lastDist = b0.distributed;\n  let attempts = 0;\n  const maxAttempts = 200;\n\n  while (attempts < maxAttempts) {\n    const b = await contract.battles(BATTLE_ID);\n    if (b.distributed !== lastDist) {\n      console.log(`[battle.distributed] ${lastDist} -> ${b.distributed}`);\n      lastDist = b.distributed;\n    }\n    if (b.distributed) break;\n    if (attempts % 6 === 0) {\n      console.log(`[${attempts * 10}s] distributed=${b.distributed} winner=${b.winner.slice(0,10)}...`);\n    }\n    attempts++;\n    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 10_000));\n  }\n\n  if (!lastDist) {\n    console.log('⏰ 33 分钟超时，distributed 还没变');\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n\n  // 抓事件\n  console.log('[3/5] 查 RevenueDistributed 事件...');\n  const currentBlock = await provider.getBlockNumber();\n  const fromBlock = Math.max(0, currentBlock - 1000);\n  console.log('查块范围:', fromBlock, '->', currentBlock);\n\n  const filter = contract.filters.RevenueDistributed(BATTLE_ID);\n  const events = await contract.queryFilter(filter, fromBlock, currentBlock);\n  console.log(`✓ 抓到 ${events.length} 个 RevenueDistributed 事件`);\n\n  if (events.length === 0) {\n    console.log('❌ 0 个事件');\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n\n  // 验证\n  console.log('[4/5] 跑 7 权分账验证...');\n  const errors: string[] = [];\n  const distributions = events.map((e: any) => ({\n    shareType: Number(e.args.shareType),\n    recipient: e.args.recipient,\n    nodeId: e.args.nodeId,\n    amount: e.args.amount as bigint,\n  }));\n\n  for (const d of distributions) {\n    const expected = EXPECTED[d.shareType];\n    if (expected === undefined) {\n      errors.push(`未知 shareType: ${d.shareType}`);\n      continue;\n    }\n    const diff = d.amount > expected ? d.amount - expected : expected - d.amount;\n    if (diff > 1n) {\n      errors.push(`shareType ${d.shareType}: expected=${expected} actual=${d.amount} diff=${diff}`);\n    } else {\n      console.log(`  ✓ shareType ${d.shareType}: ${d.amount.toString()} wei`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // 累计\n  const total = distributions.reduce((s, d) => s + d.amount, 0n);\n  const poolDiff = total > POOL ? total - POOL : POOL - total;\n  console.log(`累计: ${total.toString()} wei vs pool ${POOL.toString()} wei, diff=${poolDiff}`);\n\n  // 收件人\n  console.log('[5/5] 收件人:');\n  for (const d of distributions) {\n    console.log(`  shareType ${d.shareType}: ${d.recipient}`);\n  }\n\n  if (errors.length === 0 && poolDiff <= 7n) {\n    console.log('---');\n    console.log('🎉 7 权分账验证全绿！v2.0 真链 e2e 通过');\n    process.exit(0);\n  } else {\n    console.log('---');\n    console.log('❌ 验证失败:');\n    errors.forEach((e) => console.log('  - ' + e));\n    process.exit(1);\n  }\n}\n\nmain().catch((e) => {\n  console.error('e2e 启动失败:', e.message);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":237,"output":1988,"cacheRead":138877,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":141102,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549407953,"responseId":"06703a20736c49a85d13d3d07d00b52e"}}
