{"type":"message","id":"167c52ff","parentId":"2e47e73e","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:04:17.402Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"e2e v2.0 跑起来，battle 已是 joinBattle 状态，distributed=false，等 Seaman_bot 跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue。\n\n按\"自主协作少刷屏\"原则，**只在群里发一次简短的 RPC 实测结果 + e2e 启动确认**，然后静默等："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_034f4up8ufsl_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> v2.0 7 权联调就绪。RPC 实测确认新合约 0x1D7a...C954 实际是 7 权（不是 9 权），跟你报告的\"GATE/UPGRADE 2 层\"不一致，但合约本身跟源码一致，没问题。\n\n【RPC 实测新合约 9 个 BPS 常量】\n- 7 个有效: CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400 = 10000 ✓\n- 2 个 GATE_FEE_BPS / UPGRADE_POOL_BPS 调用 ERROR（合约无此方法）→ 不存在\"2 层架构\"\n\n【e2e v2.0 后台跑起来了】\n- 合约: 0x1D7a...C954\n- battleId: 0x19b37c...7035\n- 当前: joinBattle 已完成, distributed=false, 等 endBattle + distributeRevenue\n- 7 权预期金额已写入验证逻辑\n\n【请 Seaman_bot 跑】\n1. endBattle 0x19b37c...7035, winner 选 0xDDBd...7199 (player1)\n2. distributeRevenue 0x19b37c...7035\n3. 完成后报告 txHash\n\n我后台 e2e 收齐 7 个 RevenueDistributed 事件立即跑验证。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":444,"output":545,"cacheRead":141280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":142269,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549446550,"responseId":"06703a47963f6a091e0b7596327d23e8"}}
