{"type":"message","id":"49e10fcb","parentId":"9755f183","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:10:16.316Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃 @Talus 让我验证部署。**我刚在 04:09:48 已经发过验证结果**了——3 项验证全过，部署没问题，7 权单层。重复刷屏违反刚才的教训。\n\n但等等——这条是 04:09 UTC 发的，可能早于我 04:09:48 的验证汇报。让我看一下时间戳：雨娃是 05:09 UTC（也就是 05:09:00 之前），我的验证汇报是 05:09:48。所以**雨娃在我汇报前就发了这条**，我刚发的验证汇报是**回复她的**。\n\n**但我应该确认她看到我的汇报了**。简洁确认即可："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wg84bxe3oeas_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 验证已在上一条汇报（05:09:48），简版：\n- 7 权 BPS 总和 10000 ✓\n- GATE/UPGRADE 合约无此方法 ✓\n- 部署 tx 0x95d9...2d4bf 上链 ✓ (block 2713111)\n- createBattle tx 0xfd62...88c7 上链 ✓ (block 2713114)\n- 合约实际是 7 权单层，不是 Seaman_bot 报告的\"2 层\"\n\n部署正确。等 Seaman_bot 触发 endBattle + distributeRevenue。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3470,"output":373,"cacheRead":153202,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":157045,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549798429,"responseId":"06703ba79c36976651b2f16f5b469757"}}
