{"type":"message","id":"3fb9c513","parentId":"0e946c46","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:11:11.268Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃 @Talus 让我再验证 + 跑 7 权 e2e。**验证我已经做过 3 次了**（05:09:48, 05:10:16, 05:10:46），结果都一样：7 权单层、部署正确。\n\n**关键问题**：雨娃要的不是\"再验证一次\"——她要的是\"跑 7 权 e2e\"。但 e2e 后台在跑，需要 **endBattle + distributeRevenue 触发后**才能抓到事件验证。Seaman_bot 还没触发。\n\n我必须明确告诉雨娃：**e2e 在跑，等 Seaman_bot 触发，不是 e2e 没启动**。这次给具体等待时间："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zs8owb97png3_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -5 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-v2.log\necho \"---\"\necho \"e2e 跑了多久：\"\nps -o etime= -p 5582 2>/dev/null\necho \"---\"\necho \"battle 状态快速复查：\"\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/BattleRevenue.abi.json');\nconst c = new Contract('0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954', abi, new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io'));\n(async () => {\n  const b = await c.battles('0x19b37c805742b940eafe980c7236dfb95d0a452590924f1d4f15234db3bb7035');\n  console.log('distributed:', b.distributed, 'winner:', b.winner.slice(0,10));\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1929,"output":419,"cacheRead":157042,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":159390,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780549855473,"responseId":"06703be00555e6e9218dfccb1578aada"}}
