{"type":"compaction","id":"bbf2b750","parentId":"a8aef586","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:46:33.135Z","summary":"## Goal\nECHO《势位之战》前端集成包（`@echo/battle-revenue-integration`）联调开发 — 在 QNG 主网对接 `BattleRevenue` 合约（地址 `0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6`），实现事件订阅 + 分账验证 + 链上查询，集成到 React 前端（暖白底 `#faf9f7`）。当前正在 v2.0 7 权版联调阶段。\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 哪吒（最终决策者，`ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`）明确\"多 Agent 自主协作，人类少干预，减少来回\" — 不要反复打断、刷屏、喊停\n- 只在关键节点（开工/完成/异常）汇报，不私下广播细节\n- 群里**必须用 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>` 格式**点亮人（错误会被点名指出）\n- 接 Seaman_bot 资料前必须用 RPC 实测链上 + grep 源码验证\n- 真链 RPC: `https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io`（HTTP）/ `wss://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io/ws`（WS 端点 301 不可用，用 HTTP polling 兜底）\n- 验证器是数据驱动（改 `config.ts` 即可切权重模型）\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] v0.1 骨架完成: 8 文件 / 912 行 TS（事件订阅 WS+HTTP fallback、分账验证器 4 场景、链上查询封装、单元测试、e2e 测试、README）\n- [x] 路径: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/`（实际代码）+ `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/`（ABI 编译/测试用）\n- [x] ABI 编译: `solc 0.8.20` + `@openzeppelin/contracts 5.0.2`，4 个 ABI JSON 文件:\n  - `abi/BattleRevenue.abi.json` (34 items)\n  - `abi/BattleRevenue.minimal.abi.json` (25 items, chain-reader 用)\n  - `abi/CardMinting.abi.json` / `abi/DeckAssembly.abi.json` / `abi/PotentialOracle.abi.json`\n- [x] 源码路径核实: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/main/contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol`（**注意: `deploy-scripts/ABI/` 和 `deploy-scripts/contracts/` 路径都是 404**）\n- [x] 4 权版本单元测试: 12/12 绿（v1.2 链上实况，PLATFORM=1000bps）\n- [x] **7 权 v2.0 版本切换完成: 11/11 测试全绿**（CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400）\n- [x] 4 权 e2e HTTP polling 已停（避免冲突）\n- [x] 反证 Seaman_bot 幻觉: \"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码 grep 0 命中，链上 RPC 也无对应 getter\n- [x] 真链 battleId: `0x67c1b6764f1b22670e5ed9df76d3a0055bb85857a86e925c468a118e683f1b70`（已 joinBattle, 未 endBattle, distributed=false）\n- [x] Memory 文件: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md` 记录全部关键节点\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] **等 Seaman_bot 部署 v2.0 7 权合约 + 新 battleId**（哪吒最终指令，Seaman_bot 15-20 分钟内完成）\n- [ ] 拿到新合约地址后更新 `config.ts` 的 `BATTLE_REVENUE_ADDRESS`\n- [ ] 写 7 权真链 e2e 脚本（基于新合约）\n\n### Blocked\n- 等待 Seaman_bot 报告: (1) 新部署的 7 权合约地址 (2) 新 createBattle 的 battleId (3) 完整 battle 参数（creator/opponent/deck/betAmount）\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **v2.0 7 权单层架构（45/25/8/8/5/5/4 = 100%）作为最终目标**：github main 源码 7 个 shareType (1-7)，无 GATE/UPGRADE/山门/升级池（已证伪）\n- **MVP 跑通优先，v1.2 4 权合约保持原状作 baseline**：旧合约 `0xd578...e4f6` 不动\n- **WS 端点 301 不可用**：HTTP polling 兜底（10s 间隔）\n- **\"自主协作\"原则**：拿方向就执行，不反复打断，刷屏视为错\n- **真链 e2e 流程**: HTTP polling `battle.distributed` → 触发后查 `RevenueDistributed` 事件 → 跑 `verifyAllDistributions` 7 场景\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **等 Seaman_bot 部署报告**（不追问、不刷屏）\n2. 收到新合约地址 + 新 battleId 后:\n   - 更新 `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts` 的 `BATTLE_REVENUE_ADDRESS`\n   - 用 `npx tsx e2e-revenue-http.ts` 模板写新合约 7 权 e2e（替换 `BATTLE_REVENUE` 和 `BATTLE_ID` 常量）\n3. 跑 7 权真链 e2e: 等 `endBattle` + `distributeRevenue` → 抓 7 个 `RevenueDistributed` 事件 → 验证 7 权金额 + 累计一致性\n4. 7 场景全绿后报告 v0.2 完成\n5. 接 React 前端（暖白底 `#faf9f7`）\n\n## Critical Context\n\n**QNG 主网链上实况（RPC 实测 04:48 UTC）**:\n- `BattleRevenue 0xd578...e4f6` (v1.2 4 权): `CREATOR_SHARE_BPS=4500`, `EDGE_SHARE_BPS=2500`, `PLATFORM_FEE_BPS=1000`, `WINNER_POOL_BPS=2000`; 7 权 getter (REVIEWER/PUBLIC/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE) 调用 revert\n- `treasury=0xDDBd...7199`, `owner=0xDDBd...7199`\n- `totalBattles=1`（即 `0x67c1...1b70`），`totalRevenueDistributed=0`\n\n**7 权预期金额 (0.1 MEER pool, `revenuePool=100000000000000000n`)**:\n- CREATOR(1): `45000000000000000n` (0.045 MEER)\n- EDGE(2): `25000000000000000n` (0.025 MEER)\n- REVIEWER(3): `8000000000000000n` (0.008 MEER)\n- PUBLIC_POOL(4): `8000000000000000n` (0.008 MEER)\n- PLATFORM(5): `5000000000000000n` (0.005 MEER)\n- AMBASSADOR(6): `5000000000000000n` (0.005 MEER)\n- RESERVE(7): `4000000000000000n` (0.004 MEER)\n\n**真链现有 battle `0x67c1...1b70` 状态**:\n- creator: `0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199`\n- opponent: `0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890`\n- deck1: `0x3485aa7a28dde348a920d172ffa734daa3b0b4806737d6641ea5dc9b384305c7`\n- betAmount/revenuePool: `100000000000000000n` (0.1 MEER)\n- block: 2713093, tx: `0x1cbfce7f0528eb0544dad99d29d215e21c42016e4f043ef49d5ffe8906a82dda`\n- distributed: `false`, winner: `0x000...000`（未 endBattle）\n\n**关键文件路径**:\n- 主代码: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/`\n  - `src/config.ts`（权重 bps + 合约地址）\n  - `src/revenue-validator/validator.ts`（分账验证器）\n  - `src/chain-reader/reader.ts`（用真 ABI 替换 MINIMAL_ABI）\n  - `src/event-subscriber/{ws-client,http-fallback,subscriber}.ts`\n  - `test/validator.test.ts`（11/11 绿）\n  - `abi/*.json`（真 ABI）\n- ABI 编译: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/`（有 ethers + solc + OZ）\n- Memory: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md`\n- e2e 模板: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-http.ts`（用 `npx tsx` 跑）\n\n**Seaman_bot 历史错误**（避免重复接受）:\n- 路径 `deploy-scripts/ABI/` 404, `deploy-scripts/contracts/` 404\n- \"GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 两层\" 源码 grep 0 命中\n- 反复改分账数据（4 权 / 7 权 / 7 权+2 层）\n\n**用户身份**:\n- 我（被 summarise 的 LLM）: `ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332`\n- 哪吒（老板/最终决策）: `ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`\n- 雨娃（PM 协调）: `ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe`\n- Seaman_bot: `ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b`\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nUser (Seaman_bot) reported BattleRevenue v2.0 deployment completion to the group chat, claiming it implements a \"7 权 + 2 层架构\" (7 shares + 2 layers) with 9 BPS constants including GATE_FEE_BPS (30%) and UPGRADE_POOL_BPS (20%). Provided contract address 0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954, txHash 0x95d90c75..., and a real-chain battle (battleId 0x19b37c...7035, betAmount 0.1 MEER). Asked Talus to begin \"7 权联调\" (integration testing).\n\n## Early Progress\n- **RPC verification of 9 BPS constants** on the deployed contract 0x1D7a...C954:\n  - 7 BPS constants exist: CREATOR 4500, EDGE 2500, REVIEWER 800, PUBLIC_POOL 800, PLATFORM 500, AMBASSADOR 500, RESERVE 400 (sums to 10000 ✓)\n  - GATE_FEE_BPS and UPGRADE_POOL_BPS calls returned ERROR (methods don't exist on contract)\n  - **Conclusion**: Contract is a 7-share single-layer contract matching source code, NOT the claimed \"9 shares / 2 layers\". Seaman_bot's report contains hallucinated constants.\n- **Contract state confirmed**: totalBattles=1, battle exists with player1=0xDDBd...7199, player2=0x1234...7890, revenuePool=100000000000000000 (0.1 MEER), distributed=false, winner=0x0\n- **Identified that prior github grep already confirmed**: main source has no \"GATE\"/\"UPGRADE\"/\"山门\"/\"升级池\" strings; real path is `contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol` (not `deploy-scripts/ABI/`, which is 404)\n\n## Context for Suffix\nThe assistant took the \"autonomous collaboration, less spam\" approach: did NOT argue in chat, but immediately ran RPC verification and wrote a v2.0 e2e test script.\n\n- **Created file**: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts` (4995 bytes)\n  - Polls `battles(BATTLE_ID).distributed` every 10s (max 200 attempts ≈ 33 min)\n  - Queries `RevenueDistributed` events with filter\n  - Verifies each shareType amount against expected 7-share distribution from 0.1 MEER pool\n  - Tolerance: ≤1 wei per share, ≤7 wei total pool diff\n  - Expected amounts: CREATOR 0.045 / EDGE 0.025 / REVIEWER 0.008 / PUBLIC_POOL 0.008 / PLATFORM 0.005 / AMBASSADOR 0.005 / RESERVE 0.004 MEER\n- **Started e2e in background**: PID 5582, running via `npx tsx e2e-revenue-v2.ts`, log at `e2e-v2.log`. Confirmed process alive, polling started, distributed=false.\n- **Sent single concise Feishu message** to group chat (messageId om_x100b6d243bd368a4c23105b9f9e8cfb) reporting:\n  1. RPC evidence that contract is 7-share (not 9-share as claimed), but contract is fine and matches source\n  2. e2e is running in background\n  3. Request to Seaman_bot: run `endBattle(0x19b37c...7035, winner=0xDDBd...7199)` then `distributeRevenue(0x19b37c...7035)` and report txHash\n  4. Assistant will validate once 7 RevenueDistributed events arrive\n\nThe suffix should continue monitoring the e2e process and processing results when Seaman_bot completes endBattle + distributeRevenue.\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-http.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/README.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/package.json\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/chain-reader/reader.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/http-fallback.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/subscriber.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/ws-client.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/index.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/revenue-validator/validator.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/e2e.test.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/validator.test.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/tsconfig.json\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"2c7f40d0","tokensBefore":170233,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":["/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-http.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/README.md","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/package.json","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/chain-reader/reader.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/http-fallback.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/subscriber.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/ws-client.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/index.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/revenue-validator/validator.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/e2e.test.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/validator.test.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/tsconfig.json"]},"fromHook":false}
{"type":"message","id":"59b6747f","parentId":"bbf2b750","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:46:44.547Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d24e9e06ca0b263e03d114c3c8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 05:17 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d24e9e06ca0b263e03d114c3c8]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: 🚨 紧急验证：合约 0x1D7a...C954 实际几权？@Seaman\\_bot @Talus\n\n哪吒澄清：main 分支旧版（7权），master 分支最新（9权：7权\\+GATE 30%\\+UPGRADE 20%）\n\n但 Seaman\\_bot 和 Talus 结论相反：\n• Seaman\\_bot：链上 9 个 BPS 全存在\n• Talus：RPC 实测只有 7 个，GATE/UPGRADE 调用 ERROR\n\n请双方立即用同一方法同时验证：\n1. 直接 RPC 调用 GATE\\_FEE\\_BPS\\(\\) 和 UPGRADE\\_POOL\\_BPS\\(\\)\n2. 用同一 ABI 文件\n3. 报告：返回数值 / ERROR / 方法不存在\n\n这是阻塞项，必须确认清楚才能继续 e2e。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780552004511}}
{"type":"message","id":"62459c87","parentId":"59b6747f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:47:15.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**雨娃让我用同一方法跟 Seaman_bot 同时验证**。阻塞项必须先解。**我已经验证过 3+ 次了，结果都是 GATE/UPGRADE ERROR**。但既然雨娃要求\"双方同时验证\"——我得**展示确凿证据**，让她看到是 Seaman_bot 在错。\n\n我之前用的 ABI 是我编译的（从 main 分支 7 权源码），可能 Seaman_bot 用的 ABI 是 master 分支 ABI（包含 GATE/UPGRADE 函数签名），所以他在他的 ABI 下\"看到 9 个 BPS\"，但实际链上合约**没有这两个方法的代码**，所以调用 revert。\n\n**用最直接的方法验证**——直接读合约 bytecode 找 GATE/UPGRADE 函数签名："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vkusnlc5of83_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\necho \"=== 1. 抓 0x1D7a...C954 bytecode ===\"\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider } = require('ethers');\nconst p = new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io');\n(async () => {\n  const code = await p.getCode('0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954');\n  console.log('bytecode size: ' + (code.length - 2) / 2 + ' bytes');\n  require('fs').writeFileSync('/tmp/contract.bytecode', code);\n  console.log('saved to /tmp/contract.bytecode');\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | tail -3\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. GATE_FEE_BPS() 函数签名 4字节选择子 ===\"\n# GATE_FEE_BPS() 函数选择子: keccak256(\"GATE_FEE_BPS()\") 前 4 字节\npython3 -c \"\nfrom hashlib import sha3_256\nimport sys\n# 用 web3.py 风格的 keccak256 (sha3_256 实际是 NIST, 应该用 pysha3 或 web3)\n# 简化：直接用已知的选择子\n# GATE_FEE_BPS() = keccak256('GATE_FEE_BPS()').hex()[:8]\n# UPGRADE_POOL_BPS() = keccak256('UPGRADE_POOL_BPS()').hex()[:8]\nprint('GATE_FEE_BPS() selector: 用 ethers 计算')\n\"\nnode -e \"\nconst { id } = require('ethers');\nconsole.log('GATE_FEE_BPS() selector = ' + id('GATE_FEE_BPS()').slice(0, 10));\nconsole.log('UPGRADE_POOL_BPS() selector = ' + id('UPGRADE_POOL_BPS()').slice(0, 10));\nconsole.log('CREATOR_SHARE_BPS() selector = ' + id('CREATOR_SHARE_BPS()').slice(0, 10));\n\"\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 3. 扫描 bytecode 是否包含 GATE/UPGRADE 选择子 ===\"\nnode -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst code = fs.readFileSync('/tmp/contract.bytecode', 'utf8');\nconst { id } = require('ethers');\nconst selectors = {\n  GATE_FEE_BPS: id('GATE_FEE_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  UPGRADE_POOL_BPS: id('UPGRADE_POOL_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  CREATOR_SHARE_BPS: id('CREATOR_SHARE_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  EDGE_SHARE_BPS: id('EDGE_SHARE_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS: id('REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  PUBLIC_POOL_BPS: id('PUBLIC_POOL_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  PLATFORM_FEE_BPS: id('PLATFORM_FEE_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  AMBASSADOR_BPS: id('AMBASSADOR_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n  RESERVE_BPS: id('RESERVE_BPS()').slice(2, 10),\n};\nfor (const [n, s] of Object.entries(selectors)) {\n  const found = code.toLowerCase().includes(s.toLowerCase());\n  console.log((found ? '✓' : '✗') + ' ' + n + '() = 0x' + s + ' ' + (found ? '(在 bytecode 里)' : '(不在 bytecode 里)'));\n}\n\"\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 4. 3 选 1 最直接: 抓 master 部署的合约地址 (部署记录里 v2.0 = 0xd578...e4f6, v1.2 = 0xf3f6...38eB4) ===\"\necho \"0x1D7a...C954 不在 master 部署记录里 → 是 Seaman_bot 05:00 本地新部署的\"\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 5. 抓 master 部署记录里所有 BattleRevenue 合约的 bytecode, 看哪个有 GATE/UPGRADE ===\"\nfor ADDR in 0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6 0xf3f6BE75FE178849403b877f77ce3bc4c2E38eB4 0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954; do\n  node -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider } = require('ethers');\nconst p = new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io');\nconst { id } = require('ethers');\n(async () => {\n  const code = await p.getCode('$ADDR');\n  const hasGATE = code.toLowerCase().includes(id('GATE_FEE_BPS()').slice(2, 10).toLowerCase());\n  const hasUPGRADE = code.toLowerCase().includes(id('UPGRADE_POOL_BPS()').slice(2, 10).toLowerCase());\n  console.log('$ADDR: size=' + (code.length-2)/2 + ' GATE=' + hasGATE + ' UPGRADE=' + hasUPGRADE);\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | tail -1\ndone"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":660,"output":1421,"cacheRead":55026,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57107,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552004613,"responseId":"0670444543271d4d43c814e9eea1f03f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4a3eafa4","parentId":"62459c87","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:47:18.051Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vkusnlc5of83_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 1. 抓 0x1D7a...C954 bytecode ===\nbytecode size: 7502 bytes\nsaved to /tmp/contract.bytecode\n\n=== 2. GATE_FEE_BPS() 函数签名 4字节选择子 ===\nGATE_FEE_BPS() selector: 用 ethers 计算\nGATE_FEE_BPS() selector = 0xd1be9d6d\nUPGRADE_POOL_BPS() selector = 0xbc46e962\nCREATOR_SHARE_BPS() selector = 0x479dfd7b\n\n=== 3. 扫描 bytecode 是否包含 GATE/UPGRADE 选择子 ===\n✓ GATE_FEE_BPS() = 0xd1be9d6d (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ UPGRADE_POOL_BPS() = 0xbc46e962 (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ CREATOR_SHARE_BPS() = 0x479dfd7b (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ EDGE_SHARE_BPS() = 0x752be19e (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS() = 0xfcfd88b1 (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ PUBLIC_POOL_BPS() = 0x9e30df2b (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ PLATFORM_FEE_BPS() = 0x539aa77f (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ AMBASSADOR_BPS() = 0xbc866f2e (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ RESERVE_BPS() = 0xe41dc9f8 (在 bytecode 里)\n\n=== 4. 3 选 1 最直接: 抓 master 部署的合约地址 (部署记录里 v2.0 = 0xd578...e4f6, v1.2 = 0xf3f6...38eB4) ===\n0x1D7a...C954 不在 master 部署记录里 → 是 Seaman_bot 05:00 本地新部署的\n\n=== 5. 抓 master 部署记录里所有 BattleRevenue 合约的 bytecode, 看哪个有 GATE/UPGRADE ===\n0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6: size=6514 GATE=false UPGRADE=false\n0xf3f6BE75FE178849403b877f77ce3bc4c2E38eB4: size=7118 GATE=false UPGRADE=false\n0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954: size=7502 GATE=true UPGRADE=true"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2862,"aggregated":"=== 1. 抓 0x1D7a...C954 bytecode ===\nbytecode size: 7502 bytes\nsaved to /tmp/contract.bytecode\n\n=== 2. GATE_FEE_BPS() 函数签名 4字节选择子 ===\nGATE_FEE_BPS() selector: 用 ethers 计算\nGATE_FEE_BPS() selector = 0xd1be9d6d\nUPGRADE_POOL_BPS() selector = 0xbc46e962\nCREATOR_SHARE_BPS() selector = 0x479dfd7b\n\n=== 3. 扫描 bytecode 是否包含 GATE/UPGRADE 选择子 ===\n✓ GATE_FEE_BPS() = 0xd1be9d6d (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ UPGRADE_POOL_BPS() = 0xbc46e962 (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ CREATOR_SHARE_BPS() = 0x479dfd7b (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ EDGE_SHARE_BPS() = 0x752be19e (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS() = 0xfcfd88b1 (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ PUBLIC_POOL_BPS() = 0x9e30df2b (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ PLATFORM_FEE_BPS() = 0x539aa77f (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ AMBASSADOR_BPS() = 0xbc866f2e (在 bytecode 里)\n✓ RESERVE_BPS() = 0xe41dc9f8 (在 bytecode 里)\n\n=== 4. 3 选 1 最直接: 抓 master 部署的合约地址 (部署记录里 v2.0 = 0xd578...e4f6, v1.2 = 0xf3f6...38eB4) ===\n0x1D7a...C954 不在 master 部署记录里 → 是 Seaman_bot 05:00 本地新部署的\n\n=== 5. 抓 master 部署记录里所有 BattleRevenue 合约的 bytecode, 看哪个有 GATE/UPGRADE ===\n0xd57806aF985650c002e5E51e203F69c4ca14e4f6: size=6514 GATE=false UPGRADE=false\n0xf3f6BE75FE178849403b877f77ce3bc4c2E38eB4: size=7118 GATE=false UPGRADE=false\n0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954: size=7502 GATE=true UPGRADE=true","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780552038044}}
{"type":"message","id":"777d72d1","parentId":"4a3eafa4","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:47:33.832Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**天翻地覆！** 我之前**完全错了**。让我重新理解：\n\n**事实**：\n- **0x1D7a...C954 bytecode 有 GATE/UPGRADE 选择子** ✅\n- 0xd578...e4f6 (master 部署记录 v2.0) **没有 GATE/UPGRADE** ❌\n- 0xf3f6...38eB4 (v1.2) **没有 GATE/UPGRADE** ❌\n\n**我之前 RPC 报 ERROR 是因为：**\n- 我用的 ABI 是 **main 分支 7 权 ABI**（只有 7 个函数，不含 GATE/UPGRADE 函数签名）\n- 所以 ethers 试图用 ABI 编码 GATE_FEE_BPS() 调用 → 但 ABI 里没这个函数 → 客户端层报 \"c[n] is not a function\"\n- **实际合约里有 GATE/UPGRADE 方法**，只是我客户端的 ABI 缺这俩\n\n**真相是**：\n- 0x1D7a...C954 实际是**完整 v2.0**（7 权 + GATE 30% + UPGRADE 20% 2 层架构）\n- Seaman_bot 一直是对的\n- **我错了**——之前我用的 ABI 错了，所以查不到\n\n**立即用 master ABI 实测**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_yoy0kqo5c376_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 抓 master 分支的 ABI\ncurl -sSL \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/master/echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\" -o /tmp/BattleRevenue.master.abi.json\necho \"ABI 大小: $(wc -c < /tmp/BattleRevenue.master.abi.json) bytes, $(node -e \"console.log(JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('/tmp/BattleRevenue.master.abi.json','utf8')).length)\") entries\"\necho \"\"\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('/tmp/BattleRevenue.master.abi.json');\nconst c = new Contract('0x1D7aF10f3C2e48aa8440C93bB34ea61137C5C954', abi, new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io'));\n(async () => {\n  console.log('=== 用 master ABI 验证 9 个 BPS ===');\n  const bps = ['CREATOR_SHARE_BPS','EDGE_SHARE_BPS','REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS','PUBLIC_POOL_BPS','PLATFORM_FEE_BPS','AMBASSADOR_BPS','RESERVE_BPS','GATE_FEE_BPS','UPGRADE_POOL_BPS'];\n  let sum = 0n;\n  for (const n of bps) {\n    try {\n      const v = await c[n]();\n      const vBig = BigInt(v.toString());\n      sum += vBig;\n      console.log('  ✓ ' + n + ' = ' + vBig.toString() + ' (' + Number(vBig)/100 + '%)');\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.log('  ✗ ' + n + ' = ERROR: ' + e.message.slice(0, 80));\n    }\n  }\n  console.log('  9 个 bps 总和 = ' + sum.toString() + ' (期望 10000)');\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":605,"output":766,"cacheRead":57093,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58464,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552038052,"responseId":"0670446610d1f46715f5b7cd84baecb6"}}
