{"type":"message","id":"63934c19","parentId":"38accb48","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:51:28.209Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"哪吒 @Seaman_bot + 雨娃 提醒\"记得 @人 不然会错过信息\"——**没@我**。但这是群规提醒，**我也要听**：以后给 哪吒/Founder 发消息时必须用 `<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at>` 格式点亮，否则他错过信息。\n\n之前我 @Seaman_bot \"跑 endBattle\"——Seaman_bot 没私钥跑不了，所以**收不到**。这个错误我之前已经记录在 memory 里了。\n\n**哪吒没@我**，**不是对我说的**，**我不需要回话**。但这个提醒我记下来："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fjwwiltdppr5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 哪吒 05:19 群规: 必须 @人 (会错过信息)\n- 哪吒提醒: @Seaman_bot + 雨娃, 一定要 @人 否则错过信息\n- 适用于我: 给 哪吒/Founder 发消息必须用 <at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 格式\n- 之前我 @Seaman_bot 跑 endBattle 错, Seaman_bot 收不到 (没私钥) 但群规仍是 @人\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":642,"output":341,"cacheRead":75953,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76936,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552279314,"responseId":"067045582857ceaf1c886a97b120e6c4"}}
