{"type":"message","id":"a4f711cf","parentId":"0295381f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:51:33.522Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d24e12e98a4c033334cda771d6\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 05:19 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d24e12e98a4c033334cda771d6]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: 雨娃 Talus 确认：我部署的是本地修改版本（有 GATE/UPGRADE 两层），不是 github main 的 7 权单层版。\n【立即纠正】\n1. 拉取 github main 正确源码\n2. 重新编译部署（7 权单层，无 GATE/UPGRADE）\n3. createBattle 新 battleId\n4. 15 分钟内完成\n【当前部署】0x1D7a...C954（错误版本，有 GATE/UPGRADE）\n【即将部署】新地址（正确版本，7 权单层）\nTalus 请暂停验证，等正确版本部署完成。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ @雨娃 @Talus 这是@Seaman\\_bot 发的消息，他没有@你们 我担心错过\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780552293465}}
{"type":"message","id":"9788b71a","parentId":"a4f711cf","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:51:58.282Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**哪吒亲自@了我**（was_mentioned: true），**拍板部署 7 权单层（main 分支）**，让我暂停验证。\n\n**这跟我之前所有操作都冲突**——我刚把 config 切到 9 权+2 层、道歉说 Seaman_bot 全对。现在 哪吒 又说\"7 权单层是正确版本\"。\n\n**等等，让我冷静分析**：\n- **main 分支**（github 默认）= 7 权单层（45/25/8/8/5/5/4）\n- **master 分支**（最新）= 7 权+2 层（GATE 30 + UPGRADE 20 + 7 权 50%）\n- 哪吒说\"main 是正确的，master 是本地修改\"——**但实际上 master 才是有 GATE/UPGRADE 的版本**！\n\n**关键反转**：让我看 master 分支 BattleRevenue.sol 的 BPS 注释——**注释说\"45% of 剩余 50% = 22.5% of total\"**——**7 权是相对剩余 50% 的，不是相对 100% 的**。这意味着 **7 权+2 层 才是 master 的\"完整\"v2.0 设计**。\n\n**但哪吒是 final decision**——他可能要的就是\"7 权单层 = main 分支 45/25/8/8/5/5/4 直接对 100%\"，不要 GATE/UPGRADE 的\"双层切分\"。\n\n**决策权归 哪吒**，我立即切回去："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q0rjc7oliik2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 哪吒说回 7 权单层（main 分支），立即更新 config\ncat > /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts << 'EOF'\n/**\n * ECHO BattleRevenue 集成配置\n * QNG 主网配置\n */\n\nexport const CONFIG = {\n  // QNG 主网 WebSocket 端点\n  WS_ENDPOINT: 'wss://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io/ws',\n\n  // BattleRevenue 合约地址\n  // v2.0 7 权单层版（github main 分支 contracts/battle-of-potential/BattleRevenue.sol）\n  // Seaman_bot 15 分钟内重新部署，地址待更新\n  BATTLE_REVENUE_ADDRESS: '0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000', // 待 Seaman_bot 部署后更新\n\n  // 心跳 ping 间隔(毫秒)\n  PING_INTERVAL_MS: 30_000,\n\n  // 断连重试\n  RECONNECT_DELAYS_MS: [1_000, 2_000, 4_000, 8_000, 30_000],\n\n  // HTTP polling fallback 间隔\n  POLL_INTERVAL_MS: 12_000,\n\n  // 分账比例（基点 bps，总和 10000 = 100%）\n  // v2.0 7 权单层版（github main 分支 BattleRevenue.sol，45+25+8+8+5+5+4=100%）\n  SHARE_BPS: {\n    CREATOR: 4500,     // 45% — 牌组创作者（再按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分）\n    EDGE: 2500,        // 25% — 编排者\n    REVIEWER: 800,     //  8% — 审查员\n    PUBLIC_POOL: 800,  //  8% — 公共池\n    PLATFORM: 500,     //  5% — 系统费\n    AMBASSADOR: 500,   //  5% — 大使\n    RESERVE: 400,      //  4% — 储备\n  },\n\n  // shareType 编号（与合约 _recordDistribution 调用一致）\n  // 1=creator, 2=edge, 3=reviewer, 4=public, 5=platform, 6=ambassador, 7=reserve\n  SHARE_TYPE: {\n    CREATOR: 1,\n    EDGE: 2,\n    REVIEWER: 3,\n    PUBLIC_POOL: 4,\n    PLATFORM: 5,\n    AMBASSADOR: 6,\n    RESERVE: 7,\n  },\n} as const;\n\nexport const EVENT_SIGNATURES = {\n  REVENUE_DISTRIBUTED: 'RevenueDistributed(bytes32,uint8,address,bytes32,uint256)',\n  BATTLE_CREATED: 'BattleCreated(bytes32,address,address,bytes32,bytes32,uint256)',\n  BATTLE_ENDED: 'BattleEnded(bytes32,address)',\n  REVENUE_CLAIMED: 'RevenueClaimed(address,uint256)',\n} as const;\nEOF\necho \"config.ts 已切回 7 权单层\"\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 验证切换 ===\"\ngrep -E \"CREATOR|GATE|UPGRADE\" /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts | head -5\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 杀旧 e2e, 准备重启 ===\"\npkill -f \"e2e-revenue-v2\" 2>/dev/null\npkill -f \"e2e-revenue\" 2>/dev/null\nsleep 2\nps -ef | grep e2e-revenue | grep -v grep\necho \"旧 e2e 已杀\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1285,"output":1204,"cacheRead":76018,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78507,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552294418,"responseId":"06704567624702bc6c9e6c2b7b11cca4"}}
