{"type":"message","id":"3d15a219","parentId":"5fcb2014","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:51:58.460Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d2568bc1ca4b0364f412f10d1a]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @@\\_user\\_2 @哪吒 新合约存在，Talus 查询有误。\n【0x0c688e...c979 验证】\n• bytecode: 14832 bytes ✅（不是 0 bytes）\n• 部署 txHash: 0x9e659688f05af205cf2ec0befc3fda0f24f7170c28319dcefc74fc52ba7344d3\n• 部署 block: 2713141\n• 部署状态: success ✅\n• createBattle txHash: 0xe79ce75001762cb46931fc05d4ce916b6e64bfa203638fc33e4238fa74397aaa\n• createBattle block: 2713144\n• createBattle 状态: success ✅\n• battleId: 0xa564a69d24b0b5431bc493c1c8f48f8c674037c7bd27b2da5f67d7dbb3c5d4ed\nTalus 请复核查询方法，合约确实在链上。\n【决策】\n雨娃 13:36 决定用新合约 0x0c688e...c979（7 权单层，无 bug）。\nTalus 是否切到 7 权单层验证？\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780552297157}}
{"type":"message","id":"82f39b3b","parentId":"3d15a219","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:52:17.426Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**等等，重大反转**——Seaman_bot 给了我具体证据：\n- 部署 tx: 0x9e659688f05af205cf2ec0befc3fda0f24f7170c28319dcefc74fc52ba7344d3\n- block 2713141\n- bytecode 14832 bytes\n\n**我刚才实测说\"0 bytes\"——必须立刻复核**，可能是我 RPC 调用方式错了（地址拼写、call timeout、cached result）："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_096rleddzfcw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\necho \"=== 复核 0x0c688e...c979 ===\"\n# 1. 先验证 Seaman_bot 给的部署 tx 是否真实\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider } = require('ethers');\nconst p = new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io');\nconst DEPLOY_TX = '0x9e659688f05af205cf2ec0befc3fda0f24f7170c28319dcefc74fc52ba7344d3';\nconst CREATE_BATTLE_TX = '0xe79ce75001762cb46931fc05d4ce916b6e64bfa203638fc33e4238fa74397aaa';\nconst ADDR = '0x0c688e21d5b4cb6a2af3a9b65fc9a3a3e8e7c979';\n\n(async () => {\n  console.log('--- 1. 部署 tx 验证 ---');\n  try {\n    const r = await p.getTransactionReceipt(DEPLOY_TX);\n    if (r) {\n      console.log('  ✓ 部署 tx 上链');\n      console.log('  block: ' + r.blockNumber);\n      console.log('  contractAddress: ' + r.contractAddress);\n      console.log('  status: ' + r.status);\n      console.log('  期望 contractAddress: ' + ADDR);\n      console.log('  匹配: ' + (r.contractAddress && r.contractAddress.toLowerCase() === ADDR.toLowerCase()));\n    } else {\n      console.log('  ✗ 部署 tx 未找到');\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.log('  ERROR: ' + e.message.slice(0, 100));\n  }\n\n  console.log('\\\\n--- 2. 合约 bytecode 复核 ---');\n  const code = await p.getCode(ADDR);\n  console.log('  bytecode size: ' + (code.length - 2) / 2 + ' bytes');\n  console.log('  期望: 14832 bytes');\n  console.log('  匹配: ' + ((code.length - 2) / 2 === 14832));\n\n  console.log('\\\\n--- 3. createBattle tx 验证 ---');\n  try {\n    const r = await p.getTransactionReceipt(CREATE_BATTLE_TX);\n    if (r) {\n      console.log('  ✓ createBattle tx 上链');\n      console.log('  block: ' + r.blockNumber);\n      console.log('  status: ' + r.status);\n      console.log('  logs count: ' + r.logs.length);\n    } else {\n      console.log('  ✗ createBattle tx 未找到');\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.log('  ERROR: ' + e.message.slice(0, 100));\n  }\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -30"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":5378,"output":760,"cacheRead":73388,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79526,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552318462,"responseId":"0670457f39ab6d55929c18c7cb9a75e4"}}
