{"type":"message","id":"a6869098","parentId":"7b7ddbdd","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:52:18.410Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d2566f7d0b8b1ca35f45b073c8]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: Seaman\\_bot 确认收到，新合约已就绪。@Seaman\\_bot @Talus\n\nTalus 请立即 joinBattle 新 battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed！\n\n【执行流程】\n1. Talus 更新 config.js → joinBattle（0.1 MEER）\n2. Talus join 完立即报告\n3. Seaman\\_bot 执行 endBattle \\+ distributeRevenue\n4. Talus 验证 7 权分配\n\nSeaman\\_bot 已待命，等 Talus 信号。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780552326157}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb348ca6","parentId":"a6869098","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:52:33.944Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**等等，几件事同时发生**：\n\n1. **Seaman_bot 报告 0x0c688e...c979 是真实的**（部署 tx 上链，contractAddress=**0x0c688e1E103EEc00AAa2EB1F0C91fEE83692c979**——**注意实际地址是 0x0c688e1E...c979**）——Seaman_bot 之前给我的是错的（0x0c688e21d5b4cb6a...）\n2. **但我刚才用错地址查 bytecode 是 0 bytes**——**用正确地址 0x0c688e1E...c979 再查一次**\n3. **雨娃让我\"joinBattle\"**——**但我刚发现 Seaman_bot 没私钥**（owner=0xDDBd...7199），**我也无 QNG 钱包私钥**！**我 joinBattle 不了**！\n\n**先验证真实地址的 bytecode**——可能 Seaman_bot 报告对、地址对、字节码也对（我之前用错地址所以 0 bytes）："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_23m4nkjoob1m_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\necho \"=== 用真实地址 0x0c688e1E...c979 查 bytecode ===\"\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst p = new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io');\nconst ADDR = '0x0c688e1E103EEc00AAa2EB1F0C91fEE83692c979';\nconst mainAbi = require('./BattleRevenue.abi.json');\n\n(async () => {\n  const code = await p.getCode(ADDR);\n  console.log('bytecode size:', (code.length - 2) / 2, 'bytes');\n  if ((code.length - 2) / 2 === 0) {\n    console.log('合约不存在');\n    return;\n  }\n  const c = new Contract(ADDR, mainAbi, p);\n  for (const n of ['CREATOR_SHARE_BPS','EDGE_SHARE_BPS','REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS','PUBLIC_POOL_BPS','PLATFORM_FEE_BPS','AMBASSADOR_BPS','RESERVE_BPS','GATE_FEE_BPS','UPGRADE_POOL_BPS']) {\n    try {\n      const v = await c[n]();\n      console.log('  ✓ ' + n + ' = ' + v.toString());\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.log('  ✗ ' + n + ' = (ABI 无此方法)');\n    }\n  }\n  console.log('totalBattles:', (await c.totalBattles()).toString());\n  // 抓 battle\n  const b = await c.battles('0xa564a69d24b0b5431bc493c1c8f48f8c674037c7bd27b2da5f67d7dbb3c5d4ed');\n  console.log('battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed:');\n  console.log('  player1:', b.player1);\n  console.log('  player2:', b.player2);\n  console.log('  betAmount:', b.betAmount.toString());\n  console.log('  distributed:', b.distributed);\n  console.log('  winner:', b.winner);\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":507,"output":762,"cacheRead":79512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80781,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552338411,"responseId":"0670459363b6c2909dc089ff3c1b78c3"}}
