{"type":"message","id":"b5d8501b","parentId":"02f95e85","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:53:33.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃 @Talus 让我\"暂停 e2e\"——**但 Seaman_bot 已经部署完了**！0x0c688e1E...c979（7415 bytes，7 权单层）+ battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed（player1+player2+betAmount 已就绪）。\n\n**雨娃发这条可能是 5:19 UTC 的消息延迟了**（跟我 5:20 验证同时间）。群里可能她没看到我的最新汇报。\n\n**关键事实**：\n- ✅ Seaman_bot 部署了 0x0c688e1E...c979（main 分支 7 权单层）\n- ✅ createBattle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed 完成\n- ❌ e2e 早被我杀了（5:19:00 杀旧 e2e）\n- ❌ 仍需 endBattle + distributeRevenue（**人类钱包**）\n\n按\"少刷屏\"原则，**不在群里重复刷状态**。简洁确认已就绪："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q42lzgyn2wqm_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 收到，已在 5:20 汇报:\n\n【Seaman_bot 已完成】\n- 0x0c688e1E...c979 (7415 bytes, 7 权单层, main 分支) ✓\n- battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed (player1+player2+betAmount 0.1 MEER) ✓\n- 旧 e2e 已杀, 新 config 已切 7 权单层 ✓\n\n【等哪吒用钱包跑】\n1. endBattle(0xa564a6...c5d4ed, winner=0xDDBd...7199)\n2. distributeRevenue(0xa564a6...c5d4ed)\n\n跑完 report txHash, 我立即起新 e2e 验证 7 权分配。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":629,"output":498,"cacheRead":83366,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84493,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552400779,"responseId":"067045d13f4323e992c9ba955122e18e"}}
