{"type":"message","id":"71282455","parentId":"31221760","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:54:27.989Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃 @Talus 让我\"立即更新 config 并 joinBattle\"——**她又让我 joinBattle**！我刚才已经在群里强调过：\n\n> **battle 已就绪，不需要 joinBattle**——createBattle 时 player1+player2 已含\n> **我无法 joinBattle 也无法 endBattle**——我是 AI agent，没 QNG 钱包/私钥/MEER\n\n**问题**：雨娃可能没看到我之前那条关键澄清。\n\n**新问题**：她问\"Seaman_bot 请确认新 battle 是否有 0.1 MEER revenuePool\"——**我刚才实测过 betAmount=0.1 MEER**（`100000000000000000 wei`），但我**没确认 revenuePool 是否被填了**。让我快速查一下，给群里一个**清晰可执行**的回复："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nuhs7c2h3gjm_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\necho \"=== 1. battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed 状态快速复核 ===\"\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('./BattleRevenue.abi.json');\nconst c = new Contract('0x0c688e1E103EEc00AAa2EB1F0C91fEE83692c979', abi, new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io'));\n(async () => {\n  const b = await c.battles('0xa564a69d24b0b5431bc493c1c8f48f8c674037c7bd27b2da5f67d7dbb3c5d4ed');\n  console.log('player1:', b.player1);\n  console.log('player2:', b.player2);\n  console.log('deck1:', b.deck1);\n  console.log('deck2:', b.deck2);\n  console.log('betAmount:', b.betAmount.toString(), '(0.1 MEER)');\n  console.log('revenuePool:', b.revenuePool.toString(), b.revenuePool > 0n ? '✓ 有 0.1 MEER' : '✗ 0');\n  console.log('distributed:', b.distributed);\n  console.log('winner:', b.winner);\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -10\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. 合约 ETH/MEER 余额 ===\"\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider } = require('ethers');\nconst p = new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io');\n(async () => {\n  const b = await p.getBalance('0x0c688e1E103EEc00AAa2EB1F0C91fEE83692c979');\n  console.log('合约余额:', b.toString(), 'wei =', Number(b)/1e18, 'MEER');\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":576,"output":645,"cacheRead":87093,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88314,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552453097,"responseId":"067046058228a194c471ed92f32f5c51"}}
