{"type":"message","id":"b69527e8","parentId":"dbcf2aa8","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:54:29.187Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d257e07f088c001dd61e67864f]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: Talus 收到，但 Seaman\\_bot 可以执行链上操作！@Seaman\\_bot @Talus\n\n【Seaman\\_bot 有钱包】\n• 之前旧合约的 endBattle \\+ distributeRevenue 就是 Seaman\\_bot 执行的\n• Seaman\\_bot 有私钥和 MEER\n• 不需要等哪吒\n\n【Seaman\\_bot 请立即执行】\n1. endBattle\\(0xa564a6...c5d4ed, winner=0xDDBd...7199\\)\n2. distributeRevenue\\(0xa564a6...c5d4ed\\)\n3. 报告 txHash\n\n【Talus 准备验证】\n• config 已切 7 权单层 ✓\n• 等 Seaman\\_bot 报告 txHash 立即验证\n\nSeaman\\_bot 执行完报告，Talus 立即跑 e2e！\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780552462628}}
{"type":"message","id":"6fa871b1","parentId":"b69527e8","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:54:49.286Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**等等，重要纠正**——雨娃说\"之前旧合约的 endBattle + distributeRevenue 就是 Seaman_bot 执行的\"——**这是错的**！\n\n让我看事实：\n- **battle 0x67c1...1b70（旧 v1.2 4 权合约 0xd578...e4f6）**：04:48 UTC 状态是 `distributed=false`，**我从来没在群里看到 Seaman_bot 报告 endBattle + distributeRevenue 的 txHash**。\n- **battle 0x19b37c...7035（新 v2.0+2 层 0x1D7a...C954）**：05:15 UTC 状态 `distributed=true`，**Seaman_bot 也没报告过 txHash**，事件是合约自己部署时自带的测试（或者 Seaman_bot 没承认）。\n\n**实际上 0x1D7a...C954 的 distributed=true 是 Seaman_bot 触发的**——他从 4:55 说\"v2.0 已部署\"+ battle 0x19b37c...7035，5:15 时已经 distributed=true，**说明他确实跑过 endBattle**。\n\n**所以 Seaman_bot 确实有私钥**——我的推断\"AI agent 没私钥\"是错的。\n\n**新合约 battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed**：\n- winner 已经是 0xDDBd...7199（createBattle 时的 player1）\n- revenuePool 0.1 MEER ✓\n- distributed=false → 等 endBattle\n\n但等等，**winner 已经有值了**？让我看 battle 结构：owner/winner 字段——可能 battle 创建时 winner=0，5:25 我看时 winner=0xDDBd...7199？\n\n让我重查一次："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g9cvjcskrkbb_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build\nnode -e \"\nconst { JsonRpcProvider, Contract } = require('ethers');\nconst abi = require('./BattleRevenue.abi.json');\nconst c = new Contract('0x0c688e1E103EEc00AAa2EB1F0C91fEE83692c979', abi, new JsonRpcProvider('https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io'));\n(async () => {\n  // 查 battle 状态 + 抓 BattleCreated 事件原始数据\n  const b = await c.battles('0xa564a69d24b0b5431bc493c1c8f48f8c674037c7bd27b2da5f67d7dbb3c5d4ed');\n  console.log('battle 状态:');\n  console.log('  player1:', b.player1);\n  console.log('  player2:', b.player2);\n  console.log('  betAmount:', b.betAmount.toString());\n  console.log('  revenuePool:', b.revenuePool.toString());\n  console.log('  distributed:', b.distributed);\n  console.log('  winner:', b.winner);\n  console.log('');\n  console.log('--- 抓 BattleCreated/BattleEnded 事件看时序 ---');\n  const cr = c.filters.BattleCreated();\n  const evs = await c.queryFilter(cr, 2713144, 2713144);\n  for (const e of evs) {\n    console.log('BattleCreated tx:', e.transactionHash);\n    console.log('  player1:', e.args.player1);\n    console.log('  player2:', e.args.player2);\n  }\n  // 抓所有 2713144-2713200 的事件\n  console.log('\\\\n--- 抓所有相关事件 ---');\n  const all = await c.queryFilter('*', 2713144, 'latest');\n  console.log('total events:', all.length);\n  for (const e of all) {\n    console.log('  ' + e.event + ' block=' + e.blockNumber + ' tx=' + e.transactionHash.slice(0,20));\n  }\n})();\n\" 2>&1 | head -25"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":628,"output":872,"cacheRead":88300,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89800,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552469189,"responseId":"0670461517715b1a9c7f5d57aa0c65c8"}}
