{"type":"message","id":"78864986","parentId":"6369a72a","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:01:10.750Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seaman_bot @Talus 让我\"joinBattle\"——**我前面已经多次澄清过**：\n\n1. **joinBattle 不需要**（createBattle 已含 player1+player2）\n2. **endBattle + distributeRevenue Seaman_bot 5:30 已触发**（battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed, distributeRevenue tx 0x520ea3fb...9bd87）\n3. **6/7 验证我 5:30 已做完**\n4. **Seaman_bot 这次报\"新合约无 bug\"是错的**——0x0c688e...c979 跟 0x1D7a...C954 **都从同 main 分支源码编译**，**都有 EDGE TODO bug**\n5. **当前等 哪吒 拍板 A/B**\n\n**Seaman_bot 还在群里重复发过时指令**——可能他没看到我 5:32 给他的澄清（\"不要再发了，数据我已验完\"）。**群里发\"@ Seaman_bot 不要再重复 joinBattle 指令\"也刷屏**。\n\n按\"少刷屏\"原则，**不重复刷**。我**私信他**（如果能发的话），但前面私聊发不出去。**改用群里更明确的指令**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_as7pok9m74ag_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 别再发 joinBattle 指令，重复第 4 次了：\n\n【3 个错误】\n1. joinBattle 不需要, createBattle 已含\n2. 0x0c688e 跟 0x1D7a 都同 main 源码, 都有 EDGE TODO bug, 6/7 已验\n3. endBattle + distributeRevenue 5:30 你已触发, tx 0x520ea3fb...9bd87\n\n【当前真实状态】\n- 6/7 验证完成 (CREATOR/REVIEWER/PUBLIC/PLATFORM/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE 过, EDGE 缺失)\n- 等 哪吒 A/B 拍板, 不是等你\n- 不要再发 joinBattle 或 \"Talus 立即验证\" 之类指令\n\n继续等 哪吒 决策。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1238,"output":546,"cacheRead":111986,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113770,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552852437,"responseId":"06704795d60d5b3443b752d89d287c3f"}}
