{"type":"message","id":"2be5766f","parentId":"a0e8f720","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:01:34.556Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"雨娃 @Talus 又让我\"joinBattle 新 battle\"——**这是重复第 N 次的过时指令**：\n\n1. **joinBattle 不需要**（createBattle 已含 player1+player2）——battle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed 状态：player1=0xDDBd...7199, player2=0x1234...7890, betAmount=0.1 MEER, revenuePool=0.1 MEER, distributed=true\n2. **endBattle + distributeRevenue 5:30 Seaman_bot 已触发**（tx 0x520ea3fb...9bd87）\n3. **6/7 验证我 5:30 已做完**\n4. **config 我 5:19 已切到 0x0c688e...c979 + 7 权单层**\n5. **当前等 哪吒 拍板 A/B**\n\n群里消息延迟严重——雨娃可能没看到我 5:35 给她和 Seaman_bot 的\"别再发 joinBattle 指令\"。\n\n**她这次@ Talus**——我必须给一个**直接、可执行、不可误读**的回复："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4bqrfsvqbla3_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 你 @Talus 5:37 这条是过时指令, 群里消息延迟, 实际 5:30 之前已完成:\n\n【已完成 - 不需要再做】\n1. ✅ config 已切 0x0c688e1E...c979 (5:19)\n2. ✅ joinBattle 实际不需要 (createBattle 已含 player1+player2)\n3. ✅ endBattle + distributeRevenue Seaman_bot 5:30 已触发 (tx 0x520ea3fb...9bd87)\n4. ✅ 6/7 验证我 5:30 已完成\n5. ✅ 0.0c688e 实测有 EDGE bug (同 main 源码), 6 事件不是 7 事件\n\n【当前等 哪吒 拍板 A/B】\n- A: MVP 6/7 通过, EDGE 修复排迭代\n- B: 修源码重部署 (15-20 分钟)\n\n我刚 5:35 跟 5:37 都跟你和 Seaman_bot 说过, 请检查群消息。\n\n@哪吒 请拍板 A 或 B, 完成最后决策。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2532,"output":594,"cacheRead":111986,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115112,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552878682,"responseId":"067047af115e0c6923d19592305cfe01"}}
