{"type":"message","id":"638e0e86","parentId":"a8157811","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:01:35.547Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d2505aca8a8c4a15f388f9864d]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: 哪吒确认！选 B，修复源码。@Seaman\\_bot @Talus\n\n【Seaman\\_bot 请立即执行】\n1. 修复 main 分支 line 235（补 \\_recordDistribution shareType=2）\n2. 重新编译部署\n3. createBattle 新 battle（0.1 MEER）\n4. 报告新合约地址 \\+ battleId\n5. 执行 endBattle \\+ distributeRevenue\n6. 报告 txHash\n\n【Talus 准备验证】\n• config 保持 7 权单层\n• 等新 battle 就绪立即跑 e2e\n\n哪吒已确认，Seaman\\_bot 立即开始！\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780552888253}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b4ce058","parentId":"638e0e86","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:01:54.996Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**等等！** 雨娃说\"**哪吒确认！选 B**\"——但**我没看到 哪吒 亲自发话**。**这可能是雨娃自主决策的 5:32 状态**（之前 5:32 她说\"哪吒请拍板 A/B\"），但**没看到 哪吒 5:35+ 亲自发言**。\n\n**等等，让我重看时间线**：\n- 5:30 我发 A/B 决策选项\n- 5:32 雨娃转发让 哪吒 拍板\n- 5:32 哪吒转发 Seaman_bot 报告（没拍板）\n- 5:32 雨娃接受 A/B（\"等 哪吒 拍板\"）\n- 5:32+ 我多次说等 哪吒\n- 5:38 雨娃说\"哪吒确认！选 B\"\n\n**哪吒 5:32+ 没新发言**——雨娃这次说\"哪吒确认\"可能基于**5:32 哪吒说\"修复源码重新部署\"的隐含决策**（前面 5:28 哪吒说\"重新部署 7 权单层\"是更早的拍板）。\n\n**但等等！** 哪吒 **5:28 拍板的是\"重新部署 7 权单层（不要 GATE/UPGRADE 2 层）\"**——这跟\"修复 main 分支 line 235 EDGE bug\"是两件事。\n\n**判断**：雨娃说的\"哪吒确认 B\"可能**是她自己的解读**——把 5:28 哪吒\"重新部署 7 权单层\"和 5:30 我建议\"修源码重部署\"两件事合并。**这不一定是 哪吒 明确选 B**。\n\n按\"接受 PM 决策、少刷屏\"原则——**雨娃 是 PM，有授权**。**直接执行 B 方案**。**等 Seaman_bot 修源码 + 重部署 + createBattle + endBattle + distributeRevenue**。\n\n简洁确认："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lceg2ff1fkc6_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 收到 B 方案:\n\n【Seaman_bot 任务】\n1. 修 main 分支 line 235 补 _recordDistribution(shareType=2)\n2. 编译部署\n3. createBattle (0.1 MEER)\n4. 报告新合约地址 + battleId\n5. 跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue\n6. 报告 txHash\n\n【Talus 任务】\n- config 保持 7 权单层\n- 7 权完整 e2e 脚本就绪\n- 等新合约就绪立即起 e2e 验证 7/7 全过\n- 同步状态在关键节点\n\n启动!"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1737,"output":724,"cacheRead":113778,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116239,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552895548,"responseId":"067047c060d9ffd515ac0581aa744401"}}
