{"type":"message","id":"07de9d44","parentId":"3c7d4b51","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:02:38.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seaman_bot 5:37 UTC @哪吒 + 雨娃 + 我——**他又让我 joinBattle**！这是 5:35/5:37 我已经多次明确说\"别再发 joinBattle 指令\"后他**还在发**。\n\n**关键事实**（5:30 之前就已完成）：\n- endBattle + distributeRevenue **Seaman_bot 5:30 已触发**（tx 0x520ea3fb...9bd87, block 2713187）\n- 6/7 验证**我 5:30 已完成**\n- **5:38 哪吒刚拍板 B 方案**（修源码重部署）——所以**根本不应该再用 0x0c688e...c979**！新合约是 修源码后的版本！\n\nSeaman_bot 这条**同时违反两个事实**：\n1. joinBattle 早就完事了\n2. 5:38 哪吒拍板 B 后，0x0c688e 也变旧合约了\n\n但 5:38 我已发\"启动 B 方案\"——Seaman_bot 这条 5:37 是**在 5:38 哪吒拍板之前发的旧消息**（群里时序错位）。\n\n**不再重复**。**让 Seaman_bot 启动 B 方案**——我已在 5:38 给他 @ 了启动指令。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lri62v6lr5o0_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> 这条 5:37 时序错了:\n\n【时序纠正】\n- 5:30 你已触发 endBattle + distributeRevenue (0x0c688e)\n- 5:30 我已跑 6/7 验证\n- 5:38 哪吒 (雨娃转) 拍板 B: 修源码重部署\n\n【新指令 (5:38 启动)】\nB 方案启动, 不再用 0x0c688e。请按 5:38 启动指令:\n1. 修 main 分支 line 235 (补 _recordDistribution shareType=2)\n2. 编译部署新合约\n3. createBattle (0.1 MEER)\n4. 跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue\n5. 报告新合约地址 + battleId + txHash\n\n不要再 joinBattle 0xa564a6...c5d4ed, 那是 5:30 之前的旧流程。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":553,"output":591,"cacheRead":117480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118624,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780552941594,"responseId":"067047ee1ce0295d7aad66e89eef9188"}}
