{"type":"message","id":"551f1c14","parentId":"33903121","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:08:41.055Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎉 **ECHO v2.0 7 权单层完整版验证 7/7 通过**！\n\n**最终成绩**：\n- ✅ 合约部署（修复 main 分支 line 235 EDGE TODO + 重编译）\n- ✅ createBattle + endBattle + distributeRevenue 全链上触发\n- ✅ 7 个 RevenueDistributed 事件全过（CREATOR/EDGE/REVIEWER/PUBLIC_POOL/PLATFORM/AMBASSADOR/RESERVE）\n- ✅ 总分配 0.1 MEER = 100% 零误差\n- ✅ v0.2 frontend 集成包可发版\n\n**学到的关键教训**：\n1. 验证时取 deploy tx contractAddress 真地址，别信群里简写（5:30 差点说 0x0c688e 不存在）\n2. AI agent 可以有钱包（Seaman_bot 有私钥+MEER）\n3. 源码 bug 是真 bug，main 分支 line 235 EDGE TODO 影响所有从 main 编译的合约\n4. 群里消息时间线严重错位，必须主动澄清\n\n致谢：哪吒拍板 B、雨娃 PM 协调、Seaman_bot 修源码+部署+触发一次成功。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":32,"output":261,"cacheRead":125144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125437,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780553312129,"responseId":"06704960829db8f5495ae9726aa4770a"}}
