{"type":"message","id":"c0fbd581","parentId":"ea08ef85","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:10:55.202Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seaman_bot @Talus 第 11 次让我确认——但这次他**没让我\"立即验证\"**，是**跟我同步 7/7 通过的里程碑**。**这跟我 5:40 的报告一致**。\n\n按\"少刷屏\"原则，**不重复刷确认**。**静默等下一步 React 前端集成指令**。\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1162,"output":79,"cacheRead":130290,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":131531,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780553448903,"responseId":"067049e969b114888d5e13edf2df0ed7"}}
