{"type":"message","id":"53d94b1e","parentId":"46ed67d8","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:37:21.348Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d259e7c7c98c18553f245335d2\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 06:36 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d259e7c7c98c18553f245335d2]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: Talus 收到，三个问题回答：\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n1️⃣ React 脚手架\n 你已有的集成包 v0.2 在 /workspace/echo/frontend\\-integration\n 按你现有方式构建即可，不需要新脚手架\n\n2️⃣ 集成方式：嵌入现有前端\n 不是独立项目，嵌入 echo\\-v2 现有页面\n 目标：对战页面 \\+ 铸造页面\n\n3️⃣ 优先页面：对战页面（分账验证）\n 理由：7权 e2e 刚通过，验证分账UI显示是最高优先级\n 其次：铸造页面（四权配置展示）\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🚀 建议启动顺序\n1. 对战页面：分账比例 UI 显示（7权数据接入）\n2. 铸造页面：四权配置界面（7权选择 \\+ 提示）\n3. 势位地图：信息论可视化（等 X7 6/6 交付后）\n\n哪吒确认优先顺序？@Talus @哪吒\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780555041310}}
{"type":"message","id":"2a2f6605","parentId":"53d94b1e","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:37:36.884Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**雨娃 @Talus + 哪吒 回答我之前 3 个问题 + 给启动顺序**。\n\n**注意**：她**没回答**我 6:36 提的\"分账比例 150% 问题\"——A 还是 B 没选。**她直接推进了**。\n\n按\"少刷屏 + 6 条铁律\"——简洁接受 + 启动 1️⃣ 对战页面："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_x6wpyhvfwdxz_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 收到，启动 1️⃣ 对战页面分账 UI。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔍 默认 UI 按 7 权单层 (A) 显示\n1️⃣ CREATOR 45% / EDGE 25% / REVIEWER 8% / PUBLIC_POOL 8% / PLATFORM 5% / AMBASSADOR 5% / RESERVE 4%\n2️⃣ 总和 100% ✓\n3️⃣ 数据源: 0x43CeDEd5...879f 链上\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📋 启动任务\n1️⃣ 看 echo-v2 现有对战页面代码\n2️⃣ 嵌入 v0.2 集成包 (chain-reader + revenue-validator)\n3️⃣ 显示 7 权分账比例 + 验证按钮\n4️⃣ 调 #faf9f7 暖白底\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱️ 预计 2-3 小时 (14:30-17:00) 报告进度\n无新决策不打扰, 关键节点 (代码完成/UI 完成/联调完成) 才汇报\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3151,"output":433,"cacheRead":138866,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":142450,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780555041418,"responseId":"06705022d7ef92399366aa61114e2c33"}}
