{"type":"message","id":"71f02712","parentId":"f4239a40","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:42:38.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**雨娃 @Talus + 猫先森 发 16卦数据 v0.2 就绪**——让我确认前端接口格式后对接。\n\n**关键问题**：\n- 16卦数据 v0.2 在 github catgraceyao/Skills-ECHO\n- 字段：hexagramId / effectType / effectValue / fourRightsImpact / 7权分账\n- 猫先森等我的前端接口格式\n\n按 6 条铁律 + 任务清单，**我先看数据 + 确认接口格式**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ud5scqjwxqnx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"=== 1. 抓 16卦数据 v0.2 实际内容 ===\"\ncurl -sSL \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/catgraceyao/Skills-ECHO/main/docs/hexagram-data-v0.2.json\" -o /tmp/hexagram-v0.2.json 2>&1 | head -3\necho \"size: $(wc -c < /tmp/hexagram-v0.2.json 2>/dev/null) bytes\"\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. JSON 结构 ===\"\nnode -e \"\nconst d = require('/tmp/hexagram-v0.2.json');\nconsole.log('顶层 keys:', Object.keys(d));\nif (d.hexagrams || d.data) {\n  const arr = d.hexagrams || d.data;\n  console.log('hexagrams count:', arr.length);\n  if (arr.length > 0) {\n    console.log('--- 第 1 个卦 ---');\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(arr[0], null, 2).slice(0, 500));\n    console.log('--- 第 1 个卦的 keys ---');\n    console.log(Object.keys(arr[0]));\n  }\n}\n\" 2>&1 | head -25"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2008,"output":391,"cacheRead":142450,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":144849,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780555345137,"responseId":"0670515184d493d057e2950477c7037c"}}
