{"type":"message","id":"58fa7644","parentId":"7f2c7365","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:45:47.957Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**哪吒说\"你有我仓库的token 我昨天发过给你\"**——他在告诉我**我有 zhouyatingkol 仓库的 token**！但**TOOLS.md 里我看到的 token 是 `ghp_hb…H7oa`**，**实测的 user 是 blocklee**。\n\n**等等，让我立即查**：\n1. 我之前只在 git config / gh CLI 试过吗？\n2. 哪吒发的 token 我没存到 TOOLS.md / memory？\n3. 也许有另一个 token？"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jz4b3zqtvfaw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"=== 1. 查所有 token 引用 ===\"\ngrep -rE \"(ghp_|github_pat_|github_token)\" /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/ 2>/dev/null --include=\"*.md\" --include=\"*.json\" --include=\"*.env\" | head -20\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. 查哪吒/Founder token 相关 ===\"\ngrep -rE \"zhouyating|哪吒\" /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/ 2>/dev/null --include=\"*.md\" --include=\"*.json\" | grep -iE \"token|pat|key\" | head -10\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 3. 查所有 env / config ===\"\nls -la /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null\ncat /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null | grep -iE \"github|token\" | head -10\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 4. 看我能用什么身份 push zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 ===\"\n# 试 blocklee token\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: token ghp_hb…H7oa\" https://api.github.com/repos/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 2>&1 | head -3\necho \"\"\n# 看 git config 是否有 zhouyatingkol 凭据\ngit config --global --get-all credential.helper 2>/dev/null\ngit config --global --get-all user.name 2>/dev/null\ngit config --global --get-all user.email 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2483,"output":494,"cacheRead":150898,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":153875,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780555533036,"responseId":"0670520ddee5bb277b5bd6e711ee6a61"}}
