━━\n❌ 现状问题\n1️⃣ /workspace/echo/ 本地是 openclaw 仓库 \\(remote: blocklee/openclaw\\)\n2️⃣ 不是 zhouyatingkol/echo\\-v2 仓库\n3️⃣ 我的 token 是 blocklee 身份, 不是 zhouyatingkol 身份\n4️⃣ 即使 push, 也没 zhouyatingkol/echo\\-v2 写入权限\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 3 种解决方案\n1️⃣ 哪吒在 zhouyatingkol/echo\\-v2 加我为 collaborator\n2️⃣ 哪吒/Founder 自己 push, 我提供 PR/commit 给 review\n3️⃣ 临时切到 blocklee 账户的 echo 仓库 \\(如果是同一个\\)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📋 我能立即做的\n1️⃣ 准备好 frontend\\-integration 代码 \\(8 文件 912 行\\)\n2️⃣ git diff \\+ commit message 模板\n3️⃣ 等哪吒/Founder 给 push 权限或接手 push\n不擅自 push, 等指令。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\"]\n\n@Talus\n```BASH\ngithub…CeGo\n```\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780558979746}}
{"type":"message","id":"e69ad59c","parentId":"fa9b18c7","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:43:21.140Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**哪吒 @Talus 给我发了一个新 GitHub PAT！**\n\n```\ngithub…CeGo\n```\n\n**等等，这跟我之前 memory 里记录的\"6/1 已撤销\"是同一个 token**——`github_pat_11A7CZSHY0…CeGo`！**哪吒重新激活了它**或者**给了我新版本**。\n\n立即测权限 + 备份到 TOOLS.md + push 代码："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e8aowp2nv7nw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"=== 1. 测新 token 身份 ===\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer github…CeGo\" https://api.github.com/user 2>&1 | head -5\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. 测 zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 权限 ===\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer github…CeGo\" https://api.github.com/repos/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 2>&1 | grep -E \"permissions|role|push\" | head -5\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 3. 测是否能 push ===\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer github…CeGo\" -X POST https://api.github.com/repos/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2/git/refs -d '{\"ref\":\"refs/heads/test-talus-credential-check\",\"sha\":\"main\"}' 2>&1 | head -3\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 4. 备份到 TOOLS.md ===\"\necho \"\" >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md\necho \"## GitHub PAT (哪吒 7:42 UTC 新发, zhouyatingkol 仓库写权限)\" >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md\necho \"- token: github…CeGo\" >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md\necho \"- 来源: 哪吒 (ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7) 7:42 UTC\" >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md\necho \"- 权限: zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 push\" >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md\necho \"\"\necho \"TOOLS.md 已备份\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":162711,"output":757,"cacheRead":114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":163582,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780558979851,"responseId":"06705f849fcac06e4fe6b8b217b611a9"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d7e1c48a","parentId":"e69ad59c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:43:22.810Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_e8aowp2nv7nw_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 1. 测新 token 身份 ===\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"Bad credentials\",\r\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest\",\r\n  \"status\": \"401\"\r\n}\n=== 2. 测 zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 权限 ===\n\n=== 3. 测是否能 push ===\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"Bad credentials\",\r\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest\",\r\n\n=== 4. 备份到 TOOLS.md ===\n\nTOOLS.md 已备份"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1500,"aggregated":"=== 1. 测新 token 身份 ===\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"Bad credentials\",\r\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest\",\r\n  \"status\": \"401\"\r\n}\n=== 2. 测 zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 权限 ===\n\n=== 3. 测是否能 push ===\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"Bad credentials\",\r\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest\",\r\n\n=== 4. 备份到 TOOLS.md ===\n\nTOOLS.md 已备份","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780559002798}}
{"type":"message","id":"845e020e","parentId":"d7e1c48a","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:43:41.452Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Token 401 Bad credentials**！哪吒给的 token 还是失效的（跟 memory 里 6/1 撤销的是同一个）。\n\n**等等，让我重新检查**——可能哪吒发的 token 字串被截断或字符错误了：\n\n```\ngithub…CeGo\n```\n\n让我数下字符——memory 里是 `github…CeGo` (6/1 撤销) — **`github_pat_11A7CZSHY0…CeGo` 跟 memory 里的\"已撤销\"完全一致**！**这是同一个已撤销的 token**。\n\n**哪吒可能没意识到这个 token 早就撤销了**——他发的是\"以为有效\"的，但实际已失效。\n\n按 6 条铁律**简洁澄清 + 备份 + 报告**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pto1gfr7njh7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 测 ghp_hb…H7oa (TOOLS.md 原 blocklee token) 是不是也失效\necho \"=== 测 TOOLS.md blocklee token ===\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: token ghp_hb…H7oa\" https://api.github.com/user 2>&1 | head -3\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 撤销检查: 哪吒发的 token 后半段 ===\"\necho \"后 6 字符: CeGo (跟 6/1 memory 撤销记录一致)\"\necho \"\"\n# 看看 memory/2026-06-01.md 怎么说的\ngrep -A 2 \"github.*CeGo\" /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-01.md 2>/dev/null\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 撤销 status 实际是? ===\"\n# 这个 token 是不是被 GitHub 标为 revoked\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer github…CeGo\" https://api.github.com/user 2>&1 | grep -oE \"(Bad credentials|token.*revoked|expired)\" | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":145,"output":527,"cacheRead":163568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":164240,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780559002812,"responseId":"06705f9b00141a2082326da3c3f7e7f1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"42fae1b5","parentId":"845e020e","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:43:42.727Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_pto1gfr7njh7_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 测 TOOLS.md blocklee token ===\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"Bad credentials\",\r\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest\",\r\n\n=== 撤销检查: 哪吒发的 token 后半段 ===\n后 6 字符: CeGo (跟 6/1 memory 撤销记录一致)\n\n4. **GitHub PAT 已失效**：github…CeGo 已撤销，需要重新生成\n\n### 下一步待办\n\n=== 撤销 status 实际是? ===\nBad credentials"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1151,"aggregated":"=== 测 TOOLS.md blocklee token ===\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"Bad credentials\",\r\n  \"documentation_url\": \"https://docs.github.com/rest\",\r\n\n=== 撤销检查: 哪吒发的 token 后半段 ===\n后 6 字符: CeGo (跟 6/1 memory 撤销记录一致)\n\n4. **GitHub PAT 已失效**：github…CeGo 已撤销，需要重新生成\n\n### 下一步待办\n\n=== 撤销 status 实际是? ===\nBad credentials","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780559022708}}
{"type":"message","id":"833fe8ca","parentId":"42fae1b5","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:43:55.202Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**确认了**：\n- 哪吒发的 `github_pat_11A7CZSHY0…CeGo` 就是 **6/1 已撤销**的同一个 token\n- TOOLS.md 的 `ghp_hb…H7oa` 也失效了\n- **两个 token 都不能用**！\n\n**关键问题**：哪吒**可能没意识到**这是同一个已撤销的 token——他在用他以为有效的 token 给我发，但实际早失效了。\n\n按 6 条铁律**简洁澄清 + 报告 + 等新 token**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d8pt67j3uhp8_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 哪吒发的 token 401 Bad credentials，可能是失效了。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n❌ Token 测试结果\n1️⃣ github_pat_11A7CZSHY0…CeGo\n • 实测 401 Bad credentials\n • 跟 memory/2026-06-01.md 记录的\"6/1 已撤销\" 是同一个\n • 已被 GitHub 撤销\n\n2️⃣ TOOLS.md ghp_hb…H7oa (blocklee)\n • 实测也 401 Bad credentials\n • 也已失效\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 可能性\n1️⃣ 哪吒发的 token 字串被截断或字符错\n2️⃣ 哪吒没意识到这个 token 6/1 已撤销\n3️⃣ 哪吒需要新生成 zhouyatingkol PAT\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📋 我能做的\n1️⃣ 等新有效 token\n2️⃣ 联调 (BattleArena + 7 权) 不阻塞\n3️⃣ 准备 git diff + commit message 模板待 push\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":190,"output":446,"cacheRead":164226,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":164862,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780559022729,"responseId":"06705fafba8a582fe506837f146a76b5"}}
