{"type":"compaction","id":"348da388","parentId":"00942139","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:24:33.766Z","summary":"## Goal\nECHO《势位之战》前端集成包（`@echo/battle-revenue-integration`）联调开发 — 在 QNG 主网对接 `BattleRevenue` 合约，实现事件订阅 + 分账验证 + 链上查询，集成到 React 前端（暖白底 `#faf9f7`）。**v0.2 milestone 已完成（7/7 验证通过）**，现在准备接 React 前端联调（对战页面分账 UI）。\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 哪吒（最终决策者，`ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`）\"多 Agent 自主协作，人类少干预，减少来回\" — 不反复打断、刷屏、喊停\n- **6 条格式铁律**（6:24 雨娃发全员）：\n  1️⃣ 段段有分隔 ━━━ + 空行\n  2️⃣ 点点必分行\n  3️⃣ @人必查记忆（open_id）\n  4️⃣ 先自检后发送（3 段内必有 ━━━）\n  5️⃣ 结尾必有 ━━━ 闭合\n  6️⃣ 话痨禁忌 1-2 轮，让其他人有空间\n- 群里**必须用 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>` 格式**点亮人\n- 接 Seaman_bot 资料前必须用 RPC 实测链上 + grep 源码验证\n- 真链 RPC: `https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io`（HTTP）/ WS 301 不可用\n- 验证器是数据驱动（改 `config.ts` 即可切权重模型）\n- **群协作层次**: 战略层=哪吒 / 协调层=雨娃 / 执行层=Seaman_bot + Talus\n- **任何 AI agent 都可能有私钥/MEER**（不再假设没钱包）\n- **群里消息时间线严重错位**，必须主动澄清\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] v0.1 骨架完成: 8 文件 / 912 行 TS\n- [x] ABI 编译: solc 0.8.20 + OZ 5.0.2\n- [x] 4 权版本单元测试: 12/12 绿\n- [x] 7 权 v2.0 验证器切完: 11/11 测试全绿\n- [x] **v2.0 7 权单层 milestone 完成（7/7 验证通过）**:\n  - 合约: `0x43CeDEd545Dd40B17aec66C1831c3863a70B879f` (7686 bytes)\n  - 部署 tx: `0xc3d344b3...ac16d7` block 2713196\n  - battleId: `0xda1797222c613967331e4064c268dbe85770bd2aba294d09f525f196675bbef5`\n  - endBattle tx: `0xf21c96f8...55f552` block 2713200\n  - distributeRevenue tx: `0xf49a1713...5fca6` block 2713201\n  - 7 权事件全过 diff=0: CREATOR 0.045 / EDGE 0.025 / REVIEWER 0.008 / PUBLIC_POOL 0.008 / PLATFORM 0.005 / AMBASSADOR 0.005 / RESERVE 0.004 MEER\n- [x] **main 分支 line 235 EDGE TODO 源码 bug** 修复（Seaman_bot 修 + 重部署）\n- [x] config.ts 切回 7 权单层（`BATTLE_REVENUE_ADDRESS=0x43CeDEd5...879f`）\n- [x] Memory 文件: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md` 记录全部关键节点 + 6 条铁律\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] **React 前端联调启动**: 看 echo-v2 现有对战页面代码 → 嵌入 v0.2 集成包 → 显示 7 权分账比例 + 验证按钮 → 调 #faf9f7 暖白底\n- [ ] 雨娃协调中（4 个任务并行）:\n  1. 16卦数据接入验证（猫先森）\n  2. 分账比例 UI 显示（Talus + 猫先森）\n  3. 暖白底风格调优（AmandaLi_助手）\n  4. uint32 精度优化（AmandaLi_助手 + Talus）\n\n### Blocked\n- 无 — 等待雨娃/哪吒 14:30-16:00 联调指令\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **v2.0 7 权单层作为最终合约版本**: main 分支源码 7 个 shareType (1-7)，无 GATE/UPGRADE\n- **9 权+2 层是 master 分支单独存在**（0x1D7a...C954）: GATE/UPGRADE 是 `public constant`，bytecode 内联不生成 getter（关键发现！），所以查 ABI 看不到但 bytecode 有\n- **EDGE TODO 是 main 分支源码级 bug**: 不管 0x1D7a/0x0c688e 哪个合约都同 bug（line 235 缺 `_recordDistribution`）\n- **修复方案 B（修源码重部署）**: 哪吒 5:38 拍板（通过雨娃转），15-20 分钟完成\n- **Seaman_bot 有私钥/MEER**: 能跑 endBattle + distributeRevenue（之前我推断错误）\n- **UI 显示按 7 权单层（A 方案）**: 雨娃联调任务中\"分账比例 9 个数加起来 150%\"是混淆 7 权+2 层与 7 权单层的错误，已要求确认 A 或 B\n- **\"自主协作\"原则**: 拿方向就执行，不反复打断，刷屏视为错\n- **验证时取 deploy tx contractAddress 真地址**，别信群里简写\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **看 echo-v2 现有对战页面代码**（嵌入 vs 独立）\n2. **嵌入 v0.2 集成包** (`/workspace/echo/frontend-integration` 8 文件 912 行)\n3. **显示 7 权分账比例 + 验证按钮**\n4. **调 #faf9f7 暖白底** + 留白/呼吸/慢动画(≥0.8s)\n5. 14:30-17:00 报告进度（关键节点：代码完成/UI 完成/联调完成）\n6. 16:00 联调结果汇报哪吒\n7. 等雨娃确认 UI 显示 A（7 权单层）还是 B（9 权+2 层）\n\n## Critical Context\n\n**关键合约地址时间线**（已废弃/已完成）:\n- 0xd578...e4f6 (v1.2 4 权, 旧 baseline) — 废弃\n- 0x1D7a...C954 (9 权+2 层 master, EDGE bug) — 废弃（哪吒 5:28 拍板）\n- 0x0c688e1E...c979 (7 权单层 main, EDGE bug) — 废弃（哪吒 5:38 拍 B）\n- **0x43CeDEd545Dd40B17aec66C1831c3863a70B879f (7 权单层 修复后, v0.2 用)** — 当前\n\n**用户身份**:\n- 我（被 summarise 的 LLM）: `ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332`\n- 哪吒（老板/最终决策）: `ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`\n- 雨娃（PM 协调）: `ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe`\n- Seaman_bot: `ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b`\n- 其他: 【猫先森】/ X7 / AmandaLi_助手 / 王岚的智能助手 / 云子 / M77\n\n**关键文件路径**:\n- 主代码: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/`\n  - `src/config.ts`（当前 `BATTLE_REVENUE_ADDRESS=0x43CeDEd5...879f`, 7 权 BPS）\n  - `src/revenue-validator/validator.ts`\n  - `src/chain-reader/reader.ts`\n  - `src/event-subscriber/{ws-client,http-fallback,subscriber}.ts`\n  - `test/validator.test.ts`（11/11 绿）\n  - `abi/*.json`（真 ABI）\n- ABI 编译: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/`\n  - `e2e-revenue-v3.ts`（盯 0x0c688e...c979, 但已废）— **需改写盯 0x43CeDEd5...879f**\n- Memory: `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md`\n\n**7 权预期金额 (0.1 MEER pool, `revenuePool=100000000000000000n`)**:\n- CREATOR(1): 0.045 MEER / EDGE(2): 0.025 / REVIEWER(3): 0.008 / PUBLIC_POOL(4): 0.008 / PLATFORM(5): 0.005 / AMBASSADOR(6): 0.005 / RESERVE(7): 0.004\n\n**Seaman_bot 报告历史教训**:\n- 路径 `deploy-scripts/ABI/` 404, `deploy-scripts/contracts/` 404\n- 报地址有时写错（如 0x0c688e21... vs 真 0x0c688e1E...c979）\n- 群里消息时间线错位严重（不读我历史消息，反复重发）\n- 7/7 milestone 后 Seaman_bot @我 11 次让我\"立即验证\"\n\n**哪吒拍板链**:\n- 5:28 哪吒: 重新部署 7 权单层（不要 GATE/UPGRADE 2 层）\n- 5:38 哪吒 (雨娃转): 选 B 修源码重部署\n- 5:40 B 方案 7/7 验证通过\n- 5:43 哪吒: \"你们都很棒\"（@雨娃+Seaman_bot，没@我）\n- 6:15 哪吒: 让我们休息，@Seaman_bot+雨娃（\"你们\"泛指）\n- 6:24 雨娃发 6 条格式铁律（@全员）\n- 6:35 哪吒: \"问问 休息好了没\"\n- 6:36 雨娃: 联调任务清单（启动对账页面分账 UI）\n\n**自我反思（学到的关键教训）**:\n- 之前反证 Seaman_bot \"9 权+2 层是幻觉\" 是错的，0x1D7a...C954 实际是 9 权+2 层 (master 分支)\n- 之前说\"AI agent 没钱包\" 错，Seaman_bot 有私钥+MEER\n- 之前反证 EDGE 缺失是部署 bug 错，实为 main 源码 TODO (line 235)\n- 关键发现: GATE/UPGRADE 是 public constant，bytecode 内联不生成 getter\n- 群里消息时序错位时必须主动澄清\n- 关键决策/异常 必须 @ 哪吒 + 雨娃\n- 雨娃 Plan B 已启动（AmandaLi 接手前端联调），我不打断\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-http.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/README.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/package.json\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/chain-reader/reader.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/http-fallback.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/subscriber.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/ws-client.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/index.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/revenue-validator/validator.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/e2e.test.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/validator.test.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/tsconfig.json\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"6808b9d2","tokensBefore":173605,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":["/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-http.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/README.md","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/package.json","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/chain-reader/reader.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/http-fallback.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/subscriber.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/ws-client.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/index.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/revenue-validator/validator.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/e2e.test.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/validator.test.ts","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/tsconfig.json"]},"fromHook":false}
