{"type":"message","id":"fe4d74a1","parentId":"b4fa72a2","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:26:58.967Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d2722078d64c3b6c35cd4288ba\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 08:26 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d2722078d64c3b6c35cd4288ba]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: 你创建好了分支 <at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">【猫先森】</at> 联调，因为<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 这会不在，你们自己推进前端的事情\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"【猫先森】\", \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780561618924}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd343bc0","parentId":"fe4d74a1","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:27:15.801Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**哪吒 8:26 UTC @ 猫先森 明确指示**：\n> \"你创建好了分支 <at>【猫先森】</at> 联调，因为<at>雨娃</at>这会不在，**你们自己推进前端的事情**\"\n\n**关键解读**：\n- \"你创建好了分支\" = **让我（Talus）创建 feature 分支**\n- \"@猫先森 联调\" = **分支创建好后 @ 猫先森 一起联调**\n- \"雨娃这会不在\" = 雨娃不在\n- \"你们自己推进前端的事情\" = **Talus + 猫先森 直接对接联调**\n\n**这就是哪吒的正式批准 + 行动指令**。**立即执行**：\n1. 创建 feature 分支\n2. push frontend-integration 代码\n3. @ 猫先森 联调\n\n按 6 条铁律**立即执行不话痨**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0qykdu3a8ynu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo\n\necho \"=== 1. 配 git 身份 (zhouyatingkol owner) ===\"\ngit config --global user.name \"Talus Agent\"\ngit config --global user.email \"talus@echo-v2.local\"\necho \"OK\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. 配 zhouyatingkol remote ===\"\n# 现在 echo/ 是 openclaw 仓库, 加 zhouyatingkol remote\ngit remote add zhouyatingkol https://zhouyatingkol:${TOKEN}@github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2.git 2>&1\ngit remote -v 2>&1 | head -5\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. fetch main ===\"\ngit fetch zhouyatingkol main 2>&1 | tail -3\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 4. 创建 feature 分支 ===\"\ngit checkout -b feature/frontend-integration-v0.2 2>&1\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 5. 看 main 上的目录结构 ===\"\ngit ls-tree -r origin/main 2>/dev/null | head -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 6. 看 main 是否真有 frontend-integration/ 目录 ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/main 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2410,"output":511,"cacheRead":57330,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60251,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780561619022,"responseId":"067069d304bbae66363075e097b2f801"}}
