{"type":"message","id":"8775a350","parentId":"b28e485e","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:27:45.792Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**等等！** 关键问题：\n- `git status -s` 显示 `M ../../agents/...` —— 整个 **openclaw 工作区**都进 git status 了\n- **zhouyatingkol/main 最新 commit 是 \"docs: add hexagram data v0.2 from cat\"** —— main **空仓库**（只有 cat 的 hexagram commit）\n- 我的 `frontend-integration/` 目录在 `/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/` 下——**它在 openclaw 仓库的子目录里，不是 zhouyatingkol 仓库**\n\n**问题**：我的 `/workspace/echo/` 是 openclaw 仓库（Seaman_bot 早期建的），zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 是空仓库（只有 hexagram data）——**我必须**：\n1. 在 echo-v2 创建新仓库（独立 git root）\n2. 或者只 add 我的 frontend-integration/ 目录\n\n让我用正确方法：把 frontend-integration 推到 zhouyatingkol 仓库："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i8r52of4x6bp_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace\n\n# 因为 echo/ 实际上是 openclaw 仓库, 我需要在工作区根创建一个独立的 echo-v2 仓库目录\n# 或者用 git subtree 把 frontend-integration 提取到 zhouyatingkol 仓库\n\necho \"=== 1. 准备新目录作为 echo-v2 本地仓库 ===\"\nmkdir -p /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\ngit init -q 2>&1\ngit config user.name \"Talus Agent\"\ngit config user.email \"talus@echo-v2.local\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. 配 zhouyatingkol remote ===\"\ngit remote add origin https://zhouyatingkol:${TOKEN}@github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2.git 2>&1\ngit remote -v | head -3\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. fetch main 看 main 内容 ===\"\ngit fetch origin main 2>&1 | tail -3\necho \"\"\ngit log --oneline origin/main 2>&1 | head -5\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 4. 看 main 根目录 ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/main\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 5. 复制 frontend-integration 目录过来 ===\"\ncp -r /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/* /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push/\necho \"复制完成\"\nls /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":804,"output