{"type":"message","id":"d5fb36cc","parentId":"ae1d120c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:28:00.293Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**重大发现！zhouyatingkol/echo-v2 仓库**：\n- main 上**已经有完整项目**（不是空仓库！）\n- 有 `frontend/`、`contracts/`、`backend/`、`src/`、`docs/` 等目录\n- 最关键：**有 `frontend/` 目录**——这可能跟我的 frontend-integration 重复！\n- main 最新 commit: \"docs: add hexagram data v0.2 from cat\"\n\n**等等，这意味着**：哪吒/雨娃之前让我\"push 到 echo-v2/frontend-integration\" —— 那个路径**不存在**，但 `frontend/` 已经存在！**我的代码应该放哪**？\n\n**等等，我之前问过路径问题，雨娃让我 push 到 `echo-v2/frontend-integration/`**——但**main 仓库里没这个目录**。\n\n让我看 `frontend/` 是什么："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_m9nd9zk057os_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\necho \"=== 1. 看 main 上 frontend/ 内容 ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/main:frontend 2>&1 | head -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 2. 看 main 上 src/ 内容 ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/main:src 2>&1 | head -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. 看 main 上 docs/ 内容 ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/main:docs 2>&1 | head -20\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 4. 看 main MEMORY.md 关键内容 ===\"\ngit show origin/main:MEMORY.md 2>&1 | head -40\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 5. 看 DEPLOYMENT-BATTLE-OF-POTENTIAL.md ===\"\ngit show origin/main:DEPLOYMENT-BATTLE-OF-POTENTIAL.md 2>&1 | head -30"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1007,"output":405,"cacheRead":62242,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63654,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780561667554,"responseId":"06706a04d5ecd81b71399d96615c2e58"}}
