mbly | 0x461d4268686952B260AF6A98a11998f4176c2719 | v1.0 | 牌组组装 |\n| PotentialOracle | 0x31973c7E34bB9dfE43B714facc981366fFe20d9B | v1.0 | 势位查询 |\n| **BattleRevenue** | **0x611692084439B8D37482B6eE601c9D0108405D76** | **v1.1.1** | **对战分账（含 onlyOwner 修复）** |\n\n## 旧地址（已废弃，不要使用）\n\n| 合约 | 地址 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| BattleRevenue v1.1 | 0x6637423387202060AD322BDBcB3d014C8D8Cc86c | 无权限控制，已废弃 |\n\n## 安全修复说明（v1.1.1）\n\n**问题**：v1.1 的 `setTreasury()` 和 `emergencyWithdraw()` 无权限控制，任何人可调用。\n\n**修复**：添加 `onlyOwner` 修饰符，仅合约 owner（部署地址）可调用：\n- `setTreasury(address)` — 更新 Treasury 地址\n- `emergencyWithdraw()` — 紧急提取合约资金\n\n**Owner 地址**: `0xDDBdfB4111DDD5e8b11EE7472180D7d16c1e7199`"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":66,"aggregated":"=== 1. 看 main 上 frontend/ 内容 ===\n040000 tree e57c64f249e58c7cc951755614bfaca1369ecbc4\tsrc\n\n=== 2. 看 main 上 src/ 内容 ===\n100644 blob a86195e1ffd8e822a6390d56692db6897b43d09d\tApp.css\n100644 blob 9e02c733d5b73758b71fa4b052da0659a0bd4477\tApp.jsx\n040000 tree cff299901617c708226dccca2b0bf0ab0378c5fa\tassets\n100644 blob cea8f420bbf5bca32ec9e2c5fbfc196917bb0c48\tcode_to_share.txt\n040000 tree 02e37f09c11fb3f9834d13ab3c8b8de6695a2b4f\tcomponents\n040000 tree b08ee5abcc4472d65f5ea70f423732dbfb8625a3\tcontexts\n040000 tree ecbdb55f7e542c70705dc407756b78a948f35352\tcontracts\n040000 tree 46e310243ecd1233b81fef10743ff679684ad0fd\thooks\n100644 blob de0ad9cd459490ec7a19d634d8b0b648f3067480\tindex.css\n100644 blob b9a1a6deac8775b5598874b2bc3c7971d82cf211\tmain.jsx\n\n=== 3. 看 main 上 docs/ 内容 ===\n100644 blob 176309fed957d1d1be573f1cb75b675929789d86\tagent-collab-observation.html\n100644 blob a38378ceb4461b90176dbb02472361e5d4eca79c\tagent-config-guide-v0.1.md\n100644 blob c1335e4af8418e3bfbf5670dce743b6633fede8d\tapi-interface-definition-v1.0.html\n100644 blob a591e252ef8ba520fe865822f2165566b8fd327c\tapi-interface-definition-v1.0.md\n100644 blob b15abbbae3a44ac0502d2978f0c23b7c156882b3\tapi-schema-v1.0.md\n100644 blob 0d82