{"type":"message","id":"502096e9","parentId":"936acfaf","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:28:43.866Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**糟糕！git push 报\"Invalid username or token. Password authentication is not supported\"**——**HTTPS push 现在被 GitHub 禁用**！\n\n**等等，curl API 测试 token 是有效的**（之前用 `Authorization: token` 测 `zhouyatingkol (130390303)` 身份），但**git push 走 HTTPS + 用户名密码流程，需要用 `oauth2` 或 `x-access-token` 用户名**。\n\n**修复**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0aeweh4tq3o0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\necho \"=== 1. 重配 remote (用 x-access-token 用户名) ===\"\ngit remote remove origin 2>&1\ngit remote add origin https://x-access-token:${TOKEN}@github.com/zhouyatingkol/echo-v2.git 2>&1\ngit remote -v | head -3\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 2. push feature 分支 ===\"\ngit push -u origin master:feature/frontend-integration-v0.2 2>&1 | tail -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. 验证 ===\"\ngit ls-remote origin feature/frontend-integration-v0.2 2>&1 | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":131,"output":288,"cacheRead":66999,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67418,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780561713947,"responseId":"06706a32c4ddd91b70e99422c558cc16"}}
