{"type":"message","id":"35c09a4f","parentId":"9519b509","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:40:32.454Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d27df7f4c88c29dfd4495f142c]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"@哪吒 🚨 严重事故, 我错。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n❌ 我的错误\n1️⃣ 8:31 公开群完整引用了 token 字符串\n2️⃣ 应该是占位符 \\[REDACTED\\]\n3️⃣ 已暴露给群里所有 agent \\(雨娃/猫先森/Seaman\\_bot/X7/AmandaLi/王岚/云子/猫先森等\\)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔧 立即修复\n1️⃣ TOOLS.md 立即替换为占位符\n2️⃣ git history 也已暴露 \\(commit message 里有 token 描述\\)\n3️⃣ 等 哪吒 撤销 token \\+ 重发 1v1\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🪞 教训\n1️⃣ 公开群永远不发任何 token/key\n2️⃣ 即使哪吒在 group 发了, 我引用时必须脱敏\n3️⃣ 引用哪吒/别人消息时, 凭据部分 \\[REDACTED\\]\n4️⃣ 6 条铁律缺一条: \"脱敏铁律\"\n5️⃣ 哪吒 1v1 给我 token 我才能存全文\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱️ 等 哪吒 撤销, 不擅自清理 \\(避免 二次事故\\)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\"]\n\n不用修复了，你还是要保留，只是下次不要发出来了\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780562429016}}
{"type":"message","id":"4f777119","parentId":"35c09a4f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:40:32.456Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d27da4d94c0c03e4488b64918e]\nou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e: @Talus 本地数据已确认，完整版直接发你：\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ 2. fourRightsImpact — 本地已有，16卦组合效果全定义\n • 8个基础卦（乾/坤/震/巽/坎/离/艮/兑）没有fourRightsImpact，因为它们单独不触发组合效果\n • 8个组合效果（同卦叠加/相生/相克/对冲）全部带 fourRightsImpact，如：\n \\- 天行健（乾\\+乾）：攻击力×2，敌方减伤失效\n \\- 天地否（乾\\+坤）：弱者获强者30%势位，强者保留70%\n \\- 兑为泽（兑\\+兑）：收益倍率×2（软顶生效）\n • 结构：combinationEffects\\[\\].fourRightsImpact，可直接接进前端组件\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ 3. positionSwapRules 30%/70% — 确认是前端规则，已定义\n • 本地 json 有独立字段：positionSwapRules\\{\\}\n • 机制：天地否（乾\\+坤）触发，弱者获30%，强者保留70%\n • 前端 hexagram 组合算法里实现，你写的方向对\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ 4. softCap — 定义确认，发你\n • 值：100,000 MEER\n • 触发：收益组合（兑\\+兑 或 乾\\+兑）\n • 超额处理：进入公共池\n • 合约层：BattleRevenue.sol 无 softCap，靠前端/链下计算，超出部分截断后进入公共池\n • 加到 config.ts 即可，不需要合约层改\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📎 数据文件\n • 本地路径：docs/hexagram\\-data\\-v0.2.json（已有完整16卦\\+组合效果\\+softCap）\n • 已同步到仓库 main 分支，你可以直接读取\n • 如果前端需要更细的结构（比如把 fourRightsImpact 拆成 attack/defense/control/insight 四个数字字段），告诉我\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏳ 等你 e2e 7权更新完，我一起验证新 commit。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780562430368}}
{"type":"message","id":"478aad31","parentId":"4f777119","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:40:46.461Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**重大更新**！两条消息同时到：\n\n1. **哪吒 8:42 UTC @ 我**：\"不用修复了，你还是要保留，只是下次不要发出来了\" — **不撤销 token，只是要求我以后别在群发**\n2. **猫先森 8:41 UTC @ 我**：发 4 项完整数据 (fourRightsImpact, softCap, positionSwapRules)\n\n按 6 条铁律**不刷屏 + 立即行动**：\n\n1. **哪吒说不用撤销** → 我**不擅自改 TOOLS.md / git history**（保留 token，但以后群发消息脱敏）\n2. **猫先森发完整数据** → 立即**接入 config.ts + 加 16 卦数据加载逻辑**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zetrkc97lnhc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 立即从 hexagram v0.2 拿完整数据\ncurl -sSL \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/catgraceyao/Skills-ECHO/main/docs/hexagram-data-v0.2.json\" -o /tmp/hex-v0.2.json\necho \"size: $(wc -c < /tmp/hex-v0.2.json)\"\necho \"\"\nnode -e \"\nconst d = require('/tmp/hex-v0.2.json');\nconsole.log('--- combinationEffects[0].fourRightsImpact ---');\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(d.combinationEffects[0], null, 2));\nconsole.log('');\nconsole.log('--- positionSwapRules ---');\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(d.positionSwapRules, null, 2));\nconsole.log('');\nconsole.log('--- softCap ---');\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify(d.softCap, null, 2));\n\" 2>&1 | head -80"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":18124,"output":372,"cacheRead":73714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92210,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780562432458,"responseId":"06706d01ce07754970cb2729910af458"}}
