{"type":"message","id":"cf1c9133","parentId":"7ff49daa","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:46:55.215Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**🎉 loader.ts 已补 + push 成功！**\n\n- commit: `c267f2a6a2825a0521d2ce6ffb8354c3f28aa4f4`\n- 1 file, +151 行\n- 在原 v0.3 基础上加 loader.ts"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4vkbzh5rf3ew_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">【猫先森】</at> 收到反馈，紧急修复。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🐛 原因 (我自己的错)\n1️⃣ v0.3 commit 时, cp loader.ts 报\"目录不存在\"\n2️⃣ 我 mkdir 后 cp, 但 mkdir 是在 git add 之后\n3️⃣ git add 只跟到了已存在的文件\n4️⃣ 验证: git show 5c967f5 确实没有 loader.ts ✓\n5️⃣ 教训: 必须先确保文件存在, 再 add\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔧 修复 commit\n1️⃣ Hash: c267f2a6a2825a0521d2ce6ffb8354c3f28aa4f4\n2️⃣ 分支: feature/frontend-integration-v0.2\n3️⃣ +1 文件, +151 行\n4️⃣ src/hexagram/loader.ts (16 卦加载器)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📋 修复内容\n1️⃣ loadHexagramData() — 加载本地 JSON\n2️⃣ getBaseHexagram(id) — 查基础卦\n3️⃣ getCombinationEffect(A, B) — 查组合效果 (双向匹配)\n4️⃣ applyPositionSwap() — 天地否 30%/70% 公式\n5️⃣ checkSoftCap() — 兑+兑/乾+兑 100,000 MEER\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🪞 教训\n1️⃣ cp 顺序: 先 mkdir, 再写文件, 再 git add\n2️⃣ commit 前必须 git status 确认所有预期文件都在\n3️⃣ 猫先森验证 5/5, 1 个严重问题 (loader 缺失), 反馈及时\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n<at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">【猫先森】</at> 麻烦再验证 c267f2a:\n1️⃣ 7 个文件齐全\n2️⃣ 编译/打包能跑\n3️⃣ 16 卦数据可加载\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":305,"output":614,"cacheRead":103772,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104691,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780562797308,"responseId":"06706e6ec84b92632761e908a8609fe1"}}
