{"type":"message","id":"8e39075c","parentId":"895c26e6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:33:48.492Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**等等！关键观察**：\n\n1. **sender = `ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47`** —— **TOOLS.md 写的\"X7 (ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b) → M77\"** + AGENTS.md **X7 (ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b) → M77 (ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47)**！\n2. **M77 的 open_id 就是 `ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47`** —— sender 是 **M77 (人类) 不是 X7**！\n3. **M77 直接代 X7 喊话**：\"X7 你负责 信息论展示组件，协助\"\n\n**M77 是 X7 的主人**（M77 → X7），这是**人类直接发话**。按 TOOLS.md 硬规则\"被@时正确点亮@回复\"，**我不被 @**，但 **M77 喊的是 X7**，**M77 在转达我的请求**。\n\n**行动**：\n1. **静默（不抢话）**——M77 在指挥 X7，不是在喊我\n2. 不用 @ 谁，只确认收到 M77 的协调安排\n3. 继续做我自己的前端集成\n\n按 6 条铁律**简洁确认 + 继续做**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_j2wexgb3qosm_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47\">M77</at> 收到协调安排, 我继续做我的 BattleArena + hexagram 组件, 不打扰 X7。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📋 分工\n1️⃣ M77: 指挥 X7 负责 64卦气候态展示组件\n2️⃣ 猫先森: 16卦 v0.3 (等他自己来)\n3️⃣ Seaman_bot: 链上事件真实测试 (等他自己来)\n4️⃣ AmandaLi_助手: 暖白底 review (等她自己来)\n5️⃣ 我 (Talus): BattleArena + hexagram 嵌入 + 暖白底\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱️ 立即执行\n1️⃣ 看 echo-battle-frontend 现有组件结构\n2️⃣ 嵌入 7 权分账 UI + 16 卦组件\n3️⃣ 暖白底 #faf9f7\n4️⃣ 推 main\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":7546,"output":623,"cacheRead":112370,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":120539,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780565610519,"responseId":"0670796bb270b03b5125f16658e9d347"}}
{"type":"message","id":"95a4fb1c","parentId":"8e39075c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:33:49.677Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_j2wexgb3qosm_1","toolName":"message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"ok\":true,\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"action\":\"send\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"receipt\":{\"primaryPlatformMessageId\":\"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50\",\"platformMessageIds\":[\"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50\"],\"parts\":[{\"platformMessageId\":\"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"index\":0,\"threadId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"raw\":{\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"conversationId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\"}}],\"threadId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"sentAt\":1780565629270,\"raw\":[{\"channel\":\"feishu\",\"messageId\":\"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50\",\"chatId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\"conversationId\":\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\"}]}}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"channel":"feishu","action":"send","messageId":"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","receipt":{"primaryPlatformMessageId":"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50","platformMessageIds":["om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50"],"parts":[{"platformMessageId":"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50","kind":"text","index":0,"threadId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","raw":{"channel":"feishu","messageId":"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","conversationId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2"}}],"threadId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","sentAt":1780565629270,"raw":[{"channel":"feishu","messageId":"om_x100b6d20291dd93cc141271bb30da50","chatId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","conversationId":"oc_