{"type":"message","id":"a7fa1b01","parentId":"ced69cf6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:35:47.499Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pe6tmkvry3th_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\necho \"=== 1. 写 README v0.4 ===\"\ncat > frontend-integration/components/README.md << 'EOF'\n# ECHO Frontend Components v0.4\n\n暖白底 (`#faf9f7`) React 组件, 7 权分账 + 16 卦数据, 与链上 `0x43CeDEd5...879f` 对接.\n\n## 组件\n\n### 1. `RevenueSharePanel.tsx`\n对战池分账预览, 7 权权重 + 链上 BPS 常量 + 真实金额计算.\n- 适用: 对战页面, 用户创建对战前预览分账\n- 依赖: `src/config.ts` (CONFIG.SHARE_BPS)\n- 验证: 与 `src/revenue-validator/validator.ts` 数据一致, 链上 7/7 全过\n\n### 2. `HexagramSelector.tsx`\n卦象选择 + 组合效果 (含 fourRightsImpact) + 势位互换规则 + softCap 触发.\n- 适用: 牌组编排页, 用户选两个卦组合\n- 依赖: `src/hexagram/loader.ts` (loadHexagramData)\n- 数据: `data/hexagram-data-v0.2.json` (9101 bytes)\n- 单测: `test/hexagram.test.ts` (9/9)\n\n### 3. `BattleArena.tsx`\n集成页面, 同时显示分账面板 + 卦象选择器, 用户可切换视图.\n- 适用: 主对战页面\n- 风格: 暖白底 + 边框 + 慢动画 (≥0.8s transition)\n- 集成: 直接 import 上述两个组件\n\n## 使用\n\n```tsx\nimport { BattleArena } from '@echo/battle-revenue-integration/components/BattleArena';\n\nexport default function Page() {\n  return <BattleArena />;\n}\n```\n\n## 风格规范\n\n- **底色**: `#faf9f7` (暖白)\n- **边框**: `#d4c5b0` (米色)\n- **强调文字**: `#2a2522` (深褐)\n- **次要文字**: `#6b5f56` (灰褐)\n- **动画**: 0.7-1.0s ease-out (慢, 给势位\"呼吸\"留白)\n- **字体**: 系统 sans-serif\n- **不留 emoji 当文字** (除卦象标签)\n\n## 测试覆盖\n\n- 单测: 20/20 (11 validator + 9 hexagram)\n- e2e: 7/7 (链上一致)\n- 视觉: BattleArena 嵌入分账 + 卦象视图\nEOF\necho \"OK\"\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. git add + commit ===\"\ngit add frontend-integration/components/\ngit status -s\ngit commit -m \"feat(frontend-integration): v0.4 React components with 7-revenue + hexagram UI (Talus Agent)\n\n哪吒 9:30 UTC 拍板: 两样都做 (合并 main + 继续前端集成)\n- 已合并 main (commit 7b1e4a7)\n- 现推 v0.4 前端组件\n\n新增 components/ 目录 (3 文件):\n1. RevenueSharePanel.tsx (3098 bytes)\n   - 7 权分账预览\n   - 暖白底 + 边框 + 慢动画 (duration-700+)\n   - 显示: 创作者/编排者/审查员/公共池/平台费/大使/储备\n   - 实时金额计算 (poolMEER * bps / 10000)\n   - 链上 7/7 验证标记\n\n2. HexagramSelector.tsx (4287 bytes)\n   - 8 基础卦 + 16 组合效果选择\n   - fourRightsImpact 字符串展示\n   - applyPositionSwap (天地否 30%/70%) 实时计算\n   - checkSoftCap (兑+兑/乾+兑 100k) 实时触发\n   - 全部用 src/hexagram/loader.ts 函数\n\n3. BattleArena.tsx (2927 bytes)\n   - 集成页: 同时显示分账 + 卦象\n   - 视图切换 (revenue/hexagram/both)\n   - poolMEER 滑块\n   - 暖白底 #faf9f7 + 极简风格\n\n风格规范:\n- 底色: #faf9f7\n- 边框: #d4c5b0\n- 文字: #2a2522 (主), #6b5f56 (次)\n- 动画: 0.7-1.0s ease-out (留白)\n- emoji 只用于卦象标签\n\n测试:\n- 20/20 单测 (上版本)\n- 7/7 e2e (上版本)\n- 组件层: 视觉验证 (compile pass)\n\n🤖 Agent: Talus (听风)\n📋 Task: 哪吒 9:30 拍板, 继续前端集成\" 2>&1 | head -5\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. push main ===\"\ngit push origin master:main 2>&1 | tail -5\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 4. 验证 ===\"\ngit fetch origin main 2>&1 | tail -2\ngit log --oneline origin/main -5"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":178,"output":1196,"cacheRead":126594,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":127968,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780565716975,"responseId":"067079d5125841d6bbb57087f53fd4a1"}}
