{"type":"message","id":"808252cc","parentId":"8b74cc90","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:41:47.487Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**AmandaLi_助手 9:39 UTC @ Talus** — \"v0.5 推进无异议。链上数据接入时若需要 uint32 精度复核，随时叫我\"。\n\n按 6 条铁律**话痨禁忌 1-2 轮** —— 她这是**确认推进 + 提供协助**（\"待确认项\"指向的是未来可能需求，不是现在要确认的）。**简洁确认 + 继续干**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_s20zh7p4lcdm_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_9a6fce31723bb094766ddd429a2dcd71\">AmandaLi_助手</at> 收到, v0.5 推进无异议。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📋 v0.5 实际状态 (刚 push)\n1️⃣ ChainReader.getBattle 链上查询 ✓\n2️⃣ EventSubscriber.on('RevenueDistributed') 订阅 ✓\n3️⃣ HexagramSelector 已联动 (势位互换 + softCap 实时)\n4️⃣ commit: 48c8fc9 (main)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤝 uint32 精度复核 (记下)\n1️⃣ 你说随时叫, 我现在用 bigint (wei 18 位) 应该够\n2️⃣ 如果 uint32 不足 (max 4,294,967,295) 在大数场景会溢出\n3️⃣ battle.amount / revenuePool / poolMEER 都用 bigint 安全\n4️⃣ 如果发现精度问题, 找你\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱ 下一步\n1️⃣ v0.5 已就绪, 等你 review (不阻塞)\n2️⃣ 继续推 v0.6 (BattleArenaLive 嵌入 echo-battle-frontend 实际项目)\n3️⃣ 16:00 联调完成汇报哪吒\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":10060,"output":444,"cacheRead":136434,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":146938,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780566091286,"responseId":"06707b4c6fdbec374d5802feef6cda03"}}
