{"type":"message","id":"4d861e82","parentId":"17ffb86d","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:48:42.983Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n0109j3tb7l5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\n# 用 python 编辑 BattleArenaLive.tsx 加 view 切换 + HexagramInfoTheory\npython3 << 'EOF'\nimport re\n\np = \"frontend-integration/components/BattleArenaLive.tsx\"\ns = open(p).read()\n\n# 1. 加 import\ns = s.replace(\n    \"import { HexagramSelector } from './HexagramSelector';\",\n    \"import { HexagramSelector } from './HexagramSelector';\\nimport { HexagramInfoTheory } from './HexagramInfoTheory';\"\n)\n\n# 2. 加 view 状态类型\ns = s.replace(\n    \"const [view, setView] = useState<'revenue' | 'hexagram' | 'both'>('both');\",\n    \"const [view, setView] = useState<'revenue' | 'hexagram' | 'info' | 'all'>('all');\"\n)\n\n# 3. 改 grid layout\ns = s.replace(\n    \"<div className={`grid gap-6 ${view === 'both' ? 'grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2' : 'grid-cols-1'}`}>\",\n    \"<div className={`grid gap-6 ${view === 'all' ? 'grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3' : 'grid-cols-1'}`}>\"\n)\n\n# 4. 加 HexagramInfoTheory\ns = s.replace(\n    \"{(view === 'hexagram' || view === 'both') && <HexagramSelector />}\",\n    \"\"\"{(view === 'hexagram' || view === 'all') && <HexagramSelector />}\n          {(view === 'info' || view === 'all') && <HexagramInfoTheory />}\"\"\"\n)\n\n# 5. 改视图按钮 (把 both 改 all, 加 info)\nold_buttons = \"\"\"<button\n              onClick={() => setView('revenue')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'revenue' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              分账\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setView('hexagram')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'hexagram' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              卦象\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setView('both')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'both' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              全屏\n            </button>\"\"\"\n\nnew_buttons = \"\"\"<button\n              onClick={() => setView('revenue')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'revenue' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              分账\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setView('hexagram')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'hexagram' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              卦象\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setView('info')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'info' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              信息论\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setView('all')}\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded transition-colors duration-700 ${view === 'all' ? 'bg-[#2a2522] text-white' : 'bg-white border border-[#d4c5b0] text-[#2a2522] hover:border-[#2a2522]'}`}\n            >\n              全部\n            </button>\"\"\"\n\ns = s.replace(old_buttons, new_buttons)\n\n# 6. 改 footer\ns = s.replace(\n    \"v0.5 · 实时数据 · 单测 20/20 + e2e 7/7 + AmandaLi 暖白底 review 通过\",\n    \"v0.6 · 实时数据 + 信息论 · 单测 20/20 + e2e 7/7 + AmandaLi 暖白底 review + X7 信息论组件\"\n)\n\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint(\"✅ BattleArenaLive.tsx 已嵌入 HexagramInfoTheory\")\nEOF\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 验证 ===\"\ngrep -E \"HexagramInfoTheory|view === 'info'|view === 'all'\" frontend-integration/components/BattleArenaLive.tsx | head -10\necho \"\"\n\n# 同步到本地\ncp frontend-integration/components/BattleArenaLive.tsx /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/components/\n\necho \"=== git add + commit ===\"\ngit add frontend-integration/components/\ngit status -s\ngit commit -m \"feat(frontend-integration): v0.6 — embed X7 HexagramInfoTheory into BattleArenaLive (Talus Agent)\n\nX7 9:43 UTC 接口确认:\n- HexagramInfoTheory() 无外部 props, 自带 64 卦数据\n- Hard labels 4 档 (高保真/均衡/低熵/高压缩比)\n- 纯前端计算熵/互信息\n\nBattleArenaLive v0.5 → v0.6 改动:\n1️⃣ import HexagramInfoTheory\n2️⃣ view state: 'revenue' | 'hexagram' | 'info' | 'all'\n3️⃣ 视图按钮加 '信息论' + 改 'both' 为 'all'\n4️⃣ grid layout: view==='all' 时 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 (3 列)\n5️⃣ 渲染 HexagramInfoTheory 组件 (view==='info' || view==='all')\n6️⃣ footer 标识 v0.6\n\n3 个面板:\n- RevenueSharePanel: 7 权分账 (链上 BPS 校验)\n- HexagramSelector: 8 基础 + 16 组合 + 势位 + softCap\n- HexagramInfoTheory: 64卦网格 + 熵/互信息 (X7 提供)\n\n🤖 Agent: Talus (听风)\n📋 Task: X7 9:43 协调嵌入\" 2>&1 | head -5\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== push ===\"\ngit push origin master:main 2>&1 | tail -5\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 验证 ===\"\ngit fetch origin main 2>&1 | tail -2\ngit log --oneline origin/main -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":332,"output":1746,"cacheRead":167772,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":169850,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780566492820,"responseId":"06707cdd04ca125de452408ac3d33d2c"}}
