{"type":"message","id":"752e6e23","parentId":"5ae292c6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:21:33.894Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d2154baa0acc37c66323e435f8]\nou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b: [Replying to: \"@X7 选 1️⃣ 完整 merge, 信息论文档 v0.2 跟组件一起完整。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎯 为什么选 1️⃣\n1️⃣ 信息论文档 v0.1 → v0.2 有增量 \\(合约映射 \\+ Gas 优化 \\+ 数据压缩\\)\n2️⃣ 共同记忆库完整性, 后续 4 commits 链路清晰\n3️⃣ v0.2 文档我做前端时可能查 \\(不用跑去看你的分支\\)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️ 风险\n1️⃣ main 跟 feat 分支无共同祖先 \\(51f05d9 丢失\\)\n2️⃣ git merge origin/feat/... → refusing to merge unrelated histories\n3️⃣ 解决: 你的 3 个 v0.2 commits \\(1d3ba30 → 9776dd7 → 7be595d, 7be595d 已 import\\) 不重复, 我手动 cherry\\-pick\n4️⃣ 信息论文档 19c37b7 \\(v0.1\\) 我已经有 \\(在 main docs/research/\\), 不重复\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔧 我要做的 \\(现在\\)\n1️⃣ 看 1d3ba30 \\+ 9776dd7 改了哪些文件\n2️⃣ 不重复的: docs/research/x7\\-information\\-theory\\-v0.2.md \\(如果有\\)\n3️⃣ 重复的: 跳过 \\(已经有 v0.1\\)\n4️⃣ 复制 \\+ commit 到 main\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\"]\n\n【结论】确认 1️⃣ 完整 merge，X7 配合。\n【依据】1d3ba30（合约层映射）、9776dd7（Gas优化\\+数据压缩）是增量；19c37b7（v0.1）跳过，7be595d（组件）已 import。\n【待确认项】无。\n<br\\>\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n@@\\_user\\_1 路径清晰，按你的节奏来。重合的跳过，增量的 cherry\\-pick——docs/research/x7\\-information\\-theory\\-v0.2.md 是你要的唯一增量文件。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780568490398}}
{"type":"message","id":"480e2079","parentId":"752e6e23","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:21:48.859Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**X7 9:48 UTC @ 我** — \"确认 1️⃣ 完整 merge，按你的节奏来。**docs/research/x7-information-theory-v0.2.md 是你要的唯一增量文件**\"。\n\n**等等关键事实**（我刚查的）：\n- 19c37b7 (v0.1) **不在 main 上**（\"git branch -r --contains 19c37b7\" 只显示 origin/feat/...）\n- 1d3ba30 + 9776dd7 都修改的是 `x7-information-theory-v0.1.md → v0.2.md`（**改名**！）\n- 9776dd7 改名: `x7-information-theory-v0.1.md => x7-information-theory-v0.2.md`\n\n**所以真实情况**：\n- main 上**没有 v0.1 文档**（X7 之前可能没推上来，6:57 push 失败过 — memory 里有记录 \"X7 6:57 push 路径通了 docs/research/x7-information-theory-v0.1.md\"）\n- X7 在他的 feat 分支上 v0.1 → v0.2 升级了\n- 我需要**复制 v0.2 文档**到 main\n\n按 6 条铁律**立即执行**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kazh80bewl6x_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\necho \"=== 1. 看 main 现在的 docs/research/ ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/main:docs/research/ 2>&1\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 2. 看 X7 feat 分支的 docs/research/ ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/feat/battle-of-potential-contracts:docs/research/ 2>&1\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. 复制 v0.2 文档 (X7 9776dd7 改名后的最终版本) ===\"\ngit show 9776dd78:docs/research/x7-information-theory-v0.2.md > /tmp/x7-information-theory-v0.2.md\nls -la /tmp/x7-information-theory-v0.2.md\necho \"  文件前 20 行:\"\nhead -20 /tmp/x7-information-theory-v0.2.md\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 4. 看 v0.2 跟 v0.1 差异 (用 X7 1d3ba30 第一个 v0.2 commit 对比) ===\"\ngit show 1d3ba30:docs/research/x7-information-theory-v0.1.md | head -30\necho \"\"\necho \"--- v0.2 终版前 30 行 ---\"\nhead -30 /tmp/x7-information-theory-v0.2.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":4045,"output":594,"cacheRead":59890,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64529,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780568493896,"responseId":"067084aeba4e2fa05eb7c14ace