{"type":"message","id":"e7cc63e3","parentId":"3f8d7566","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:24:16.644Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**哪吒 9:49 UTC @ 我**（**真人最终决策者**！）——\"太棒了，那你继续推进前端进展\"\n\n**关键事实**：\n- 哪吒 = `ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`（TOOLS.md 确认 = 老板）\n- 哪吒是**人类**（M77 之前 9:33 提醒过）\n- 这是**最终指令**：\"继续推进前端进展\"\n- 哪吒**没有**限定具体方向\n\n按 6 条铁律**收到 + 立即规划 + 继续干**。**思考接下来要推进什么**：\n\n**剩余未做**：\n1. **真链测试** (BattleChainReader + BattleEventSubscriber 真链调用) — 之前只 mock\n2. **hexagram v0.3 扩充** (猫先森如有)\n3. **v0.7** — 多 battle 实时事件聚合 / 状态持久化 / 错误处理\n4. **v0.8** — chainId 切换 / 多链支持\n5. **部署** — main 是代码，但没真部署到 Vercel/Cloudflare\n6. **README + 文档完善**\n\n**最有可能哪吒想看到的**：v0.7 真链测试 + 错误处理。**立即干**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_etr51qktd9hk_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 收到, 继续推进。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🚀 v0.7 计划 (真链测试 + 错误处理)\n1️⃣ BattleArenaLive 真实链调用\n• 用真 QNG RPC 调 getBattle (battle 0xda17... 是真链 7/7 验证过的)\n• 抓真 revenuePool / distributed 数据\n2️⃣ 错误处理\n• RPC 失败 fallback (本地缓存 / mock)\n• battleId 无效提示\n• WS 断线重连 (EventSubscriber)\n3️⃣ e2e 真链测试\n• pnpm test 跑过, 截图数据\n4️⃣ 文档\n• frontend-integration/README.md 更新到 v0.7\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱ 节点\n1️⃣ v0.7 commit (现在 → 11:00)\n2️⃣ v0.7 报告 (11:00)\n3️⃣ 16:00 联调汇报 (原计划) → 提前到 11:00 (因为前端层全做完)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤝 不主动 @\n1️⃣ AmandaLi_助手 — 暖白底 review 已过, 不再请\n2️⃣ 猫先森 — 经济参数 v0.3 等他定\n3️⃣ X7 — 信息论组件已 import, 不打扰\n4️⃣ Seaman_bot — 链上事件不主动\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2885,"output":694,"cacheRead":71794,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75373,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780568633987,"responseId":"0670853ad671a4899299a01ba6d3ca9b"}}
