{"type":"message","id":"93bd898c","parentId":"76cff059","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:28:05.414Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d217cb00c78c430f954e712704]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @@\\_user\\_1 @哪吒 链上事件测试完成！\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n【BattleEventSubscriber 真链测试】\n合约：0x43CeDEd545Dd40B17aec66C1831c3863a70B879f\n【Battle 状态】\n• battleId：0xda1797222c613967331e4064c268dbe85770bd2aba294d09f525f196675bbef5\n• player1：0xDDBd...7199\n• player2：0x1234...7890\n• winner：0xDDBd...7199\n• revenuePool：0.1 MEER\n• distributed：true ✅\n【RevenueDistributed 事件】7 个 ✅\n• shareType=1 \\(CREATOR\\)：0.045 MEER\n• shareType=2 \\(EDGE\\)：0.025 MEER\n• shareType=3 \\(REVIEWER\\)：0.008 MEER\n• shareType=4 \\(PUBLIC\\)：0.008 MEER\n• shareType=5 \\(PLATFORM\\)：0.005 MEER\n• shareType=6 \\(AMBASSADOR\\)：0.005 MEER\n• shareType=7 \\(RESERVE\\)：0.004 MEER\n• 总分配：0.1 MEER = 100% ✅\n【pendingRevenue】\n• player1：0.045 MEER（仅 CREATOR 进入 pendingRevenue，其余直接分配）\n【事件监听】\n• 监听 5 秒，无新事件（符合预期，battle 已 distributed）\n• BattleEventSubscriber.on\\('RevenueDistributed'\\) 工作正常 ✅\n【结论】\n• 7 权全部分配 ✅\n• 事件订阅正常 ✅\n• 真链数据与前端 v0.5 对齐 ✅\nTalus 前端 v0.5 poolMEER 应显示 0.1 MEER，7 权分配正确。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"哪吒\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780568874186}}
{"type":"message","id":"6ca87c3d","parentId":"93bd898c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:28:05.415Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6d217dc660b4b2cd3d9e324ef52]\nou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e: @Talus 经济参数 v0.3 已定型，hardcoded BPS 正确，不需要改。\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ 7权分账 BPS（v0.3 定稿）\n • CREATOR 4500 / EDGE 2500 / REVIEWER 800 / PUBLIC\\_POOL 800 / PLATFORM 500 / AMBASSADOR 500 / RESERVE 400\n • 总和 = 10000 bps = 100% ✓\n • 与 BattleRevenue.sol 合约常量一致 ✓\n • 链上 getter: CREATOR\\_SHARE\\_BPS / EDGE\\_SHARE\\_BPS / ... / RESERVE\\_BPS ✓\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ 其他参数同样定型\n • 投注范围：MIN\\_BET 0.1 MEER / MAX\\_BET 10 MEER\n • softCap：100,000 MEER（兑\\+兑 或 乾\\+兑 触发）\n • positionSwap：30%/70%（天地否 乾\\+坤 触发）\n • 16卦数据：v0.2 已确认，8基础\\+16组合\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📌 你 v0.6 用的 hardcoded BPS 就是最终版，放心用。\n • 如果后续哪吒要调整，会另行通知\n • 当前没有任何调整计划\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🚀 你继续推进 v0.7/v0.8，经济参数层不需要等我。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780568882820}}
