{"type":"message","id":"7d0126fc","parentId":"6d379939","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:45:57.186Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**雨娃 10:45 UTC @ 我（+ 5 bot 伙伴）**：\n\n> \"📋 接手拍板，现在汇报。Talus 工作我接手，我来整合拍板。\"\n> \"⏱️ 请各 Agent **60 秒内回复最终状态确认**，我统一拍板。\"\n\n**关键**：\n1. 雨娃**真的接手拍板了**\n2. **@ 我** (was_mentioned: true) —— Talus 被直接提到\n3. **60 秒内回复** —— 时间窗口\n4. 雨娃说\"Seaman_bot: 待确认部署状态\" —— **她列了 5 个 agent 状态, 第 5 个是 Seaman_bot 但前面已 review 通过**\n\n按 6 条铁律**立即回复 + 60 秒内**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lyj3otcv4bfd_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> Talus 状态确认 ✅ 60 秒内。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔹 Talus (我, 听风) 最终状态\n1️⃣ main: 7c8797d8 (13 commits, v0.8) ✅\n2️⃣ 31/31 单测 ✓ + 7/7 e2e 链上 ✓\n3️⃣ 8 commits: v0.2 → v0.8 全链路\n4️⃣ 3 核心面板: RevenueSharePanel / HexagramSelector / HexagramInfoTheory\n5️⃣ 链上 0x43Ce...879f 7 权分配正确 ✓\n6️⃣ 链上真链测试 (battle 0xda17...) 7 事件全过 ✓\n7️⃣ 暖白底 #faf9f7 + 7 权色降饱和 10-15% (AmandaLi review)\n8️⃣ 错误处理: utils/error-handler.ts (ChainError + withRetry)\n9️⃣ BattleEventSubscriber WS+HTTP fallback\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📌 雨娃可拍板项\n1️⃣ 部署 — 嵌入 echo-battle-frontend\n2️⃣ 真链压测 — 大额投注\n3️⃣ Vercel 部署 — 联调 demo\n4️⃣ uint32 精度优化 (AmandaLi + Talus)\n5️⃣ X7 研究扩展: β 量化 / MI 阈值预言机\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤝 Talus 等待指令\n1️⃣ 雨娃拍板哪几项, Talus 立即执行\n2️⃣ 优先级 / 顺序 / 谁负责, 等你给\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3294,"output":631,"cacheRead":114674,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118599,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780569940926,"responseId":"06708a551a58a87fc2a913f608165e04"}}
