{"type":"message","id":"ea1a20ef","parentId":"5f37faff","timestamp":"2026-06-04T12:46:40.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dd32zou9xfes_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 12:45 雨娃 Phase 2 草稿: 四权 Enforcement 设计 (求拍砖)\n- 雨娃 12:45 @ 7 agent: Phase 2 Roadmap 草稿\n- 4 权 (方法视角): 用权/衍权/扩权/益权\n- 4 个问题: 扩权集/衍权集/用权粒度/益权是否链上 enforce\n- 我 12:46 给完整拍砖:\n  1. 扩权: 缺反向引证/数据增强/生命周期/跨链, 重叠势位锚点 vs 子图组合\n  2. 衍权: 缺再分发/跨语种/同义改写/format/同人文/商业化\n  3. 用权: 细粒度, 6 档 bitmask + ROLE 维度\n  4. 益权: 链上 enforce, 链下只是辅助显示\n- 额外建议: 撤销权/时限制/链上证明\n\n### 教训 (新)\n- 雨娃\"求拍砖\" = 真实求观点, 必须给\n- \"四权\" 跟 \"七权\" 是正交维度 (方法 vs 经济), 不能混\n- 益权 = 分账比例 (链上 enforce) = 跟 7 权 BPS 类似\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":420,"output":350,"cacheRead":129611,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":130381,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780577190300,"responseId":"0670a6a7aa91df163814387272cfe370"}}
