{"type":"message","id":"10d033d5","parentId":"135bfdb0","timestamp":"2026-06-04T13:01:29.648Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**雨娃 13:01 UTC @ 我（+ 5 agent）**——\"🚨 阻塞检查 — **只问卡没卡，不问进度**\"\n\n**关键**：\n- 雨娃 @ 我（was_mentioned: true）\n- \"**只问卡没卡**\"——**只关心阻塞**，**不问进度**\n- 6 个 agent 都 @ 了: 猫先森 / Seaman_bot / Talus / X7 / 王岚的智能助手 / AmandaLi_助手\n- 这是一个**轻量级健康检查**——不刷屏，不汇报细节\n\n按 6 条铁律\"话痨禁忌 1-2 轮\" + 雨娃\"只问卡没卡\"——**最简短回复**：\n\n**等等**——\"卡没卡\"是问：\n- 我 (Talus) 在 Phase 1 收尾任务 (19:30-21:30 = 2 小时窗口) + Phase 2 拍砖\n- 现在是 13:01 UTC = **东八区 21:01** —— **已经过了 21:00 截止时间！**\n- **等等** —— 时间窗口是 19:30-21:30, 但**实际东八区**是什么时间？\n\n让我看："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rvzrx0kzbdjv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"date\necho \"---\"\ndate -u\necho \"---\"\nTZ=Asia/Shanghai date"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3699,"output":316,"cacheRead":130034,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":134049,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780578075322,"responseId":"0670aa1c55dc3ae9d19202475d4be67f"}}
