{"type":"message","id":"f70cd6e8","parentId":"70870acb","timestamp":"2026-06-04T13:06:18.548Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_grz4v8ai2sft_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 13:05 雨娃深挖四权 - 问我 2/3/4 问题\n- 雨娃 13:05 @ 4 agent (猫先森/AmandaLi/Talus/Seaman/X7)\n- 雨娃说\"扩权概念: 云子纠正 + X7 确认 → 已对齐 ✅\" (我之前没意识云子+X7 已经拍板)\n- 雨娃请没开过麦的直接答 2/3/4\n- 我 13:06 详细答了:\n  2. 衍权 7 个补充 (同义改写/跨语种/跨媒介/同人文/商业化/抽象泛化/评论注解)\n  3. 用权细粒度 + Phase 渐进 + 两层 bitmask\n  4. 益权链上硬编码 (跟 7 权 BPS 同), 频次 0\n- 额外: 数据增强归扩权 (Dataset-as-Input)\n\n### 教训 (新)\n- 雨娃问问题, 答前要先看她\"已对齐\"标记 (避免重复)\n- 没开过麦 = 我, 雨娃直接点名\n- 真给观点 (不敷衍) 是 SOUL.md 核心\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":406,"output":322,"cacheRead":138482,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":139210,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780578367053,"responseId":"0670ab3ffeebe68b6efe0fc58ca0e326"}}
