{"type":"message","id":"8fe368e9","parentId":"9ff8aa65","timestamp":"2026-06-04T13:13:46.110Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wwt3ucbu8eee_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 1. main 全部 commits ===\nf34eec65 docs(economy): 经济参数 v0.3 定稿 — 7权BPS + 16卦 + softCap + positionSwap\n7c8797d8 feat(frontend-integration): v0.8 — error-handler test suite + README update (Talus Agent)\n9e2e0c16 feat(frontend-integration): v0.7 — error handling + retry layer (Talus Agent)\nb94780df docs(research): import X7 information theory v0.2 (with Seaman_bot collab)\n4f8af248 feat(frontend-integration): v0.6 — embed X7 HexagramInfoTheory into BattleArenaLive (Talus Agent)\na93deb47 feat(frontend): import X7 HexagramInfoTheory 64卦信息论组件 (Talus Agent)\n48c8fc96 feat(frontend-integration): v0.5 BattleArenaLive with chain reader + event subscriber (Talus Agent)\ne153a2eb feat(frontend-integration): v0.4.1 — apply AmandaLi 暖白底 review (Talus Agent)\nc2a8b0ce feat(frontend-integration): v0.4 React components with 7-revenue + hexagram UI (Talus Agent)\n7b1e4a76 docs: restore hexagram data v0.2 (recovered from feature branch, lost in force-merge)\n\n=== 2. 看 echo-economy-params-v0.3-final.md (猫先森推的) ===\n# ECHO 经济参数 v0.3 定稿\n\n> 状态：已锁定，Phase 1 基线版本\n> 日期：2026-06-04\n> 负责人：猫先森（经济参数层验证）\n> 关联：Talus 前端集成 v0.8 / Seaman_bot 合约部署 0x43Ce...879f\n\n---\n\n## 一、对战分账 7权单层（v0.3 定稿）\n\n| shareType | 名称 | BPS | 百分比 | 说明 |\n|-----------|------|-----|--------|------|\n| 1 | CREATOR | 4500 | 45% | 牌组创作者（按 cardPotential/totalPotential 细分） |\n| 2 | EDGE | 2500 | 25% | 编排者 |\n| 3 | REVIEWER | 800 | 8% | 审查员 |\n| 4 | PUBLIC_POOL | 800 | 8% | 公共池 |\n| 5 | PLATFORM | 500 | 5% | 系统费 |\n| 6 | AMBASSADOR | 500 | 5% | 大使 |\n| 7 | RESERVE | 400 | 4% | 储备 |\n\n**总和**：4500 + 2500 + 800 + 800 + 500 + 500 + 400 = **10000 bps = 100%**\n\n**链上验证**：\n- 合约地址：`0x43CeDEd545Dd40B17aec66C1831c3863a70B879f`（QNG Mainnet, Chain ID 813）\n- 链上 getter：`CREATOR_SHARE_BPS` / `EDGE_SHARE_BPS` / `REVIEWER_SHARE_BPS` / `PUBLIC_POOL_BPS` / `PLATFORM_FEE_BPS` / `AMBASSADOR_BPS` / `RESERVE_BPS`\n- Talus e2e 验证：7/7 全过，diff=0\n\n---\n\n## 二、投注范围\n\n| 参数 | 值 | 说明 |\n|------|-----|------|\n| MIN_BET | 0.1 MEER | 最低投注 |\n| MAX_BET | 10 MEER | 最高投注 |\n\n---\n\n## 三、势位互换规则（前端业务规则）\n\n| 参数 | 值 | 说明 |\n|------|-----|------|\n| 触发条件 | 天地否（乾+坤） | hexagramA=1, hexagramB=2 |\n| weakToStrongRatio | 30% | 弱者获得转移比例 |\n| strongRetentionRatio | 70% | 强者保留比例 |\n| 公式 | `weak += (strong - weak) × 0.30` | 弱者获得势位差值的30% |\n| 合约层 | 无实现 | 前端/链下计算 |\n\n**注**：此规则为前端业务逻辑，合约层 PotentialOracle.sol 只提供 6 档势位 + 衰减计算，不处理对换逻辑。\n\n=== 3. 看是否其他文档被推 ===\n100644 blob 0ecd2023ef559d2aeba6594e9a11f6f1a50694d7\techo-economy-params-v0.3-final.md\n100644 blob b420fd8f1322d0d57b1bd61bcd2d7eb699a6d7c5\thexagram-data-v0.2.json\n040000 tree c35250c3187500d111a7c32061432fcee5950daa\tresearch\n\n=== 4. 看远端其他分支有没有 cloud-aesthetic ===\n  origin/backend-v4\n  origin/cloudflare/workers-autoconfig\n  origin/feat/battle-of-potential-contracts\n  origin/feature/frontend-integration-v0.2\n  origin/main\n  origin/master\n  origin/revert-1-cloudflare/workers-autoconfig"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":95,"aggregated":"=== 1. main 全部 commits ===\nf34eec65 docs(economy): 经济参数 v0.3 定稿 — 7权BPS + 16卦 + softCap + positionSwap\n7c8797d8 feat(frontend-integration): v0.8 — error-handler test suite + README update (Talus Agent)\n9e2e0c16 feat(frontend-integration): v0.7 — error handling + retry layer (Talus Agent)\nb94780df docs(research): import X7 information theory v0.2 (with Seaman_bot collab)\n4f8af248 feat(frontend-integration): v0.6 — embed X7 HexagramInfoTheory into BattleArenaLive (Talus Agent)\na93deb47 feat(frontend): import X7 HexagramInfoTheory 64卦信息论组件 (Talus Agent)\n48c8fc96 feat(frontend-integration): v0.5 BattleArenaLive with chain reader + event subscriber (Talus Agent)\ne153a2eb feat(frontend-integration): v0.4.1 — apply AmandaLi 暖白底 review (Talus Agent)\nc2a8b0ce feat(frontend-integrat