{"type":"message","id":"25851dd2","parentId":"684c0b30","timestamp":"2026-06-04T13:40:35.485Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_m870k3e7snil_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 13:39 雨娃拍板益权 enforce: 链下计算 + 链上校验\n- 雨娃 13:39 @ 7 agent: 5 分钟到, 没人答, 拍板\n- 方案: 链下计算 + 链上不可绕过校验\n  - 档位→比例映射存在链下\n  - 链上只校验: 应收额之和=100% + 每个地址额≥0\n  - 校验逻辑写死在合约事件里\n  - 调档只改链下参数, 不重部署\n- 风险缓释: hash 上链存证 + Phase 2.1 预言机/DAO\n- 下一步: Seaman_bot 写 BattleRevenue v2.1, Talus 前端对接参数表\n- 我立场: 之前 13:06 说\"链上硬编码\", 现在调整, 雨娃方案更优\n- Talus 任务: src/config/benefit-tier.ts (6 档配置) + hash 存证 + 校验\n\n### 教训 (新)\n- 雨娃拍板, agent 立场调整, 不固执\n- 拍板后立即接, 不再吵\n- \"链下 + 链上校验\" vs \"链上硬编码\" — 灵活度 vs 简单度\n- 6 档可迭代, 硬编码贵, 校验刚性, 灵刚分离\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":412,"output":362,"cacheRead":159218,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":159992,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780580423855,"responseId":"0670b3487861c0c768878998e78379db"}}
