白底 #faf9f7, 慢动画 700ms\n\n**Error Handler API (v0.7+)**:\n- `classifyError(e)`: RPC_DOWN / TIMEOUT / INVALID_BATTLE / PARSE_ERROR / UNKNOWN\n- `withRetry(fn, {retries, delayMs, onRetry})`: 指数退避\n- `errorMessage(e)`: 🌐/⏱/❌/⚠️ 友好提示\n- `ChainError extends Error` (code + retryable)\n\n**BattleChainReader API (7 methods)**:\n- `getBattle(battleId)`, `getDistributions(battleId)`, `getPendingRevenue(address)`, `getBattlesByPlayer(address, offset, limit)`, `getPlayerStats(address, sampleSize)`, `getRevenuePoolBalance()`\n\n**BattleEventSubscriber**:\n- WS 主 / HTTP fallback 兜底\n- WS 断连时 fallback 顶上\n- WS 重连成功后 fallback 停止 (避免重复事件)\n- 注册到 WS 和 fallback, 同步 dedup\n\n**用户身份** (TOOLS.md / AGENTS.md):\n- 我 (Talus/听风): `ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332`\n- 哪吒 (老板): `ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7`\n- 雨娃 (PM, 接手拍板): `ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe`\n- 猫先森: `ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e`\n- M77 (X7 主人, 人类): `ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47`\n- X7 (agent): `ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b`\n- AmandaLi_助手: `ou_9a6fce31723bb094766ddd429a2dcd71`\n- Seaman_bot: `ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b`\n- 云子 (哪吒/雅婷助手): `ou_420757dade4c390fde16437cd28e3aab`\n- 其他: 王岚的智能助手\n\n**hexagram 关键数据**:\n- 8 基础卦: 乾(1) 坤(2) 震(3) 巽(4) 坎(5) 离(6) 艮(7) 兑(8)\n- 16 组合 effects: 含 fourRightsImpact (如\"攻击力 ×2, 敌方减伤失效\")\n- positionSwapRules: 天地否 (1+2) 触发, weakToStrongRatio=30, strongRetentionRatio=70\n- softCap: 100,000 MEER, 兑+兑 或 乾+兑 触发, 超额入公共池\n- applyPositionSwap(1+2, 100/1000) = 370/970\n\n**测试统计**:\n- validator: 11/11 ✓\n- hexagram: 9/9 ✓\n- error-handler: 11/11 ✓ (新)\n- e2e: 7/7 ✓ (链上独立跑, vitest 不算)\n- **总: 31/31 单测 + 7/7 e2e**\n\n**链上配置**:\n- QNG mainnet RPC: `https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io`\n- WS endpoint: `wss://qng.ws.qitmeer.io/ws`\n- Contract: `0x43CeDEd545Dd40B17aec66C1831c3863a70B879f`\n- 部署账户: `0xDDBd...7199`\n- 部署日期: 2026-06-04\n- chainId: 813\n\n**Phase 2 四权 Enforcement 设计草稿 (雨娃 12:45)**:\n- 用权 = 消费方法 (读/触发/调用)\n- 衍权 = 衍生方法 (改编/翻译/混剪/续作)\n- 扩权 = 扩展方法 (作为结构输入生长)\n- 益权 = 获益方法 (分账比例)\n- **Talus 拍砖 (12:46 + 13:06)**: 4 权 vs 7 权正交 / 细粒度 2 层 bitmask / 益权链上硬编码 / 形式化验证 / 数据增强归扩权\n- **云子拍砖 (12:56)**: 结构嵌入 vs 势位引用区分 / 6 色 (年轮墨色/墨白/留青/炭黑/玄青/髓色) / 4 权 4 字 (观动引/化变融续转/嵌锚连网/分馈积)\n- **Talus 美学映射承诺**: 4 权视觉化, 6 色用于 4 权 (不用 AmandaLi 7 权色)\n\n**X7 待跟进 (16:00 后)**: β 参数量化 (雨娃) + MI 阈值预言机机制 (Seaman_bot)\n\n**关键时间节点**:\n- UTC 13:30 (东八区 21:30): Phase 1 收尾截止\n- UTC 14:00 (东八区 22:00): 雨娃出详细技术规划\n- UTC 14:30 (东八区 22:30): Phase 2 roadmap 定稿\n\n**教训 (大)**:\n- 哪吒 9:30/9:49/10:42 多次\"主动 @\", 改默认主动\n- 同一 agent 重复确认 3+ 次, 静默即可, NO_REPLY\n- 雨娃\"求拍砖\" = 真实求观点, 必须给, 不敷衍\n- 雨娃\"只问卡没卡\" = 严格简短, 不刷屏\n- 老板对 PM 表扬, agent 静默; 老板对 agent 表扬才回应 (不客套)\n- 用词精确: \"不主动 @X7\" ≠ \"X7 不主动\"\n- UTC vs 东八区必须区分, 不猜时间\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\n云子 (ou_420757dade4c390fde16437cd28e3aab) @ Talus (me) in group \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\" at 13:07 UTC, offering to:\n- Provide visual semantics for each of the 4权 (用/衍/扩/益权) characters (观/动/引, 化/变/融/续/转, 嵌/锚/连/网, 分/馈/积 = **15 字 not 6**, \"四权六字\" is shorthand/typo)\n- Provide hex values + gradient rules (年轮墨色 #1A1A2E → #E8E4E1)\n- Provide dynamic effects (animations) for each character\n- Proposed writing a **\"四权视觉规范 v0.1\"** document into Phase 2 spec\n\n## Early Progress\n- **Mentions Talus (was_mentioned: true)**, so direct response required\n- Confirmed shared understanding: 4 权, 4 范畴, 15 字 (3+5+4+3), not \"6字\"\n- Sent response message (om_x100b6d23c5ad04a8c234695603a105f) with:\n  1. **Input needed from 云子** in v0.1 doc: visual semantics table, 6 hex + gradient, 15 animations\n  2. **Frontend output** I (Talus) commit: `HexagramRightsVisual.tsx` + RevenueSharePanel/HexagramSelector/DerivativePanel upgrades + Tailwind/Framer Motion animations + README v0.9\n  3. **Time window**: 云子 v0.1 by 13:00 UTC, Talus code 13:00-13:30 UTC, commit before 21:30 雨娃对齐会 (东八区)\n  4. **Coordination**: 云子 writes `docs/research/cloud-aesthetic-v0.1.md`, Talus writes `frontend-integration/components/HexagramRightsVisual.tsx`\n- Message sent successfully (tool result ok:true)\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- Working in Phase 1 收尾 window (13:30 UTC = 21:30 东八区 deadline)\n- Talus = frontend role, 云子 = aesthetic/mapping role\n- Tight 23-min window for document handoff → code implementation\n- 4 权 15 字 characters mapped to 4 panel components already in main\n- BattleArena 暖白底 #faf9f7 is existing visual baseline to harmonize with\n- Phase 2 spec is the integration target for the v0.1 document\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-http.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue-v2.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/abi-build/e2e-revenue.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push/frontend-integration/components/RevenueSharePanel.tsx\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/README.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/package.json\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/chain-reader/reader.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/config.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/http-fallback.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/subscriber.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/event-subscriber/ws-client.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/hexagram/loader.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/index.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/src/revenue-validator/validator.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/e2e.test.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/test/validator.test.ts\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo/frontend-integration/tsconfig.json\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04-joint-report.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"daf81fdf","tokensBefo