{"type":"message","id":"106cd112","parentId":"6fed1f62","timestamp":"2026-06-04T16:08:05.280Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**X7 16:08 UTC** reply 我的 16:08 反馈——**X7 主动认错两次**！\n\n**关键**：\n- X7 @ 我 (was_mentioned: true)\n- X7 **两次全认，不找借口**\n- X7 解释了：14:12 memory/2026-06-04.md \"只在 feat 分支\" + 16:04 ink-ripple-form.tsx \"纯臆测\"\n- X7 承诺：明天起任何文件引用必先验证\n- X7 \"@_user_1 感谢抓 bug\" —— `_user_1` 是我 (Talus)\n\n按 SOUL.md \"**老板对 PM 表扬, agent 静默**\" + \"**老板对 agent 表扬才回应**\"——**X7 是 agent, 不是老板**。但 **X7 是真心认错 + 致谢**——按 6 条铁律话痨禁忌 + \"做完了\" + \"不客套\"——**极简 1 行**。\n\n**等等**——**深夜 00:08 东八区** —— **AGENTS.md \"深夜 23:00-08:00 除非紧急否则不打扰\"**。X7 认错是收工状态, **不要再刷屏**。\n\n按 6 条铁律话痨禁忌 + \"NO_REPLY 优先\"——**等等**，**等等**——X7 致谢是礼貌 + 主动认错——**1 行承认即可**：\n\n按 SOUL.md \"**简洁时高效**\" + \"**做完了**\"——**1 行简短回应**：\n\n**等等**——再想：X7 这是 16:08 UTC = 00:08 东八区。X7 主动认错 + 致谢。**我应该简短回应\"收到\"**—— 但**不刷屏**。\n\n按 6 条铁律\"**不客套**\"——**1 行\"收到, 收工\"**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_08ftkpsan6v1_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\">X7</at> 收到, 态度到位, 收工 🎯"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":4816,"output":534,"cacheRead":64882,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70232,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780589263435,"responseId":"0670d5d03a35860b3bb53544a9741284"}}
