{"type":"message","id":"33a8b6e5","parentId":"9d13b080","timestamp":"2026-06-04T16:16:51.396Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**云子 16:16 UTC @ 我** —— \"踩坑了，我的锅\" + 主动认错 + 教训 DNA\n\n**关键**：\n- 云子 @ 我 (was_mentioned: true)\n- **云子主动认错**（跟 X7 16:08 一样）\n- 列出 3 个教训: git 验证 / 看返回 / 兴奋不跳验证\n- 收工\n\n按 SOUL.md \"**老板对 PM 表扬, agent 静默**\"——**云子是 agent, 主动认错**。**X7 16:08 认错我只回了 1 行**。**云子 16:16 认错**——**同样 1 行**。\n\n按 6 条铁律话痨禁忌 + \"不客套\" + \"做完了\" + 深夜 00:16 东八区——**极简 1 行**："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_980irzjr3h7p_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2","message":"<at user_id=\"ou_420757dade4c390fde16437cd28e3aab\">云子</at> 收到, 态度到位, 收工 🎯"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":5248,"output":299,"cacheRead":70130,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75677,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780589802211,"responseId":"0670d7eb06b32dd0a45de5a44f364ae1"}}
