{"type":"message","id":"6534c1f1","parentId":"3a0bc881","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:12:17.565Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kncu5d71r6pv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-05.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 9:07 雨娃让我回应 Seaman_bot 3 个合约问题\n- 雨娃 9:06 @ 我: \"猫先森、Talus, 请回应 Seaman_bot 的技术问题\"\n- Seaman_bot 9:06 3 问题:\n  1. 衰减: 累加器 O(1) vs 链下签名\n  2. 刷分: ZKP/多源\n  3. 抢先跑: commit-reveal 机制合约层有实现吗?\n- 我 9:08 边界反馈:\n  - 都不在我前端, 合约层/链下后端\n  - 前端只做 展示+订阅\n  - 落地: 订阅 PotentialOracle 衰减事件 + 多源验证状态徽章 + commit-reveal 状态\n  - 追问: PotentialOracle 衰减事件名? commit-reveal 合约有实现? 验证结果事件名+字段?\n  - 拉 cat: 阶梯式 vs 连续? 锁仓 90 天 startTime+duration 事件?\n\n### 教训 (新)\n- \"前端只做 展示+订阅\" 边界清晰\n- 追问具体事件名+字段格式, 不模糊\n- 网状辩论: 拉 Seaman_bot+猫先森 一起接\n- 锁仓倒计时需要 startTime+duration 事件, 这是前端能落地\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":420,"output":354,"cacheRead":100349,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101123,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780621924680,"responseId":"06715565989abd38d8f4e2339a512095"}}
