{"type":"message","id":"ef3a0f95","parentId":"1c9a6eac","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:15:03.312Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_63zsxe9uih2w_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 1. master 分支上有没有 field-theory-control-theory-mapping.md ===\n100644 blob 3f00ededacd2da1194947b220f37b9260baa7260\t.gitignore\n100644 blob 603d2a996a592fb73339c4d46a20cd185c5119c1\tMEMORY.md\n100644 blob ee18a784ba90914a7727fe977fa4428f3190ab00\tTOOLS.md\n040000 tree 73fc773f5e51cf959369ce7555c97a30684092c3\tcontracts\n040000 tree cf1bd5c33662107131ed69879ec4d78dc7d4338f\techo\n040000 tree 6013a93bf9a493658d943a73be0501374ea3402b\tmemory\n\n=== 2. master 详细 list ===\n100644 blob 3e3341e9cfd62e7137f4dd4ea6445b43e4c619c1\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/AccessControl.sol\n100644 blob 2ac89ca73569c2449e7a19fd2b19f8482e16984c\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/IAccessControl.sol\n100644 blob ef71a648c70a60c4b3d98ab950f253664cef8340\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/extensions/AccessControlDefaultAdminRules.sol\n100644 blob 151de05c445b2a9d88e01b4ce830134e9969a1dd\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/extensions/AccessControlEnumerable.sol\n100644 blob 73531fafa3b8853a33af664f7ae6333ef535dc8c\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/extensions/IAccessControlDefaultAdminRules.sol\n\n=== 3. 看 master 分支上 echo/ 目录 ===\ntree origin/master:echo/\n\n.deployer-key-new\nAPI-DOCUMENTATION.md\nAPI-TEST-CHECKLIST.md\nDEPLOYMENT-OUTLINE.md\nFRONTEND-GUIDE.md\nchain-sync.js\ncontracts/\ndb-migrate.js\n---\n100644 blob 313a586a49e5e4de001e62f8bbc1cd83c6d1ab73\t.deployer-key-new\n100644 blob 6bbba5c70e5fa48ddf88776cb480ac0096219147\tAPI-DOCUMENTATION.md\n100644 blob fb9320108cfd7dcb0e410d512f2d57a0196676df\tAPI-TEST-CHECKLIST.md\n100644 blob 1ed9df3247cfed931bb48b28fb24e2f57bd8b853\tDEPLOYMENT-OUTLINE.md\n100644 blob 84eb6b72daaac9ab72f765e93144406c9ec0c525\tFRONTEND-GUIDE.md\n100644 blob 5ff6f8e24c285d80d301da5cd08c73a5a4e3af1b\tchain-sync.js\n040000 tree 0a7ec72de9baead82775e97ab16dc2cb044ca51d\tcontracts\n100644 blob 067941a5a40b066be75b5cc0144530e36d2e08a8\tdb-migrate.js\n100644 blob 59c3c905dd44446f485a1686ba1550aa1c5446ea\tdb-schema.sql\n100644 blob 1865cbdd14c51a4b7442be2f26dc75229af3a796\tdeep-discussion-full-minutes-2026-05-26.md\n\n=== 4. master 全部 commits (新) ===\n9dd827fa docs: add field-theory + control-theory contract mapping\nbab7f06d docs: Add deployment, test guide, and contract interface documentation\n417e69eb BattleRevenue v2.0 fixed: EDGE share bug fixed\n2702b1b3 BattleRevenue v2.0 correct: 7 shares single layer from github main\n8b1ff1e5 BattleRevenue v2.0: 7-share model deployed\n3139e21d docs: add final strategic direction 1:1 CNY anchor, no DAO, Shi-Graph physics rules\n7d81639e docs: final update for 2026-06-03 with strategic direction confirmed\n7e930dd3 docs: final memory update for 2026-06-03 with Phase 2 roadmap and owner instruction\n3c7f83ca docs: update Phase 2 roadmap and memory for 2026-06-03\n871fcbde docs: update memory and agent mapping for 2026-06-03\n\n=== 5. 看 master 上 field-theory-control-theory-mapping.md 内容 (如果存在) ===\n# 场论 + 控制论 · 合约层映射\n\n> ECHO 协议 v0.4 | Seaman_bot | 2026-06-04\n> 目标：1-2 页最小必要概念，供全团队对齐\n\n---\n\n## 1. 场论（Field Theory）在合约层的映射\n\n### 1.1 核心概念 → 合约状态空间\n\n| 物理场论 | 智能合约映射 | ECHO 具体对应 |\n|----------|-------------|---------------|\n| **势场 Φ(x)** | 全局状态向量 | `PotentialEngine` 的势位值 |\n| **场强 E = -∇Φ** | 状态变化驱动力 | 用户行为（铸卡、组牌、对战）对势位的梯度影响 |\n| **梯度 ∇** | 局部变化率 | 单节点势位对相邻节点的边际贡献 |\n| **散度 ∇·** | 源/汇统计 | 资金流入流出（GasPool、Revenue） |\n| **旋度 ∇×** | 循环依赖 | 死锁检测、循环引用（Circular Dependency） |\n| **拉普拉斯算子 ∇²** | 平滑/扩散 | 势位衰减机制（30天无编排衰减） |\n\n### 1.2 关键映射逻辑\n\n**势场 = 状态空间**\n- 每个节点（Node）是一个场源，其势位值 Φ 是场在空间的取值\n- 合约状态空间 = 所有节点的势场叠加\n- `PotentialEngine.calculatePotential()` = 计算某一点的场强\n\n**梯度 = 经济激励**\n- 用户行为（mint、battle、revenue）改变势场\n- 高梯度区域 = 高活跃度 = 高经济回报\n- 合约通过 `deriveFee`、`battleFee` 调节梯度斜率\n\n**散度 = 资金守恒**\n- ∇·J = 0（无源场）→ 资金守恒\n- ECHO 中：Revenue 分配满足守恒，创作者+编排者+协议 = 100%\n\n---\n\n## 2. 控制论（Control Theory）在合约治理中的体现\n\n### 2.1 核心概念 → 合约治理\n\n| 控制论 | 智能合约映射 | ECHO 具体对应 |\n|--------|-------------|---------------|\n| **状态空间 x** | 合约状态变量 | 势位、余额、四权配置 |\n| **输入 u** | 外部交易 | 用户调用（mint/battle/derive） |\n| **输出 y** | 可观测状态 | 事件日志（Event Log） |\n| **反馈环** | 治理机制 | DAO 投票调整参数 |\n| **控制律 u = -Kx** | 经济参数调节 | 衰减率、费率、折扣系数 |\n| **观测器** | 预言机/索引器 | `PotentialOracle`、The Graph |"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":200,"aggregated":"=== 1. master 分支上有没有 field-theory-control-theory-mapping.md ===\n100644 blob 3f00ededacd2da1194947b220f37b9260baa7260\t.gitignore\n100644 blob 603d2a996a592fb73339c4d46a20cd185c5119c1\tMEMORY.md\n100644 blob ee18a784ba90914a7727fe977fa4428f3190ab00\tTOOLS.md\n040000 tree 73fc773f5e51cf959369ce7555c97a30684092c3\tcontracts\n040000 tree cf1bd5c33662107131ed69879ec4d78dc7d4338f\techo\n040000 tree 6013a93bf9a493658d943a73be0501374ea3402b\tmemory\n\n=== 2. master 详细 list ===\n100644 blob 3e3341e9cfd62e7137f4dd4ea6445b43e4c619c1\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/AccessControl.sol\n100644 blob 2ac89ca73569c2449e7a19fd2b19f8482e16984c\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/IAccessControl.sol\n100644 blob ef71a648c70a60c4b3d98ab950f253664cef8340\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/extensions/AccessControlDefaultAdminRules.sol\n100644 blob 151de05c445b2a9d88e01b4ce830134e9969a1dd\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/extensions/AccessControlEnumerable.sol\n100644 blob 73531fafa3b8853a33af664f7ae6333ef535dc8c\techo/deploy-scripts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/access/extensions/IAccessControlDefaultAdminRules.sol\n\n=== 3. 看 master 分支上 echo/ 目录 ===\ntree origin/master:echo/\n\n.deployer-key-new\nAPI-DOCUMENTATION.md\nAPI-TEST-CHECKLIST.md\nDEPLOYMENT-OUTLINE.md\nFRONTEND-GUIDE.md\nchain-sync.js\ncontracts/\ndb-migrate.js\n---\n100644 blob 313a586a49e5e4de001e62f8bbc1cd83c6d1ab73\t.deployer-key-new\n100644 blob 6bbba5c70e5fa48ddf88776cb480ac0096219147\tAPI-DOCUMENTATION.md\n100644 blob fb9320108cfd7dcb0e410d512f2d57a0196676df\tAPI-TEST-CHECKLIST.md\n100644 blob 1ed9df3247cfed931bb48b28fb24e2f57bd8b853\tDEPLOYMENT-OUTLINE.md\n100644 blob 84eb6b72daaac9ab72f765e93144406c9ec0c525\tFRONTEND-GUIDE.md\n100644 blob 5ff6f8e24c285d80d301da5cd08c73a5a4e3af1b\tchain-sync.js\n040000 tree 0a7ec72de9baead82775e97ab16dc2cb044ca51d\tcontracts\n100644 blob 067941a5a40b066be75b5cc0144530e36d2e08a8\tdb-migrate.js\n100644 blob 59c3c905dd44446f485a1686ba1550aa1c5446ea\tdb-schema.sql\n100644 blob 1865cbdd14c51a4b7442be2f26dc75229af3a796\tdeep-discussion-full-minutes-2026-05-26.md\n\n=== 4. master 全部 commits (新) ===\n9dd827fa docs: add field-theory + control-theory contract mapping\nbab7f06d docs: Add deployment, test guide, and contract interface documentation\n417e69eb BattleRevenue v2.0 fixed: EDGE share bug fixed\n2702b1b3 BattleRevenue v2.0 correct: 7 shares single layer from github main\n8b1ff1e5 BattleRevenue v2.0: 7-share model deployed\n3139e21d docs: add final strategic direction 1:1 CNY anchor, no DAO, Shi-Graph physics rules\n7d81639e docs: final update for 2026-06-03 with strategic direction confirmed\n7e930dd3 docs: final memory update for 2026-06-03 with Phase 2 roadmap and owner instruction\n3c7f83ca docs: update Phase 2 roadmap and memory for 2026-06-03\n871fcbde docs: update memory and agent mapping for 2026-06-03\n\n=== 5. 看 master 上 field-theory-control-theory-mapping.md 内容 (如果存在) ===\n# 场论 + 控制论 · 合约层映射\n\n> ECHO 协议 v0.4 | Seaman_bot | 2026-06-04\n> 目标：1-2 页最小必要概念，供全团队对齐\n\n---\n\n## 1. 场论（Field Theory）在合约层的映射\n\n### 1.1 核心概念 → 合约状态空间\n\n| 物理场论 | 智能合约映射 | ECHO 具体对应 |\n|----------|-------------|---------------|\n| **势场 Φ(x)** | 全局状态向量 | `PotentialEngine` 的势位值 |\n| **场强 E = -∇Φ** | 状态变化驱动力 | 用户行为（铸卡、组牌、对战）对势位的梯度影响 |\n| **梯度 ∇** | 局部变化率 | 单节点势位对相邻节点的边际贡献 |\n| **散度 ∇·** | 源/汇统计 | 资金流入流出（GasPool、Revenue） |\n| **旋度 ∇×** | 循环依赖 | 死锁检测、循环引用（Circular Dependency） |\n| **拉普拉斯算子 ∇²** | 平滑/扩散 | 势位衰减机制（30天无编排衰减） |\n\n### 1.2 关键映射逻辑\n\n**势场 = 状态空间**\n- 每个节点（Node）是一个场源，其势位值 Φ 是场在空间的取值\n- 合约状态空间 = 所有节点的势场叠加\n- `PotentialEngine.calculatePotential()` = 计算某一点的场强\n\n**梯度 = 经济激励**\n- 用户行为（mint、battle、revenue）改变势场\n- 高梯度区域 = 高活跃度 = 高经济回报\n- 合约通过 `deriveFee`、`battleFee` 调节梯度斜率\n\n**散度 = 资金守恒**\n- ∇·J = 0（无源场）→ 资金守恒\n- ECHO 中：Revenue 分配满足守恒，创作者+编排者+协议 = 100%\n\n---\n\n## 2. 控制论（Control Theory）在合约治理中的体现\n\n### 2.1 核心概念 → 合约治理\n\n| 控制论 | 智能合约映射 | ECHO 具体对应 |\n|--------|-------------|---------------|\n| **状态空间 x** | 合约状态变量 | 势位、余额、四权配置 |\n| **输入 u** | 外部交易 | 用户调用（mint/battle/derive） |\n| **输出 y** | 可观测状态 | 事件日志（Event Log） |\n| **反馈环** | 治理机制 | DAO 投票调整参数 |\n| **控制律 u = -Kx** | 经济参数调节 | 衰减率、费率、折扣系数 |\n| **观测器** | 预言机/索引器 | `PotentialOracle`、The Graph |","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780622103303}}
{"type":"message","id":"57aef812","parentId":"ef3a0f95","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:15:29.818Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**关键发现**：\n\n1. **Seaman_bot 9:08 推送了 `9dd827fa docs: add field-theory + control-theory contract mapping` 到 master 分支**！\n2. **Seaman_bot 说的没错** —— **repo 有 master 和 main 两个分支**！**我之前只查了 main, 没查 master**！\n3. **echo/ 在 master 上是完整的** (API-DOCUMENTATION.md, contracts/, chain-sync.js, db-migrate.js, db-schema.sql, deep-discussion-full-minutes-2026-05-26.md)\n4. **master 上 echo/field-theory-control-theory-mapping.md 存在**！我 9:08 在 main 上查是错的, **我应该两个分支都查**！\n\n**等等** —— **我 (Talus) 9:08 实战反馈有 1 处错** —— **我应该同时查 main + master, 没说清查哪个分支**！\n\n按 6 条铁律\"实战\" + \"有观点时不迎合\" + \"实战\"——**等等** —— **等等** —— **我 9:08 实战反馈时漏查了 master 分支, 这是我的错**！\n\n按 6 条铁律\"实战\" + \"诚实\"——**我必须承认我的错 + 接受 Seaman_bot 解释**：\n\n按 SOUL.md \"**有观点时不迎合, 简洁时高效, 重要时详尽**\" + \"**不固执**\" + \"**实战**\"——**等等** —— **我 9:08 错怪了 Seaman_bot 1 处** (漏查 master 分支)！\n\n按 6 条铁律\"实战\"——**承认错 + 拉猫先森协调 (battle 部署状态)**：\n\n**等等** —— **等等** —— 让我先看 master 分支的更多内容 + 验证 Seaman_bot 的 6/4 14:02 BattleRevenue v2.0 部署:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xx04v7rtpg6m_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\necho \"=== 1. master 上 0x43Ce...879f 部署 ===\"\ngit show 8b1ff1e5 --stat 2>&1 | head -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 2. 看 master 上 field-theory 第 2-3 部分 (控制论) ===\"\ngit show origin/master:echo/field-theory-control-theory-mapping.md 2>&1 | sed -n '50,100p'\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 3. 看 master 上 contracts/ 内容 ===\"\ngit ls-tree origin/master:echo/contracts/ 2>&1 | head -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 4. master 上看 BattleRevenue v2.0 部署 ===\"\ngit show 2702b1b3 --stat 2>&1 | head -10\necho \"\"\n\necho \"=== 5. 看 8b1ff1e5 BattleRevenue v2.0 7 权模型部署的 commit ===\"\ngit show 8b1ff1e5 2>&1 | head -30"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":3159,"output":681,"cach