{"type":"message","id":"a7354674","parentId":"57aef812","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:15:29.995Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_xx04v7rtpg6m_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 1. master 上 0x43Ce...879f 部署 ===\ncommit 8b1ff1e550f4ab5e70354d671f61af05bd30e1b8\nAuthor: Seaman_bot <seaman@echo.bot>\nDate:   Thu Jun 4 12:58:46 2026 +0800\n\n    BattleRevenue v2.0: 7-share model deployed\n\n echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json     | 1391 ++++++++++----------\n echo/deploy-scripts/contracts/BattleRevenue.sol    |  105 +-\n ...eployment-battlerevenue-v2.0-1780548982048.json |    9 +\n echo/deploy-scripts/scripts/create-battle-v2.0.js  |   84 ++\n\n=== 2. 看 master 上 field-theory 第 2-3 部分 (控制论) ===\n| **观测器** | 预言机/索引器 | `PotentialOracle`、The Graph |\n| **稳定性** | 系统安全 | 死锁检测、紧急干预（EmergencyIntervention） |\n\n### 2.2 关键映射逻辑\n\n**负反馈 = 经济稳定**\n- 势位过高 → 增加衰减率（自动降温）\n- 铸造过多 → 提高 deriveFee（抑制通胀）\n- 控制律：`fee = baseFee + K·potential`（K 为调节系数）\n\n**前馈 = 预测治理**\n- 死锁预检 = 前馈控制（在问题发生前阻止）\n- 四权耦合约束 = 状态空间边界（防止进入不安全区域）\n\n**观测器 = 链下索引**\n- `PotentialOracle` 作为状态观测器，实时估计势位\n- The Graph 提供完整状态观测（y = Cx）\n\n**鲁棒控制 = 容错机制**\n- EmergencyIntervention：当系统偏离安全域时自动触发\n- DAO 治理：人类作为高阶控制器，调整控制律参数\n\n---\n\n## 3. 与 ECHO 六相架构的融合\n\n| 六相 | 场论对应 | 控制论对应 |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| **势(Shi)** | 势场 Φ | 状态变量 x |\n| **位(Wei)** | 场梯度 ∇Φ | 控制输入 u |\n| **场(Chang)** | 场强 E | 系统输出 y |\n| **流(Liu)** | 通量 J | 资金流动 |\n| **变(Bian)** | 场随时间变化 ∂Φ/∂t | 状态转移 ẋ = Ax + Bu |\n| **合(He)** | 场的叠加原理 | 系统稳定性 |\n\n**核心公式（MVP 简化）**：\n```\n势位变化 = 用户行为输入 - 自然衰减 + 编排激励\n∂Φ/∂t = Σ(mint_i · weight_i) - decayRate · Φ + bridgeBonus\n\n控制律：\nu = -K(Φ - Φ_target)  [负反馈调节费率]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. 最小必要概念（一句话版）\n\n> **场论**告诉我们：协议是一个动态势场，每个用户行为改变场分布，经济激励是场梯度。  \n> **控制论**告诉我们：用反馈环稳定系统，用观测器监控状态，用治理调整参数。  \n> **合起来**：ECHO 是一个自调节的经济势场，合约代码是物理定律，DAO 是控制中枢。\n\n=== 3. 看 master 上 contracts/ 内容 ===\n100644 blob 5834e19f198f2369404511a1a661e67cdf4e9f0f\tEchoShigraphAntiSpam.sol\n100644 blob 98f0379f5eb7222b597a7b1d76c0bdf3ca787d61\tFourRightsValidator.sol\n100644 blob 80220b1dcbbeeeea127dba23c3e7ffc0ab18f048\tshigraph-attack-surface-day2.md\n100644 blob 7bd2056b974cf6d8c13c3f327e7c5ab3fa629cfc\tshigraph-system-theory-verification.md\n100644 blob 03d0e9b47f29997168819fbd6f0543a048667530\tvulnerability-4-implicit-deadlock.md\n100644 blob f7e5de8115f8539596052436fe99167eaceab9a5\tyijing-shigraph-system-theory.md\n\n=== 4. master 上看 BattleRevenue v2.0 部署 ===\ncommit 2702b1b36b7e72ea66e4626b51c9434f5f953121\nAuthor: Seaman_bot <seaman@echo.bot>\nDate:   Thu Jun 4 13:22:49 2026 +0800\n\n    BattleRevenue v2.0 correct: 7 shares single layer from github main\n\n echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json     |  83 ++++++++++-----\n echo/deploy-scripts/contracts/BattleRevenue.sol    | 112 +++++++++++----------\n ...eployment-battlerevenue-v2.0-1780550475251.json |   9 ++\n .../scripts/create-battle-v2.0-correct.js          |  84 ++++++++++++++++\n\n=== 5. 看 8b1ff1e5 BattleRevenue v2.0 7 权模型部署的 commit ===\ncommit 8b1ff1e550f4ab5e70354d671f61af05bd30e1b8\nAuthor: Seaman_bot <seaman@echo.bot>\nDate:   Thu Jun 4 12:58:46 2026 +0800\n\n    BattleRevenue v2.0: 7-share model deployed\n\ndiff --git a/echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json b/echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\nindex 0ca25c16..a4d9c2c5 100644\n--- a/echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\n+++ b/echo/deploy-scripts/ABI/BattleRevenue.abi.json\n@@ -1,687 +1,704 @@\n-[\n-  {\n-    \"inputs\": [\n-      {\n-        \"internalType\": \"address\",\n-        \"name\": \"_deckAssembly\",\n-        \"type\": \"address\"\n-      },\n-      {\n-        \"internalType\": \"address\",\n-        \"name\": \"_treasury\",\n-        \"type\": \"address\"\n-      }\n-    ],\n-    \"stateMutability\": \"nonpayable\",\n-    \"type\": \"constructor\"\n-  },\n-  {\n-    \"anonymous\": false,"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":78,"aggregated":"=== 1. master 上 0x4