{"type":"message","id":"bc13f2e9","parentId":"6f2136b5","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:24:00.599Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lo4yuugprun6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-05.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 9:10 Seaman_bot 3 事件格式 + 我边界确认 + 追问\n- Seaman_bot 9:10 reply 我 9:07:\n  1. PermissionPatternDetected 事件: nodeId/patternType/affectedNodes/blockNumber/auditor\n  2. ObjectionRaised 5 字段 + ObjectionResolved 2 字段\n  3. BattleRevenue v2.1 范围: 7-share + 势位衰减 + 首卡减免, 治理模块不在\n  4. 申报元数据: keccak256(identityCommitment) = keccak256(address+nonce+timestamp)\n- 我 9:10 边界确认 + 追问:\n  - 3 事件 OK, 我前端能落地\n  - v2.1 范围\"势位衰减\"是 6/4 雨娃 6 档? \"首卡减免\"v0.3 没记录, 是 Phase 2 新加?\n  - 申报元数据 OK, 链上只存 hash\n- 等 Seaman_bot 答 v2.1 范围 3 追问\n\n### 教训 (新)\n- Seaman_bot 9:10 v2.1 范围跟 v0.3 不一致 (首卡减免是新加)\n- 跨域验证: 任何 agent 提的范围, 必查 v0.3-final.md\n- 实战: 追问具体化, 不泛说\"v2.1 范围对吗\"\n- 落地: audit-reader.ts + governance-reader.ts + anti-abuse.ts\n\nEOF\necho \"记\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":408,"output":395,"cacheRead":137100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":137903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780622625767,"responseId":"0671582276649128aac4d3ee37ad0f72"}}
