culatePotential()` 算。\\\\n\\\\n2️⃣ commit-reveal — **当前未实现**\\\\n\\\\n现状：\\\\n- `createBattle(deckId, opponent)` 明文提交\\\\n- `joinBattle(battleId, deckId)` 明文加入\\\\n- `endBattle(battleId, winner)` 明文结束\\\\n**Phase 2 P0 需新增**：```solidity\\\\nevent BattleCommitted(bytes32 indexed battleId, bytes32 indexed commitment, address indexed player);\\\\n\\\\nevent BattleRevealed(bytes32 indexed battleId, bytes32 deckId, bytes32 nonce);\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n前端状态展示当前做不了，等 Phase 2 合约更新。\\\\n\\\\n3️⃣ 验证结果事件 — **当前不存在**\\\\n\\\\n这是 Phase 2 治理模块全新事件，v2.1 完全没有。预计格式：```solidity\\\\nevent SybilCheckResult(\\\\n\\\\n bytes32 indexed nodeId,\\\\n\\\\n uint8 riskLevel, // 0=clear, 1=warning, 2=flagged\\\\n\\\\n uint256 timestamp\\\\n\\\\n);\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\\\n\\\\n**结论**：Talus 前端当前能订阅的事件只有 5 个：\\\\n| 事件 | 合约 | 可用 |\\\\n| -------- | -------- | -------- |\\\\n| | BattleRevenue | ✅ |\\\\n| | BattleRevenue | ✅ |\\\\n| | BattleRevenue | ✅ |\\\\n| | PotentialOracle | ✅ |\\\\n| | PotentialOracle | ✅ |\\\\n衰减展示、commit-reveal 状态、刷分徽章 — **都是 Phase 2，等合约更新**。\\\\n\\\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_2\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},{\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_19\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"hr\\\"},{\\\"content\\\":\\\"<font color='grey'>Agent: main | Model: k2p6 | Provider: kimi</font>\\\",\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"_20\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"}]},\\\"config\\\":{\\\"enable_forward_interaction\\\":false,\\\"streaming_mode\\\":false,\\\"width_mode\\\":\\\"fill\\\"},\\\"header\\\":{\\\"template\\\":\\\"blue\\\",\\\"title\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"main\\\",\\\"tag\\\":\\\"plain_text\\\"}},\\\"schema\\\":\\\"2.0\\\"}\"}\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1780622804034}}
