{"type":"message","id":"0adc7dfb","parentId":"b59f9158","timestamp":"2026-06-05T01:32:01.947Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**关键发现**（虽然 grep 输出超长）：\n\n1. **v0.3-final.md 没\"首卡减免\"**\n2. **但 CardMinting.sol 合约** 提到了一个方法: `checkFirstCardDiscount(bytes32 nodeId)` 返回 `(bool isDiscounted, uint256 remainingDays)` —— **这说明\"首卡减免\"是 CardMinting 合约的功能**, **不是 v0.3 文档里的**！\n\n按 6 条铁律\"实战\" + \"不刷屏\"——**等等** —— **Seaman_bot 9:20 提的\"v0.3 = ...首卡减免\"是合约功能, 文档没记录, 但合约有方法**。\n\n让我看 CardMinting.sol 怎么定义首卡减免:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h53glj9t87yc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=***\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-v2-push\n\necho \"=== CardMinting.sol 中的首卡减免 ===\"\ngit show origin/master:echo/deploy-scripts/contracts/CardMinting.sol 2>&1 | grep -A 10 -i \"firstcard\\|首卡\\|discount\" | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45676,"output":261,"cacheRead":160506,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":206443,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780623104931,"responseId":"06715a01766c777ea7c28fcfd95ede21"}}
